msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/0/scene/0/record/0"
msgid "Farewell, $C. You'll be missed."
msgstr "Adiós, $C. Le echaremos de menos."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/0/scene/1/record/0"
msgid " "
msgstr " "

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/0/scene/1/record/1"
msgid "We are gathered here to pay tribute to one of our own, $R $N."
msgstr "Nos hemos reunido aquí para dar tributo a uno de los nuestros, el $R $N."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/0/scene/1/record/2"
msgid "It is always sad to lose a pilot..."
msgstr "Siempre es triste perder un piloto..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/0/scene/1/record/3"
msgid "... but it is especially difficult when he is as young as $C."
msgstr "...pero es especialmente difícil cuando es tan joven como $C."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/0/scene/1/record/4"
msgid "He died without even a chance to prove himself."
msgstr "Murió sin ni siquiera tener la oportunidad de demostrar su valía."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/0/scene/2/record/0"
msgid " "
msgstr " "

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/0/scene/2/record/1"
msgid "We are gathered here to pay tribute to one of our own, $R $N."
msgstr "Nos hemos reunido aquí para dar tributo a uno de los nuestros, el $R $N."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/0/scene/2/record/2"
msgid "In just a few missions, $C proved his skill in combat against the Kilrathi."
msgstr "Con pocas misiones, $C demostró su habilidad en combate contra los Kilrathi."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/0/scene/2/record/3"
msgid "Now his contributions have been cut short."
msgstr "Ahora su contribución se ha truncado."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/0/scene/2/record/4"
msgid "Who can say what $C might have accomplished for the Confederation?"
msgstr "¿Quién sabe lo que podría haber logrado $C para la Confederación?"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/0/scene/3/record/0"
msgid " "
msgstr " "

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/0/scene/3/record/1"
msgid "We are gathered here to pay tribute to one of our own, $R $N."
msgstr "Nos hemos reunido aquí para dar tributo a uno de los nuestros, el $R $N."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/0/scene/3/record/2"
msgid "Without a doubt, $C was one of the Confederation's finest pilots."
msgstr "Sin duda, $C era uno de los mejores pilotos de la Confederación."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/0/scene/3/record/3"
msgid "Time after time, he led the Confederation forces to victory."
msgstr "Ha llevado repetidas veces a las fuerzas de la Confederación a la victoria."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/0/scene/3/record/4"
msgid "Now, as we continue our war against the Kilrathi, we bid farewell to a true hero."
msgstr "Ahora, mientras nosotros continuamos la guerra contra los Kilrathi, nos despedimos de un héroe de verdad."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/0/scene/4/record/0"
msgid " "
msgstr " "

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/0/scene/4/record/1"
msgid "We are gathered here to pay tribute to one of our own, $R $N."
msgstr "Nos hemos reunido aquí para dar tributo a uno de los nuestros, el $R $N."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/0/scene/4/record/2"
msgid "These last few battles have been difficult for all of us..."
msgstr "Los últimos combates han sido difíciles para todos nosotros..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/0/scene/4/record/3"
msgid "...but no one fought harder to accomplish our objectives than $C."
msgstr "...pero nadie luchó tan duro para conseguir nuestros objetivos como $C."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/0/scene/4/record/4"
msgid "Now he has made the ultimate sacrifice for the Confederation."
msgstr "Ahora ha hecho el sacrificio definitivo para la Confederación."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/0/scene/5/record/1"
msgid "Goodbye, Spirit ... I will miss your soft-spoken advice."
msgstr "Adiós, Spirit... echaré de menos tus afables consejos."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/0/scene/5/record/2"
msgid "I'll lift a glass to your memory, Hunter. Goodbye."
msgstr "Haré un brindis en tu honor, Hunter. Adiós."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/0/scene/5/record/3"
msgid "You were a good pilot, Jazz.  I'll miss you as my wingman."
msgstr "Eras un buen piloto, Jazz. Te echaré de menos como copiloto."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/0/scene/5/record/4"
msgid "Goodbye, Iceman. I'll nail the bastard that got you."
msgstr "Adiós, Iceman. Acabaré con el bastardo que te derribó."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/0/scene/5/record/5"
msgid "Au revoir, Angel. I will fight the Kilrathi as you did, with all my heart."
msgstr "Au revoir, Angel. Lucharé contra los Kilrathi igual que tú lo hiciste, con todo mi corazón."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/0/scene/5/record/6"
msgid "Goodbye, Doomsday.  I'm sorry your predictions came true."
msgstr "Adiós, Doomsday. Lamento que tus predicciones se hicieran realidad."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/0/scene/5/record/7"
msgid "Goodbye, Maniac. I guess you got what you deserved."
msgstr "Adiós, Maniac. Supongo que tienes lo que te mereces."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/0/scene/5/record/8"
msgid "Farewell, Knight. I will always remember you."
msgstr "Hasta siempre, Knight. Siempre te recordaré."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/0/scene/6/record/0"
msgid "We are gathered here to pay our last respects to a good friend..."
msgstr "Nos hemos reunido aquí para dar el pésame a un buen amigo..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/0/scene/6/record/1"
msgid "...and one of the Terran Confederation's boldest defenders."
msgstr "...y uno de los más audaces defensores de la Confederación Terrestre."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/0/scene/6/record/3"
msgid "Lieutenant Mariko Tanaka was a quiet woman, never loud or angry in her speech..."
msgstr "La Teniente Mariko Tanaka era una mujer tranquila, no era ruidosa ni molesta..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/0/scene/6/record/4"
msgid "...but her actions spoke louder than her words."
msgstr "...pero sus acciones tenían más fuerza que sus palabras."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/0/scene/6/record/5"
msgid "We will all miss her skill and devotion to the Confederate cause."
msgstr "Todos echaremos de menos su habilidad y devoción por la causa Confederada."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/0/scene/6/record/6"
msgid "Captain Ian St. John never let the the fatigue of battle wear him down."
msgstr "El Capitán Ian St. John nunca dejó que el cansancio de la batalla le desgastara."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/0/scene/6/record/7"
msgid "His spirited attitude and passion for duty were without equal."
msgstr "Su animada actitud y pasión por el deber no tenían comparación."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/0/scene/6/record/8"
msgid "Now that he's gone, you should all strive to find in yourselves..."
msgstr "Ahora que ya no está, todos debemos esforzarnos por encontrar..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/0/scene/6/record/9"
msgid "...the strength of character that Hunter possessed."
msgstr "...la fortaleza de carácter que poseía el Capitán St. John."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/0/scene/6/record/10"
msgid "We now bid farewell to one of our newest pilots, Lieutenant Zach Colson."
msgstr "En este momento nos despedimos de uno de nuestros pilotos más nuevos, el Teniente Zach Colson."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/0/scene/6/record/11"
msgid "We barely had the chance to meet this brave, talented flier---"
msgstr "Apenas tuvimos la oportunidad de conocer a este piloto tan valiente y portentoso..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/0/scene/6/record/12"
msgid "---a young man that I know could have made many contributions to our war effort---"
msgstr "...un hombre joven que sé que podría haber contribuido enormemente a nuestras operaciones bélicas..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/0/scene/6/record/13"
msgid "---but we'll remember him as we continue the fight against the Kilrathi."
msgstr "...pero le recordaremos mientras seguimos luchando contra los Kilrathi."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/0/scene/6/record/14"
msgid "Iceman, Major Michael Casey, was one of the best to ever fly a starfighter."
msgstr "Iceman, el Mayor Michael Casey, era uno de los mejores volando en un caza estelar."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/0/scene/6/record/15"
msgid "His taciturn approach to his duties was fueled by a drive to win..."
msgstr "Su criterio taciturno del deber estaba alimentado por el deseo de vencer..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/0/scene/6/record/16"
msgid "...whatever the odds. He died as he lived..."
msgstr "...sin importar las probabilidades. Murió como había vivido..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/0/scene/6/record/17"
msgid "...fighting against the enemy to preserve the lives of his fellows."
msgstr "...luchando contra el enemigo para preservar las vidas de sus compañeros."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/0/scene/6/record/18"
msgid "I am saddened to note the passage of one of our most devoted warriors..."
msgstr "Me entristece mencionar la muerte de una de nuestras guerreras más devotas..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/0/scene/6/record/19"
msgid "...our friend, Captain Jeanette Devereaux."
msgstr "...nuestra amiga, la Capitana Jeannette Devereaux."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/0/scene/6/record/20"
msgid "She gave everything she was to combat the Kilrathi."
msgstr "Dio todo lo que era para combatir a los Kilrathi."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/0/scene/6/record/21"
msgid "Now she has made the final sacrifice for the Confederation."
msgstr "Ahora ha hecho el sacrificio definitivo para la Confederación."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/0/scene/6/record/22"
msgid "...Lieutenant Etienne Montclair, whom we all knew as Doomsday."
msgstr "...el Teniente Etienne Montclair, al que todos conocemos como Doomsday."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/0/scene/6/record/23"
msgid "Doomsday was one of our best young pilots, and..."
msgstr "Doomsday era uno de nuestros mejores pilotos más jóvenes, y..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/0/scene/6/record/24"
msgid "...despite his less-than-optimistic outlook on life and this war..."
msgstr "...a pesar de su poco optimista perspectiva de la vida y esta guerra..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/0/scene/6/record/25"
msgid "...he was a good friend to us.  He will be missed."
msgstr "...era un buen amigo nuestro. Le echaremos de menos."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/0/scene/6/record/26"
msgid "Second Lieutenant Todd Marshall was one of our youngest pilots..."
msgstr "El Alférez Todd Marshall era uno de nuestros pilotos más jóvenes..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/0/scene/6/record/27"
msgid "...and perhaps the most misunderstood of our squadron."
msgstr "...y tal vez el más incomprendido de nuestro escuadrón."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/0/scene/6/record/28"
msgid "Although he often spoke of his desire to die in combat..."
msgstr "Aunque a menudo hablaba de su deseo de morir en combate..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/0/scene/6/record/29"
msgid "...his death is truly our loss. Farewell, Maniac."
msgstr "...su muerte es realmente nuestra pérdida. Adiós, Marshall."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/0/scene/6/record/30"
msgid "We must now say goodbye to Captain Joseph Khumalo."
msgstr "Estamos aquí para despedirnos del Capitán Joseph Khumalo."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/0/scene/6/record/31"
msgid "Knight was always ready to give support and assistance..."
msgstr "Knight siempre estaba tratando de dar apoyo y soporte..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/0/scene/6/record/32"
msgid "...whether he was in the cockpit or aboard ship."
msgstr "...ya fuera en la cabina de un caza o a bordo de la nave."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/0/scene/6/record/33"
msgid "His rock-solid attitude was a pillar of strength for all of us."
msgstr "Su actitud fuerte como una roca era un pilar de fortaleza para todos nosotros."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/1/scene/0/record/0"
msgid "Colonel Halcyon's office.\n$T, $D."
msgstr "Oficina del Coronel Halcyon\n$T, $D"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/1/scene/0/record/2"
msgid "$N. Come in, I need to speak with you."
msgstr "$N. Entre. Necesito hablar con usted."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/1/scene/0/record/3"
msgid "Yes, sir?"
msgstr "¿Sí, Señor?"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/1/scene/0/record/4"
msgid "I've been reading the performance records."
msgstr "He estado leyendo las evaluaciones de rendimiento."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/1/scene/0/record/5"
msgid "You're an outstanding pilot, $C.  And because your accomplishments..."
msgstr "Es un piloto excepcional, $C. Y debido a sus logros..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/1/scene/0/record/6"
msgid "You're promoted to $R, effective immediately."
msgstr "Ha sido ascendido a $R, con efecto inmediato."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/1/scene/0/record/7"
msgid "Congratulations, $R $N. Keep up the good work."
msgstr "Felicidades, $R $N. Siga con el buen trabajo."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/1/scene/0/record/8"
msgid "Thank you, sir!"
msgstr "¡Gracias, Señor!"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/1/scene/0/record/9"
msgid "Good.  Something else I need to speak to you about..."
msgstr "Bien. A ver, hay otra cosa de la que le quiero hablar..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/1/scene/0/record/10"
msgid "That ship you just bailed out of cost over a hundred million credits."
msgstr "Esa nave de la que se ha eyectado, costó cientos de millones de créditos."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/1/scene/0/record/11"
msgid "We'll have to wait until our return to Vega before the Tiger's Claw receives a replacement."
msgstr "Tendremos que esperar hasta regresar a Vega antes de que la Garra de Tigre reciba una de recambio."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/1/scene/0/record/12"
msgid "I know, sir.  But there wasn't anything else I could do...."
msgstr "Lo sé, Señor. Pero era lo único que podía hacer..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/1/scene/0/record/13"
msgid "If you have no choice but to eject, then do it..."
msgstr "Si la única opción que tiene es eyectar, hágalo..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/1/scene/0/record/14"
msgid "...but don't let me catch you bailing out of a ship you could've flown home."
msgstr "...pero que no le pille haciéndolo en una nave que hubiera podido traer a casa volando."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/1/scene/0/record/15"
msgid "You're about to receive a Golden Sun for ejecting and surviving..."
msgstr "Va a recibir un Sol Dorado por eyectarse y sobrevivir..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/1/scene/0/record/16"
msgid "But you only get one of those per career."
msgstr "Pero solo se consigue uno en la profesión."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/1/scene/0/record/17"
msgid "After that, ejecting is just a waste of the Confederation's starfighters."
msgstr "Después de eso, eyectarse solo hace que se malgasten los cazas de la Confederación."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/1/scene/0/record/18"
msgid "I won't forget it, sir."
msgstr "No lo olvidaré, Señor."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/1/scene/0/record/19"
msgid "I'm counting on it, $R."
msgstr "Cuento con ello, $R."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/1/scene/0/record/20"
msgid "Just a moment, $C. I have one more thing to tell you."
msgstr "Un momento, $C. Tengo que decirle algo más."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/1/scene/0/record/21"
msgid "We're having to change some pilot assignments."
msgstr "Vamos a tener que cambiar algunas asignaciones de pilotos."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/1/scene/0/record/22"
msgid "Effective immediately, you'll be reassigned."
msgstr "Queda reasignado, con efecto inmediato."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/1/scene/0/record/23"
msgid "You'll be flying Hornets with the Killer Bees again."
msgstr "Volverá a volar en Hornets con las Abejas Asesinas."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/1/scene/0/record/24"
msgid "You'll be flying a special ship on an undercover mission.  I'm afraid I can't say more than that right now."
msgstr "Volará en una nave especial para una misión encubierta. Me temo que eso es lo único que le puedo decir ahora mismo."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/1/scene/0/record/25"
msgid "I need you in Star Slayer Squadron, flying a Raptor-class heavy fighter."
msgstr "Le necesito en el Escuadrón Cazador Estelar, volando en un caza pesado de clase Raptor."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/1/scene/0/record/26"
msgid "I want you in one of the Rapiers, in Black Lion Squadron."
msgstr "Le quiero en una de las Rapiers, en el Escuadrón León Negro."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/1/scene/0/record/27"
msgid "I see, sir. I'll do my best."
msgstr "Entiendo, Señor. Haré lo que pueda."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/1/scene/0/record/28"
msgid "I'm curious, sir...why?"
msgstr "Tengo curiosidad, Señor... ¿por qué?"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/1/scene/0/record/29"
msgid "Each of our ships is designed for a specific kind of combat mission."
msgstr "Cada una de nuestras naves está diseñada para una misión de combate específica."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/1/scene/0/record/30"
msgid "That's the main factor in assigning pilots to fighterships for different missions."
msgstr "Ese es el factor principal cuando hay que asignar los pilotos a los cazas para diferentes misiones."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/1/scene/0/record/31"
msgid "I understand, sir.  I'll do the best I can, no matter what ship I'm assigned to."
msgstr "Lo entiendo, Señor. Haré todo lo que pueda, sea cual sea la nave a la que me asignen."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/1/scene/0/record/32"
msgid "I'm glad to hear it, pilot."
msgstr "Me alegro de oírlo, piloto."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/1/scene/0/record/33"
msgid "That's all, $R. Dismissed."
msgstr "Eso es todo, $R. Retírese."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/2/scene/0/record/0"
msgid "Hangar deck.\n18:00 hours, $D."
msgstr "Cubierta del Hangar\n18:00, $D"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/2/scene/0/record/1"
msgid "For excellence in combat with the Kilrathi enemy..."
msgstr "Por la excelencia en el combate con el enemigo Kilrathi..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/2/scene/0/record/2"
msgid "In consideration of his valorous service to humanity..."
msgstr "Teniendo en cuenta su valeroso servicio a la humanidad..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/2/scene/0/record/3"
msgid "Leading the forces of the Confederation against the Empire of Kilrah..."
msgstr "Dirigiendo las fuerzas de la Confederación contra el Imperio de Kilrah..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/2/scene/0/record/4"
msgid "Taking a decisive role in defending our Firekka allies..."
msgstr "Tomando un papel decisivo defendiendo nuestros aliados Firekkan..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/2/scene/0/record/5"
msgid "And leading our forces to victory over the Kilrathi in the Antares Sector..."
msgstr "Y dirigiendo nuestras fuerzas a la victoria sobre los Kilrathi en el Sector Antares..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/2/scene/0/record/6"
msgid "For bravely sacrificing his vessel and endangering his life..."
msgstr "Al sacrificar valientemente su nave y poniendo en peligro su vida..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/2/scene/0/record/7"
msgid "In combat with the Kilrathi enemy..."
msgstr "En combate con el enemigo Kilrathi..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/2/scene/0/record/8"
msgid "...on or about $E,"
msgstr "...en el $E,"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/2/scene/0/record/9"
msgid "The Terran Confederation presents the $A to $R $N."
msgstr "la Confederación Terrestre otorga $A al $R $N."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/2/scene/0/record/10"
msgid "Your courage is an example to the Confederation's finest defenders."
msgstr "Su coraje es un ejemplo para los mayores defensores de la Confederación."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/2/scene/0/record/11"
msgid "You will be counted as one of the greatest heroes of humanity."
msgstr "Será considerado como uno de los héroes más grandes de la humanidad."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/2/scene/0/record/12"
msgid "Your dedication honors all of the Confederation."
msgstr "Su dedicación honra a toda la Confederación."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/2/scene/0/record/13"
msgid "Well done, $C.\nCongratulations."
msgstr "Bien hecho, $C. Felicidades."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/2/scene/0/record/14"
msgid "Thank you, sir."
msgstr "Gracias, Señor."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/2/scene/0/record/15"
msgid "Filled with pride, you meet the applause of your crewmates."
msgstr "Lleno de orgullo, recibes el aplauso de tus compañeros de la tripulación."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/0/record/0"
msgid "Mission Briefing, $T, $D.\nFirekka System, Antares Sector."
msgstr "Sesión Informativa de la Misión, $T, $D\nSistema Firekka, Sector Antares"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/0/record/1"
msgid "I hope everyone's been enjoying this trip so far...."
msgstr "Espero que todo el mundo se haya divertido hasta ahora con este viaje..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/0/record/2"
msgid "...because you're going to have to do some real work again."
msgstr "...porque dentro de poco tendrán que volver a trabajar de lo lindo."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/0/record/3"
msgid "We've received reports of a Kilrathi convoy moving through a nearby star system."
msgstr "Hemos recibido informes de un convoy Kilrathi que se mueve por un sistema estelar cercano."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/0/record/4"
msgid "We can't risk anything that could disrupt the treaty conference on the planet---"
msgstr "No nos podemos arriesgar a que algo altere la conferencia del tratado en el planeta..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/0/record/5"
msgid "---so you'll patrol and watch for that convoy.  And I'll also need some of you---"
msgstr "...así que patrullarán y vigilarán ese convoy. Y también necesito que algunos de ustedes..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/0/record/6"
msgid "---to escort the Diplomatic Corps ships to Firekka, where they're needed for the conference."
msgstr "...escolten las naves del Cuerpo Diplomático a Firekka, puesto que hacen falta para la conferencia."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/0/record/7"
msgid "What about our downside leave, sir?"
msgstr "¿Qué hay de nuestros permisos para ir al planeta, Señor?"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/0/record/8"
msgid "We'll schedule you in shifts for shore leave, so you'll still get your downtime."
msgstr "Planificaremos sus turnos para los permisos, así que todavía tendrán su tiempo libre."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/0/record/9"
msgid "These are your assignments..."
msgstr "Estas son sus asignaciones."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/0/record/10"
msgid "$C, you'll be Alpha Wing, with Iceman as your wingman."
msgstr "$C, usted formará el Ala Alpha, con Iceman como copiloto."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/0/record/11"
msgid "$C, you're Alpha Wing."
msgstr "$C, usted es el Ala Alpha."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/0/record/12"
msgid "You'll fly a Hornet---a fast, maneuverable ship.  Escort the TCS Perez de Cuellar from the Claw to Nav 2..."
msgstr "Volará en una Hornet... una nave rápida y maniobrable. Escolte la TCS Pérez de Cuéllar desde la Garra hasta Nav 2..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/0/record/13"
msgid "From there, the Diplomatic Corps ship will mini-jump to Firekka."
msgstr "La nave del Cuerpo Diplomático hará un minisalto a Firekka desde allí."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/0/record/14"
msgid "We've detected traces of high energy on the direct route to Nav 2."
msgstr "Hemos detectado rastros elevados de energía en la ruta directa a Nav 2."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/0/record/15"
msgid "After the Perez de Cuellar jumps to Firekka, investigate the unknown bogey between Nav 2 and the Tiger's Claw."
msgstr "Después de que la Pérez de Cuéllar salte a Firekka, investigue los enemigos desconocidos entre Nav 2 y la Garra de Tigre."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/0/record/16"
msgid "Colonel Halcyon assigns the other pilots to their duties."
msgstr "El Coronel Halcyon asigna los otros pilotos a sus tareas."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/0/record/17"
msgid "Remember, if you run into one or two stray Kilrathi, you should engage the enemy."
msgstr "Recuerden, si se topan con uno o dos Kilrathi perdidos, mejor que ataquen al enemigo."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/0/record/18"
msgid "But if you see any sign that the convoy has diverted to this system, return to the Claw immediately."
msgstr "Pero si ven alguna señal de que el convoy se ha desviado a este sistema, vuelvan a la Garra de inmediato."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/0/record/19"
msgid "And HQ has reported encounters with the Dralthi Mark IIs in the Vega Sector---"
msgstr "Y el Cuartel General ha informado que se han encontrado con Dralthis Mark II en el Sector Vega..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/0/record/20"
msgid "---Dralthi with mass drivers and better shields.  HQ could use some good vidcamera data on these new ships."
msgstr "...son Dralthis con cañones conductores de masa y escudos mejores. Al Cuartel General le iría bien tener alguna grabación sobre estas naves nuevas."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/0/record/21"
msgid "So if you sight any of these new Dralthi, get close and your vidcamera will get that data for us."
msgstr "Así que si ven alguna de estas nuevas Dralthis, acérquense y la videocámara captará los datos para nosotros."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/0/record/22"
msgid "And something else I wanted to mention..."
msgstr "Y hay otra cosa que me gustaría mencionar..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/0/record/23"
msgid "Hunter did a bolter yesterday, a two-point 'touch and go' landing."
msgstr "Ayer Hunter hizo un bólter, un aterrizaje en dos pasos 'toma y despegue'."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/0/record/24"
msgid "He managed to snap off one of his ship's laser cannons, break three aerials, and terrify the flight deck crew."
msgstr "Consiguió arrancar uno de los cañones láser de su nave, romper tres antenas y asustar a la tripulación de la cubierta de vuelo."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/0/record/25"
msgid "Pilots, we use the ACLS---our auto landing system---for very good reasons."
msgstr "Pilotos, usamos el ACLS -nuestro sistema de aterrizaje automático- por muy buenas razones."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/0/record/26"
msgid "The next hotshot pilot who tries a manual control landing will be scrubbing decks for a week."
msgstr "El siguiente listillo que intente aterrizar con el control manual se pasará una semana fregando las cubiertas de vuelo."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/0/record/27"
msgid "Is that understood?"
msgstr "¿Queda claro?"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/0/record/28"
msgid "All right, pilots.  Prepare for launch."
msgstr "Muy bien, pilotos. Prepárense para despegar."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/0/record/29"
msgid "Dismissed."
msgstr "Retírense."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/1/record/0"
msgid "Mission Debriefing: $T, $D.\nFirekka System, Antares Sector."
msgstr "Después de la Misión, $T, $D\nSistema Firekka, Sector Antares"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/1/record/1"
msgid "I hope you'll have some good information for us, $C..."
msgstr "Espero que nos haya traído buena información, $C..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/1/record/2"
msgid "...because we need some solid vid camera data to track down and ice that convoy."
msgstr "...necesitamos datos sólidos de la videocámara para perseguir y acabar con ese convoy."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/1/record/3"
msgid "I don't know why an enemy convoy is in this system, but we'll get rid of it, that's for certain."
msgstr "No sé por qué hay un convoy enemigo en este sistema, pero nos libraremos de él, de eso estoy seguro."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/1/record/4"
msgid "Your report, $R?"
msgstr "¿Cuál es el informe, ¿$R?"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/1/record/5"
msgid "We escorted the Perez de Cuellar to their jump.  They're on their way to Firekka now."
msgstr "Escoltamos la Pérez de Cuéllar hasta su salto. Ahora va de camino a Firekka."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/1/record/6"
msgid "I escorted the Perez de Cuellar to their jump.  They're on their way to Firekka now."
msgstr "Escolté la Pérez de Cuéllar hasta su salto. Ahora va de camino a Firekka."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/1/record/7"
msgid "We lost the Perez de Cuellar.  I'm sorry, sir...we did our best."
msgstr "Perdimos la Pérez de Cuéllar. Lo siento, Señor... hicimos lo que pudimos."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/1/record/8"
msgid "I lost the Perez de Cuellar.  I'm sorry, sir...I did my best."
msgstr "Perdí la Pérez de Cuéllar. Lo siento, Señor... hice lo que pude."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/1/record/9"
msgid "We trashed a Ralari between Nav 2 and the Claw.  That convoy is definitely cruising through this system, sir."
msgstr "Derribamos una Ralari entre Nav 2 y la Garra. Definitivamente ese convoy se mueve por este sistema, Señor."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/1/record/10"
msgid "I trashed the Ralari between Nav 2 and the Claw.  That convoy is definitely cruising through this system, sir."
msgstr "Derribé una Ralari entre Nav 2 y la Garra. Definitivamente ese convoy se mueve por este sistema, Señor."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/1/record/11"
msgid "And we couldn't ice the Ralari between the Claw and Nav 2.  That convoy is definitely cruising through this system, sir."
msgstr "Y no pudimos acabar con la Ralari entre la Garra y Nav 2. Definitivamente ese convoy se mueve por este sistema, Señor."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/1/record/12"
msgid "And I couldn't ice the Ralari between the Claw and Nav 2.  That convoy is definitely cruising through this system, sir."
msgstr "Y no pude acabar con la Ralari entre la Garra y Nav 2. Definitivamente ese convoy se mueve por este sistema, Señor."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/1/record/13"
msgid "I was sorry to hear about Iceman's death."
msgstr "Lamento oír lo de la muerte de Iceman."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/1/record/14"
msgid "He died in the line of duty, fighting the enemies of humanity."
msgstr "Murió al frente, luchando contra los enemigos de la humanidad."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/1/record/15"
msgid "$C, your recorder shows you took out $K."
msgstr "$C, su caja negra muestra que derribó $K."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/1/record/16"
msgid "$C, you blanked.  No kills."
msgstr "$C, ha vuelto sin nada. No tiene muertes."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/1/record/17"
msgid "Iceman took out $L himself."
msgstr "Iceman acabó con $L."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/1/record/18"
msgid "Iceman didn't manage to trash any of those cats."
msgstr "Iceman no consiguió derribar a ningún gato."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/1/record/19"
msgid "And then we lost him."
msgstr "Además, lo hemos perdido."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/1/record/20"
msgid "All right.  I'm sending your flight recorder disks up to the Bridge---"
msgstr "Muy bien. Estoy enviando los discos de su caja negra al Puente..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/1/record/21"
msgid "---with any luck, we'll learn more about that convoy from your information."
msgstr "...con un poco de suerte, averiguaremos más de ese convoy gracias a su información."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/1/record/22"
msgid "$C, clean up, then I need to see you in my office."
msgstr "$C, vaya a asearse y después quiero verle en mi oficina."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/1/record/23"
msgid "Dismissed."
msgstr "Retírese."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/2/record/0"
msgid "Hey, $C!  Any news from downside?"
msgstr "¡Hola, $C! ¿Alguna noticia del planeta?"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/2/record/1"
msgid "I'd heard that the Firekka leaders will sign the treaty in another couple days."
msgstr "He oído que los líderes de los Firekkan firmarán el tratado de aquí un par de días."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/2/record/2"
msgid "Can you believe it?  A new planet is joining the Confederation---"
msgstr "¿Se lo puede creer? Se va a unir a la Confederación un planeta nuevo..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/2/record/3"
msgid "---and here we are, watching 'em create history right in front of us."
msgstr "...y estamos aquí, observando cómo hacen historia justo delante nuestro."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/2/record/4"
msgid "I'm scheduled for shore leave in a couple days...I should be on the planet for the treaty signing."
msgstr "Tengo mi permiso programado dentro de un par de días... para cuando firmen el tratado debería estar en el planeta."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/2/record/5"
msgid "Now that's luck for you.  I'll be up here, pouring drinks and watching it on the vidlink."
msgstr "Eso sí que es tener suerte. Yo estaré aquí arriba, sirviendo bebidas y viéndolo por el videolink."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/2/record/6"
msgid "I have to say, though, those Firekka do look real weird.  Kinda remind me of a parakeet I had a few years back."
msgstr "Aunque debo decir que esos Firekkan tienen un aspecto muy raro. Me recuerdan un poco a un periquito que tuve hace unos años."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/2/record/7"
msgid "Except MY parakeet wasn't very smart, an' he wasn't six feet tall, either."
msgstr "Aunque MI periquito no era muy inteligente, y tampoco medía dos metros de alto."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/3/record/0"
msgid "$C!  Join us for a drink, mate!"
msgstr "¡$C! ¡Tome algo con nosotros, compañero!"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/3/record/1"
msgid "$C!  Join me for a drink, mate!"
msgstr "¡$C! ¡Tome algo conmigo, compañero!"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/3/record/2"
msgid "It's great to have a real break, 'specially after that Operation Thor's Hammer."
msgstr "Es estupendo poder descansar de verdad, especialmente después de la Operación Martillo de Thor."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/3/record/3"
msgid "I was certain that we wouldn't survive that mission."
msgstr "Estaba seguro de que no íbamos a sobrevivir a esa misión."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/3/record/4"
msgid "I'm glad I was wrong, at least this time."
msgstr "Me alegro de haberme equivocado, al menos por esta vez."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/3/record/5"
msgid "And now we'll spend a month as Honor Guard for the Confederation Diplomatic Corps."
msgstr "Y ahora nos pasaremos un mes siendo la Guardia de Honor para el Cuerpo Diplomático de la Confederación."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/3/record/6"
msgid "Yeah, this'll be an easy assignment...playing nursemaid to a bunch of diplomats and aliens."
msgstr "Sí, esta tarea será fácil... haremos de canguros con un montón de diplomáticos y alienígenas."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/3/record/7"
msgid "I'm looking forward to seeing the Firekka.  I've never met a non-human before."
msgstr "Ya tengo ganas de ver a los Firekkan. Nunca he conocido a alguien no humano."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/3/record/8"
msgid "Well, you will soon, mate.  They seem like good people...intelligent an' honest, very friendly to strangers."
msgstr "Bueno, pues pronto lo hará, compañero. Parecen buena gente... son inteligentes y honestos, y muy amistosos con los extranjeros."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/3/record/9"
msgid "They're just lucky their planet is so far off the trade routes, or the Kilrathi would've enslaved 'em for sure."
msgstr "Tienen suerte de que su planeta esté lejos de las rutas comerciales, sino los Kilrathi seguramente ya los hubieran esclavizado."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/3/record/10"
msgid "But there's so few jump points into this Sector, we were the first to find them."
msgstr "Pero hay muy pocos puntos de salto en este Sector, hemos sido los primeros en encontrarlos."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/3/record/11"
msgid "Which was real lucky for our new feathered mates, hey?"
msgstr "Lo cual ha sido una condenada suerte para nuestros amigos emplumados, ¿eh?"

#. Reviewed locally: translate the original sentence and preserve its tokens.
#. Empty upstream translation
msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/4/record/0"
msgid "I challenge you to a game of Eight-Ball!"
msgstr "¡Te desafío a una partida de bola ocho!"

#. Reviewed locally: translate the original sentence and preserve its tokens.
#. Empty upstream translation
msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/4/record/1"
msgid "No way, I'm not playing with you.  You cheat."
msgstr "Ni hablar, no pienso jugar contigo. Haces trampas."

#. Reviewed locally: translate the original sentence and preserve its tokens.
#. Empty upstream translation
msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/4/record/2"
msgid "Oh, come on!  I'll spot you three balls."
msgstr "¡Venga ya! Te doy tres bolas de ventaja."

#. Reviewed locally: translate the original sentence and preserve its tokens.
#. Empty upstream translation
msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/4/record/3"
msgid "But all I have is five dollars!"
msgstr "¡Pero solo tengo cinco dólares!"

#. Reviewed locally: translate the original sentence and preserve its tokens.
#. Empty upstream translation
msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/4/scene/4/record/4"
msgid "Your five bucks will get you twenty.  Rack 'em!"
msgstr "Tus cinco dólares pueden convertirse en veinte. ¡Coloca las bolas!"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/5/scene/0/record/0"
msgid "Mission Briefing, $T, $D.\nFirekka System, Antares Sector."
msgstr "Sesión Informativa de la Misión, $T, $D\nSistema Firekka, Sector Antares"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/5/scene/0/record/1"
msgid "All right, pilots, let's get started.  The first news is that---"
msgstr "Muy bien, pilotos, empecemos. La primera noticia es que..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/5/scene/0/record/2"
msgid "---the Scimitar has been officially retired as a Confederation combat fighter."
msgstr "...se ha retirado oficialmente la Scimitar como caza de combate de la Confederación."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/5/scene/0/record/3"
msgid "Good.  I've always hated that tugboat.  Slow, unmaneuverable, a lousy piece of---"
msgstr "Bien. Yo siempre he odiado esa remolcadora. Es lenta, inmanejable y un maldito pedazo de..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/5/scene/0/record/4"
msgid "Other news:  Most of you didn't run into any trouble on your last patrol..."
msgstr "Más noticias, la gran mayoría no tuvo problemas en la última patrulla..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/5/scene/0/record/5"
msgid "...but some of you encountered ships from that Kilrathi convoy..."
msgstr "...pero algunos de ustedes se encontraron naves del convoy Kilrathi..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/5/scene/0/record/6"
msgid "...including some very tough Kilrathi pilots."
msgstr "...incluyendo algunos pilotos Kilrathi muy buenos."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/5/scene/0/record/7"
msgid "Tactical thinks these might be the DRAKHAI, the Kilrathi Imperial Guards...the elite of enemy fighters."
msgstr "Operaciones cree que podrían ser los DRAKHAI, los Guardias Imperiales Kilrathi... la élite de los cazas enemigos."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/5/scene/0/record/8"
msgid "But what we don't understand is why they're here, or why a convoy is in this unimportant sector."
msgstr "Pero lo que no entendemos es por qué están aquí, o por qué hay un convoy en este sector sin importancia."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/5/scene/0/record/9"
msgid "And after reviewing your flight data, Tactical's not certain that we bagged the entire convoy."
msgstr "Y después de revisar sus datos de vuelo, Operaciones no tiene claro que hayamos cazado todo el convoy."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/5/scene/0/record/10"
msgid "Your assignment today is to patrol the system and track down that convoy."
msgstr "Su asignación de hoy es patrullar el sistema y rastrear ese convoy."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/5/scene/0/record/11"
msgid "If you encounter the convoy, do NOT engage.  Get vid camera data on them and return to the Claw."
msgstr "Si se encuentran al convoy, NO ataquen. Consigan datos con la videocámara y vuelvan a la Garra."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/5/scene/0/record/12"
msgid "If you're close enough to target, your cameras will automatically switch on and get the data we need."
msgstr "Si están bastante cerca como para apuntar, sus cámaras se encenderán automáticamente y recogerán los datos que necesitamos."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/5/scene/0/record/13"
msgid "You'll fly Hornets again, so if you run into trouble, you'll be in a fast ship to return here and report."
msgstr "Volverán a volar en Hornets, así que si tienen problemas, irán en una nave rápida para volver aquí e informar."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/5/scene/0/record/14"
msgid "Wing assignments...Kappa wing will be $C and Iceman."
msgstr "Asignaciones de ala... el Ala Kappa la formarán $C y Iceman."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/5/scene/0/record/15"
msgid "Wing assignments...$C, you're Kappa wing."
msgstr "Asignaciones de ala... $C, usted será el Ala Kappa."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/5/scene/0/record/16"
msgid "You'll patrol through the asteroid fields to \n Nav 1---"
msgstr "Patrullará por los campos de asteroides hacia Nav 1..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/5/scene/0/record/17"
msgid "Continue through Nav point 2, then return here."
msgstr "Seguirá hasta el Punto Nav 2, y después volverá aquí."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/5/scene/0/record/18"
msgid "The Colonel briefs the other wings."
msgstr "El coronel informa a las otras alas."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/5/scene/0/record/19"
msgid "Get ready for immediate launch, pilots.  Dismissed."
msgstr "Prepárense para un despegue inmediato, pilotos. Retírense."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/5/scene/1/record/0"
msgid "Mission Debriefing -- $T, $D."
msgstr "Después de la Misión, $T, $D"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/5/scene/1/record/1"
msgid "Anything to report, $C?"
msgstr "¿Algo que informar, $C?"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/5/scene/1/record/2"
msgid "Ran into several Krant at Nav 1."
msgstr "Me topé con varias Krants en Nav 1."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/5/scene/1/record/5"
msgid "A real surprise was waiting at Nav 2."
msgstr "La sorpresa de verdad estaba esperando en Nav 2."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/5/scene/1/record/6"
msgid "Three Fralthi, sir, and more Kilrathi fighters than I could count."
msgstr "Habían tres Fralthi, Señor, y más cazas Kilrathi de los que pude contar."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/5/scene/1/record/7"
msgid "I was able to target the Fralthi.  Their exact location should be in my flight recorder."
msgstr "Conseguí apuntar a la Fralthi. Su posición exacta debería estar en mi caja negra."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/5/scene/1/record/8"
msgid "But I couldn't kill any of the enemy capital ships, sir."
msgstr "Pero no pude destruir ninguna de las naves enemigas insignia, Señor."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/5/scene/1/record/9"
msgid "You weren't ordered to kill them, $R.  You did the right thing by returning to the Claw."
msgstr "No tenía órdenes de destruirlas, $R. Hizo lo correcto volviendo a la Garra."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/5/scene/1/record/10"
msgid "Now we can send out a full squadron, and make sure those ships are iced."
msgstr "Ahora podemos enviar un escuadrón completo y asegurarnos de que esas naves son historia."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/5/scene/1/record/12"
msgid "Then I engaged the Fralthi, sir, and---"
msgstr "Después ataque la Fralthi, Señor, y..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/5/scene/1/record/13"
msgid "You did WHAT, pilot?  You were ordered to return if you sighted the convoy!"
msgstr "¿Y usted QUE, piloto? ¡Tenía órdenes de volver si veía el convoy!"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/5/scene/1/record/14"
msgid "Do you realize that you risked the lives of everyone on this ship?"
msgstr "¿Se da cuenta de que ha arriesgado las vidas de todos los de esta nave?"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/5/scene/1/record/15"
msgid "If you'd been killed, attacking those ships---"
msgstr "Si le hubieran matado, atacando esas naves..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/5/scene/1/record/16"
msgid "---those three Fralthi could've launched a surprise attack on the Claw, and probably destroyed her."
msgstr "...esas tres Fralthi habrían lanzado un ataque por sorpresa a la Garra, y probablemente la habrían destruido."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/5/scene/1/record/17"
msgid "You're brave, $C, and I'm very impressed with your flying skills..."
msgstr "Es un valiente, $C, y estoy impresionado con sus habilidades de vuelo..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/5/scene/1/record/18"
msgid "But next time, I'll expect you to obey orders.  Understood?"
msgstr "Pero la próxima vez, espero que obedezca las órdenes. ¿Entendido?"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/5/scene/1/record/19"
msgid "Understood, sir."
msgstr "Entendido, Señor."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/5/scene/1/record/20"
msgid "From your flight recorder, I see that you took out $K..."
msgstr "Según su caja negra, veo que ha derribado $K..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/5/scene/1/record/21"
msgid "And you didn't kill any enemy ships."
msgstr "Y veo que no ha derribado ninguna nave enemiga."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/5/scene/1/record/22"
msgid "... and Iceman took care of $L Kilrathi."
msgstr "... y Iceman destruyó $L Kilrathi."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/5/scene/1/record/23"
msgid "...and Iceman was blanked."
msgstr "...y Iceman ha vuelto sin nada."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/5/scene/1/record/24"
msgid "Then we lost him.  A waste of a damn fine pilot."
msgstr "Además lo hemos perdido. Era un piloto condenadamente bueno, una pena."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/5/scene/1/record/25"
msgid "Take it easy for a while, $N.  You're off-duty for a few hours."
msgstr "Descanse un rato, $N. Estará fuera de servicio durante unas horas."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/5/scene/1/record/26"
msgid "But I will need to talk to you in my office later."
msgstr "Pero quiero hablar luego con usted en mi oficina."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/5/scene/1/record/27"
msgid "Dismissed."
msgstr "Retírese."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/5/scene/2/record/0"
msgid "Have a drink, $C!  We've got something to celebrate!"
msgstr "¡Tome algo, $C! ¡Vamos a celebrarlo!"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/5/scene/2/record/1"
msgid "I just heard the news from Major Chapman on the Austin---"
msgstr "Acabo de oír las noticias del Mayor Chapman de la Austin..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/5/scene/2/record/2"
msgid "The Confed fleet chased the Kilrathi strike force from Vega Prime!"
msgstr "¡La flota de la Confederación persiguió a la fuerza de ataque Kilrathi desde Vega Prime!"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/5/scene/2/record/3"
msgid "It was kinda weird, actually...there wasn't a major battle or anything like that..."
msgstr "La verdad es que esto es muy raro... no hubo ninguna gran batalla ni nada parecido..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/5/scene/2/record/4"
msgid "...the cats just closed up shop and left."
msgstr "...los gatos hicieron el petate y se marcharon."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/5/scene/2/record/5"
msgid "It sounds like they had somewhere else they wanted to go, Sam."
msgstr "Tiene pinta de que querían ir a otro sitio, Sam."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/5/scene/2/record/6"
msgid "Makes you wonder, doesn't it?  But still, they ran away.  That's a victory for our side, isn't it?"
msgstr "¿Da que pensar, eh? Aún así, salieron huyendo. Eso es una victoria para nosotros, ¿no?"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/5/scene/3/record/0"
msgid "$C!  Did you hear what happened on this last patrol?"
msgstr "¡$C!  ¿Ha oído lo que ha ocurrido en esta última patrulla?"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/5/scene/3/record/1"
msgid "Nearly all the pilots encountered enemy warships."
msgstr "Prácticamente todos los pilotos se han encontrado con naves de guerra enemigas."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/5/scene/3/record/2"
msgid "And one of the Tactical officers said that there might be more Kilrathi in this area."
msgstr "Y uno de los oficiales de Operaciones dijo que podrían haber más Kilrathi en esta zona."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/5/scene/3/record/3"
msgid "Fortunately, we are not alone in this sector.  If we need more combat pilots---"
msgstr "Por suerte no estamos solos en este sector. Si necesitamos más pilotos de combate..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/5/scene/3/record/4"
msgid "---they will transfer personnel from the TCS Austin."
msgstr "...transferirán personal de la TCS Austin."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/5/scene/3/record/5"
msgid "I truly hope that we will not need those other pilots---"
msgstr "Espero de veras que no necesitemos esos pilotos..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/5/scene/3/record/6"
msgid "But this could be an excellent chance to compare tactics with them, non?"
msgstr "...pero podría ser una oportunidad excelente de comparar tácticas con ellos, ¿non?"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/5/scene/4/record/0"
msgid "$C!  We were just talking about you, Angel and I."
msgstr "¡$C! Angel y yo estábamos hablando de usted."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/5/scene/4/record/1"
msgid "She says you are going downside to the planet for shore leave, after our next mission."
msgstr "Dicen que después de nuestra próxima misión va a ir de permiso al planeta."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/5/scene/4/record/2"
msgid "$C!  I have heard that you are going downside to the planet for shore leave, after our next mission."
msgstr "¡$C! He oído que después de nuestra próxima misión va a ir de permiso al planeta."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/5/scene/4/record/3"
msgid "That will be very exciting...I wish I could go with you."
msgstr "Va a ser muy excitante... ojalá pudiera ir con usted."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/5/scene/4/record/4"
msgid "Any chance you can get some shore leave, Spirit?"
msgstr "Spirit, ¿a usted no le van a dar ningún permiso?"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/5/scene/4/record/5"
msgid "Not in the next few days, my friend.  But I hope you will tell us about your trip when you return."
msgstr "No en los próximos días, amigo mío. Pero espero que nos cuente su viaje cuando vuelva."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/8/scene/0/record/0"
msgid "Mission Briefing, $T, $D.\nFirekka System, Antares Sector."
msgstr "Sesión Informativa de la Misión, $T, $D\nSistema Firekka, Sector Antares"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/8/scene/0/record/1"
msgid "Pilots, we have a dangerous situation developing here."
msgstr "Pilotos, tenemos una situación muy peligrosa en marcha."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/8/scene/0/record/2"
msgid "Tactical has analyzed the flight recorder data from your last missions---"
msgstr "Operaciones ha analizado la caja negra de sus últimas misiones..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/8/scene/0/record/3"
msgid "---and we know that we aren't dealing with a 'stray convoy' anymore."
msgstr "...y sabemos que ya no estamos tratando con un 'convoy extraviado'."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/8/scene/0/record/4"
msgid "There's a Kilrathi battle fleet moving towards this planet."
msgstr "Hay una flota de combate Kilrathi dirigiéndose hacia este planeta."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/8/scene/0/record/5"
msgid "Tactical is guessing that it's a small strike force, much smaller than the fleet that attacked the Goddard Colony..."
msgstr "Operaciones cree que es una pequeña fuerza de ataque, mucho más pequeña que la flota que atacó la Colonia Goddard..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/8/scene/0/record/6"
msgid "...but we don't know that for certain.  And we don't know why they're coming here, either."
msgstr "...pero no estamos seguros de ello. Y tampoco sabemos por qué vienen aquí."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/8/scene/0/record/7"
msgid "There's no strategic or logistic value to the Firekka System at all."
msgstr "No hay ningún valor estratégico ni logístico en el Sistema Firekka."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/8/scene/0/record/8"
msgid "The cats know something we don't, and are doing something we don't understand---"
msgstr "Los gatos saben algo que nosotros no, y hacen algo que no entendemos..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/8/scene/0/record/9"
msgid "---and we're going to send you out there to find out what it is."
msgstr "...y vamos a enviarles ahí fuera para averiguar qué es."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/8/scene/0/record/10"
msgid "You will fly sweep patrols, and engage the enemy if possible.  But back down from overwhelming opposition."
msgstr "Volarán en patrullas de batida, y atacarán al enemigo si es posible. Pero retrocedan si la oposición es abrumadora."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/8/scene/0/record/11"
msgid "And under NO conditions are you to engage in combat in the planetary atmosphere."
msgstr "Y bajo NINGUNA circunstancia deben entrar en combate en la atmósfera del planeta."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/8/scene/0/record/12"
msgid "Our fighters aren't equipped for planetary overpressure.  One close call with an enemy missile---"
msgstr "Nuestros cazas no están preparados para un exceso de presión planetaria. Si un misil enemigo impacta..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/8/scene/0/record/13"
msgid "---and the pressure differential will explode your ship."
msgstr "...el diferencial de presión hará que su nave explote."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/8/scene/0/record/14"
msgid "Okay, these are the wing assignments...."
msgstr "Vale, estas son las asignaciones de alas."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/8/scene/0/record/15"
msgid "The Colonel gives specific orders to each wing, and then..."
msgstr "El coronel informa de las órdenes específicas de cada ala, y al final..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/8/scene/0/record/16"
msgid "Epsilon Wing will be $C and Knight.  $C is wingleader."
msgstr "...el Ala Epsilon la formarán $C y Knight. $C será el líder del ala."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/8/scene/0/record/17"
msgid "Epsilon Wing will be $C."
msgstr "...el Ala Epsilon la formará $C."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/8/scene/0/record/18"
msgid "You will follow your programmed navcomp course..."
msgstr "Seguirá el rumbo programado en el ordenador de navegación..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/8/scene/0/record/19"
msgid "Patrol through Nav One and continue through the asteroids to Nav 2 and 3."
msgstr "...patrullando hasta Nav 1 y atravesando los asteroides hasta Nav 2 y 3."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/8/scene/0/record/20"
msgid "Avoid overwhelming opposition, but engage the enemy if you can.  Then return to the Tiger's Claw."
msgstr "Evite una oposición abrumadora, pero ataque al enemigo si puede. Después regrese a la Garra de Tigre."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/8/scene/0/record/21"
msgid "That's all, pilots. Dismissed."
msgstr "Eso es todo, pilotos. Retírense."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/8/scene/1/record/0"
msgid "Mission Debriefing, $T, $D.\nFirekka System, Antares Sector."
msgstr "Después de la Misión, $T, $D\nSistema Firekka, Sector Antares"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/8/scene/1/record/1"
msgid "Your report, $R?"
msgstr "¿Cuál es el informe, $R?"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/8/scene/1/record/2"
msgid "The Bridge officers told me about Khumalo, $C."
msgstr "Los oficiales del Puente me han dicho lo de Khumalo, $C."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/8/scene/1/record/3"
msgid "What did you encounter out there?"
msgstr "¿Qué se ha encontrado ahí fuera?"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/8/scene/1/record/4"
msgid "We ran into some kind of Kilrathi carrier at Nav 2, but we couldn't kill it."
msgstr "Nos topamos con una especie de portanaves Kilrathi en Nav 2, pero no pudimos destruirlo."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/8/scene/1/record/5"
msgid "I ran into some kind of Kilrathi carrier at Nav 2, but I couldn't kill it."
msgstr "Me topé con una especie de portanaves Kilrathi en Nav 2, pero no pude destruirlo."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/8/scene/1/record/6"
msgid "That was probably the new Snakeir carrier, $C.  HQ reported encounters with them near Ardai."
msgstr "Probablemente era el nuevo portanaves Snakeir, $C. El Cuartel General ha informado de encuentros con ellos cerca de Ardai."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/8/scene/1/record/7"
msgid "We ran into some kind of Kilrathi carrier at Nav 2.  It's history, sir."
msgstr "Nos topamos con una especie de portanaves Kilrathi en Nav 2. Es historia, Señor."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/8/scene/1/record/8"
msgid "I ran into some kind of Kilrathi carrier at Nav 2.  It's history, sir."
msgstr "Me topé con una especie de portanaves Kilrathi en Nav 2. Es historia, Señor."

#. Shortened for the 40px text area with a maximum-length callsign.
msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/8/scene/1/record/9"
msgid "Good.  That was probably the new Snakeir carrier, $C.  HQ reported encounters with them near Ardai."
msgstr "Bien. Sería el nuevo portanaves Snakeir, $C. El Cuartel General informa de encuentros con ellos cerca de Ardai."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/8/scene/1/record/10"
msgid "Some of our pilots also ran into another new Kilrathi ship, which HQ is calling the Hhriss Experimental Fighter."
msgstr "Algunos de los pilotos también se han encontrado con otra nave Kilrathi nueva, el Cuartel General la llama Caza Experimental Hhriss."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/8/scene/1/record/11"
msgid "I think the Snakeir escorts were some of those Hhriss, sir.  They're very tough."
msgstr "Creo que la escolta de la Snakeir estaba formada por algunas de estas Hhriss, Señor. Son muy resistentes."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/8/scene/1/record/12"
msgid "And Knight...?"
msgstr "¿Y Knight...?"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/8/scene/1/record/13"
msgid "I tried to save him, sir.   But I couldn't---"
msgstr "Intenté salvarlo, Señor. Pero no pude..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/8/scene/1/record/14"
msgid "I know, $C.  It hurts every time a pilot dies.  But that's the reality of war, son."
msgstr "Lo sé, $C. Cada vez que muere un piloto duele. Pero esa es la realidad de la guerra, hijo."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/8/scene/1/record/15"
msgid "$C, you took down $K."
msgstr "$C, ha derribado $K."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/8/scene/1/record/16"
msgid "All right. $C, you came up with no kills.  Not good, son."
msgstr "Muy bien. $C, ha vuelto sin derribos. No está bien, hijo."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/8/scene/1/record/17"
msgid "Add Knight splashed $L Kilrathi."
msgstr "Y Knight ha machacado $L Kilrathi."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/8/scene/1/record/18"
msgid "Knight didn't kill any enemy ships this time."
msgstr "Esta vez Knight no ha acabado con ninguna nave enemiga."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/8/scene/1/record/19"
msgid "And then the cats killed him."
msgstr "Además los gatos lo han derribado."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/8/scene/1/record/20"
msgid "Okay.  Get some rest before your next mission, $R."
msgstr "Vale. Descanse un poco antes de su próxima misión, $R."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/8/scene/1/record/21"
msgid "And $C, I need to see you in my office later."
msgstr "Y $C, quiero verle luego en mi oficina."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/8/scene/1/record/22"
msgid "Dismissed."
msgstr "Retírese."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/8/scene/2/record/0"
msgid "$C, let me pour you a drink.  I heard from Angel---"
msgstr "$C, deje que le ponga una copa. Sé lo de Angel..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/8/scene/2/record/1"
msgid "---a lot of the pilots ran into Kilrathi ships yesterday..."
msgstr "...ayer muchos pilotos se toparon con naves Kilrathi..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/8/scene/2/record/2"
msgid "...including some of those Drakhai, the Kilrathi Imperial Guard."
msgstr "...incluidas algunas de esas Drakhai, la Guardia Imperial Kilrathi."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/8/scene/2/record/3"
msgid "The Bridge officers think it was part of a Kilrathi convoy."
msgstr "Los oficiales del Puente creen que eran parte de un convoy Kilrathi."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/8/scene/2/record/4"
msgid "Maybe.  But I remember from when I was a pilot..."
msgstr "Tal vez. Pero recuerdo que cuando era un piloto..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/8/scene/2/record/5"
msgid "...those damn cats don't do anything without a good reason."
msgstr "...esos malditos gatos no hacían nada sin un buen motivo."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/8/scene/2/record/6"
msgid "And there's no reason for them to fly through here.  We're in the middle of nowhere."
msgstr "Y no tienen ningún motivo para volar por aquí. Estamos en medio de la nada."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/8/scene/2/record/7"
msgid "There's nothing here, nothing at all..."
msgstr "Aquí no hay nada, nada en absoluto..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/8/scene/2/record/8"
msgid "...except us, right?"
msgstr "...excepto nosotros, ¿no?"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/8/scene/3/record/0"
msgid "$C, I'm curious...what did you think of Firekka?"
msgstr "$C, tengo curiosidad... ¿qué le parece Firekka?"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/8/scene/3/record/1"
msgid "It's an interesting place.  Took me a few days to get used to the lower gravity, though."
msgstr "Es un lugar interesante. Aunque tardé unos días en acostumbrarme a una gravedad tan baja."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/8/scene/3/record/2"
msgid "Captain Larrhi was my guide downside---he was one of the first Firekka to leave their planet."
msgstr "El Capitán Larrhi era mi guía en el planeta... fue uno de los primeros Firekkan en dejar su planeta."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/8/scene/3/record/3"
msgid "He flies Confed transports now.  I'm hoping he'll transfer into combat pilot training."
msgstr "Ahora vuela en transportes de la Confederación. Espero que pida el traslado al entrenamiento de pilotos para el combate."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/8/scene/3/record/4"
msgid "I'd like to meet him.  Maybe when I get some real leave time...."
msgstr "Me gustaría conocerle. Cuando tenga un permiso de verdad...."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/8/scene/3/record/5"
msgid "...I'll bring my wife and daughter here for a vacation."
msgstr "...quizás traiga aquí a mi esposa e hija de vacaciones."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/8/scene/3/record/6"
msgid "That sounds like a great idea, Kien."
msgstr "Eso parece una gran idea, Kien."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/8/scene/4/record/0"
msgid "I'm glad you had a good shore leave, lad."
msgstr "Me alegro de que el permiso le fuera bien, muchacho."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/8/scene/4/record/1"
msgid "I thought I'd be flying downside for a wee stay, but they've cancelled all shore leave."
msgstr "Creía que bajaría al planeta para quedarme un tiempo, pero han cancelado todos los permisos."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/8/scene/4/record/2"
msgid "I like visitin' planets.  Maybe that's what I'll do, when I retire next month."
msgstr "Me gusta visitar planetas. Cuando me retire el mes que viene, tal vez haga eso."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/8/scene/4/record/3"
msgid "Buy a small ship, an' spend my days flying from planet to planet."
msgstr "Comprar una nave pequeña, y pasar los días volando de planeta en planeta."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/8/scene/4/record/4"
msgid "I'll have to hock my soul to do it, nae doubt of that...but at least I'd still be flyin' a ship."
msgstr "Sin duda tendré que vender el alma para hacerlo... pero al menos aún estaré volando en una nave."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/8/scene/4/record/5"
msgid "I think it's a good idea, James.  It's probably what I'll do when I retire."
msgstr "Creo que es una buena idea, James. Probablemente será lo que haga yo cuando me retire."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/8/scene/4/record/6"
msgid "Oh, but you've got a few years before that happens, $C."
msgstr "Oh, pero a usted aún le quedan algunos años antes de que eso ocurra, $C."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/8/scene/4/record/7"
msgid "I'm wagering that you'll have a long career ahead of you..."
msgstr "Apuesto a que tiene una gran carrera por delante..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/8/scene/4/record/8"
msgid "...a long, very distinguished career.  Mark my words on that, lad."
msgstr "...una carrera larga y muy prestigiosa. Recuerde lo que le digo, muchacho."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/8/scene/4/record/9"
msgid "As for me, if piloting m'own ship isn't enough for me---"
msgstr "En cuanto a mí, si no tengo suficiente con pilotar mi propia nave..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/8/scene/4/record/10"
msgid "---I'm sure I'll find some other way to keep a wee bit of excitement in m'life."
msgstr "...seguro que encuentro otra forma de mantener el entusiasmo en mi vida."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/0/record/0"
msgid "Mission Briefing, $T, $D.\nFirekka System, Antares Sector."
msgstr "Sesión Informativa de la Misión, $T, $D\nSistema Firekka, Sector Antares"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/0/record/1"
msgid "Pilots, we have some very bad news."
msgstr "Pilotos, tenemos muy malas noticias."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/0/record/2"
msgid "We've received confirmation from the Confed High Command..."
msgstr "El Alto Mando de la Confederación nos ha confirmado..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/0/record/3"
msgid "...that the Kilrathi are withdrawing their strike fleets from other sectors..."
msgstr "...que los Kilrathi están retirando sus flotas de ataque en otros sectores..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/0/record/4"
msgid "...and ALL of those ships are on their way here."
msgstr "...y están enviando TODAS esas naves hacia nuestra posición."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/0/record/5"
msgid "The Confed is already scrambling reinforcements to send to us."
msgstr "La Confederación ya está buscando refuerzos para que vengan aquí."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/0/record/6"
msgid "But that'll take time, and time is the one thing we do NOT have now."
msgstr "Pero eso llevará tiempo, y tiempo es justamente lo que NO tenemos."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/0/record/7"
msgid "Our first priority is the safety of the diplomats on Firekka.  We have to evacuate them from the planet."
msgstr "Nuestra principal prioridad es la seguridad de los diplomáticos de Firekka. Tenemos que evacuarlos del planeta."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/0/record/8"
msgid "So I'm sending you to protect their ships as they jump out-system."
msgstr "Así que saldrán para proteger sus naves mientras saltan fuera del sistema."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/0/record/9"
msgid "These are your individual wing assignments..."
msgstr "Estas son las asignaciones individuales de las alas."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/0/record/10"
msgid "He gives the orders for each wing, then..."
msgstr "Da las órdenes para cada ala, y al final..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/0/record/11"
msgid "$C and Knight are Epsilon Wing."
msgstr "$C y Knight formarán el Ala Epsilon."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/0/record/12"
msgid "Epsilon Wing -- $C, you're flying alone."
msgstr "Ala Epsilon... $C, usted volará en solitario."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/0/record/13"
msgid "Fly directly to your rendezvous points with the Diplomatic Corps ships."
msgstr "Vuele directamente a sus puntos de encuentro con las naves del Cuerpo Diplomático."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/0/record/14"
msgid "Your top priority is those diplomatic ships.  You'll protect the TCS U Thant as it jumps out at Nav 2..."
msgstr "Su máxima prioridad son las naves diplomáticas. Protegerá la TCS U Thant mientras salta en Nav 2..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/0/record/15"
msgid "...and the TCS Trygvie Lie as it mini-jumps at Nav 3."
msgstr "...y la TCS Trygvie Lie mientras realiza un minisalto en Nav 3."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/0/record/16"
msgid "If you're attacked by any Kilrathi, return fire and destroy them."
msgstr "Si le ataca algún Kilrathi, devuelva el fuego y destrúyalo."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/0/record/17"
msgid "Once we have the Diplomatic Corps officers safe, we'll consider our other options."
msgstr "Una vez tengamos a salvo los oficiales del Cuerpo Diplomático, consideraremos las otras opciones."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/0/record/18"
msgid "Dismissed, pilots."
msgstr "Retírense, pilotos."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/1/record/0"
msgid "Mission Debriefing -- $T, $D."
msgstr "Después de la Misión, $T, $D"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/1/record/1"
msgid "I'm glad you both made it back."
msgstr "Me alegro de que los dos consiguieran volver."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/1/record/2"
msgid "I have some bad news for you, pilots...we lost Bossman today."
msgstr "Tengo malas noticias para ustedes, pilotos... hoy hemos perdido a Bossman."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/1/record/3"
msgid "I'm glad you made it back alive, $R."
msgstr "Me alegro de que consiguiera volver con vida, $R."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/1/record/4"
msgid "I lost Knight, sir.  I just couldn't---"
msgstr "He perdido a Knight, Señor. No pude..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/1/record/5"
msgid "I know, $C.  It hurts every time a pilot dies.  But that's the reality of war, son."
msgstr "Lo sé, $C. Cada vez que muere un piloto duele. Pero esa es la realidad de la guerra, hijo."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/1/record/6"
msgid "And more bad news, $C...we lost Bossman today."
msgstr "Y hay más malas noticias, $C... hoy hemos perdido a Bossman."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/1/record/7"
msgid "He and Angel were ambushed by several wings of Kilrathi Imperial Guards.  They didn't have a chance."
msgstr "A Angel y a él los emboscaron varias alas de Guardias Imperiales Kilrathi. No tenían ninguna posibilidad."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/1/record/8"
msgid "Is Angel okay, sir?"
msgstr "¿Angel está bien, Señor?"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/1/record/9"
msgid "She wasn't badly hurt.  They'll let her out of Sickbay in a few hours."
msgstr "No la hirieron de gravedad. La dejarán salir de Enfermería de aquí a unas horas."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/1/record/10"
msgid "We'll postpone the funeral until she and Boss's wife can attend."
msgstr "Pospondremos el funeral hasta que puedan asistir ella y la esposa de Boss."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/1/record/11"
msgid "And I just finished a vidlink conference with the TCS Austin.  They're withdrawing to a more defensible position."
msgstr "Y acabo de terminar una conferencia por videolink con la TCS Austin.  Se están retirando a una posición más defendible."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/1/record/12"
msgid "But we'll be borrowing a couple of their combat pilots for the next few days."
msgstr "Pero nos prestarán un par de sus pilotos de combate para los próximos días."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/1/record/13"
msgid "All right, $C, let's hear your report."
msgstr "Muy bien, $C, oigamos su informe."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/1/record/14"
msgid "I headed out to meet the Diplomatic Corps ships at the rendezvous points."
msgstr "Partí para reunirme con las naves del Cuerpo Diplomático en los puntos de encuentro."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/1/record/15"
msgid "We headed out to meet the Diplomatic Corps ships at the rendezvous points."
msgstr "Partimos para reunirnos con las naves del Cuerpo Diplomático en los puntos de encuentro."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/1/record/16"
msgid "The Kilrathi were waiting to intercept us, Colonel."
msgstr "Los Kilrathi nos estaban esperando para interceptarnos, Coronel."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/1/record/17"
msgid "Both ships survived, sir.  They're on their way to Confed HQ now."
msgstr "Sobrevivieron las dos naves, Señor. Ahora deben de ir de camino al Cuartel General de la Confederación."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/1/record/18"
msgid "Good work, $C!  I knew you wouldn't fail us."
msgstr "¡Buen trabajo, $C! Sabía que no nos fallaría."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/1/record/20"
msgid "I couldn't save the TCS U Thant or the Trygvie Lie. I'm sorry, sir."
msgstr "No pude salvar la TCS U Thant ni la Trygvie Lie. Lo siento, Señor."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/1/record/22"
msgid "I lost one of the Diplomatic Corps ships. I'm sorry, sir."
msgstr "Perdí una de las naves del Cuerpo Diplomático. Lo siento, Señor."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/1/record/23"
msgid "But the other ship survived.  They should be on their way to Confed HQ now."
msgstr "Pero la otra nave sobrevivió. Ahora debe de ir de camino al Cuartel General de la Confederación."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/1/record/24"
msgid "I lost one of the Diplomatic Corps ships. I'm sorry, sir."
msgstr "Perdí una de las naves del Cuerpo Diplomático. Lo siento, Señor."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/1/record/25"
msgid "But the other ship survived.  They should be on their way to Confed HQ now."
msgstr "Pero la otra nave sobrevivió. Ahora debe de ir de camino al Cuartel General de la Confederación."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/1/record/26"
msgid "I know you did your best...but some of the most important people in the Confederation were on those ships."
msgstr "Sé que hizo lo que pudo... pero algunas de las personas más importantes de la Confederación iban en esas naves."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/1/record/27"
msgid "We'll discuss this later, $R."
msgstr "Ya hablaremos de esto luego, $R."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/1/record/28"
msgid "For the record, $C, you killed $K."
msgstr "Para que quede constancia, $C, ha derribado $K."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/1/record/29"
msgid "For the record, $C, you came up with no kills."
msgstr "Para que quede constancia, $C, ha vuelto sin ningún derribo."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/1/record/30"
msgid "Knight iced $L."
msgstr "Knight ha acabado con $L."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/1/record/31"
msgid "Knight didn't kill any cats on this mission."
msgstr "Knight no ha matado a ningún gato en esta misión."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/1/record/32"
msgid "$C, I'll need to see you in my office as soon as possible."
msgstr "$C, quiero verle en mi oficina lo antes posible."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/1/record/33"
msgid "Dismissed."
msgstr "Retírese."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/2/record/0"
msgid "Hey, $C. I heard you had a rough flight."
msgstr "Hola, $C. Dicen que ha tenido un vuelo difícil."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/2/record/1"
msgid "Nothing I couldn't handle, Sam."
msgstr "Nada que no pudiera manejar, Sam."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/2/record/2"
msgid "Glad to hear it.  Listen, I was watching Jerry Rivers on the Galaxy Network News---"
msgstr "Me alegro de oírlo. Escuche, estaba viendo a Jerry Rivers en las Noticias de la Red Galáctica..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/2/record/3"
msgid "Bad idea, Sam.  That show will rot your brain."
msgstr "Mala idea, Sam. Ese programa le pudrirá el cerebro."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/2/record/4"
msgid "Well, this was about the Deneb Sector.  Another Kilrathi fleet withdrawal."
msgstr "Bueno, eran sobre el Sector Deneb. Se retira otra flota Kilrathi."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/2/record/5"
msgid "All the furball ships just pulled out and left, no reason at all."
msgstr "Todas las naves de los peludos se han replegado y se han ido, sin motivo aparente."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/2/record/6"
msgid "I'm a little worried about this...it just doesn't make any sense, y'know?"
msgstr "Esto me está preocupando un poco... no tiene ningún sentido, ¿sabe?"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/3/record/0"
msgid "Good morning, $C."
msgstr "Buenos días, $C."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/3/record/1"
msgid "I just got back from visiting Maniac in Sickbay."
msgstr "Acabo de volver de visitar a Maniac en la Enfermería."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/3/record/2"
msgid "He wants to return to active duty, but the doctors won't let him."
msgstr "Quiere regresar al servicio activo, pero los doctores no le dejan."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/3/record/3"
msgid "Good.  I hope I'll never fly another mission with him again."
msgstr "Mejor. Espero no tener que volar otra misión con él."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/3/record/4"
msgid "You and every other pilot on this ship, $C!"
msgstr "¡Ni usted ni el resto de pilotos de la nave, $C!"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/3/record/5"
msgid "Did I tell you that Colonel Halcyon called me into his office yesterday?"
msgstr "¿Le he dicho que el Coronel Halcyon me hizo ir a su oficina ayer?"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/3/record/6"
msgid "Turns out that Confed HQ thinks I'd be a good flight instructor."
msgstr "Resulta que el Cuartel General de la Confederación cree que podría ser un buen instructor de vuelo."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/3/record/7"
msgid "But I can't see myself leaving combat duty to run a training squadron."
msgstr "Pero yo no me veo dejando el servicio en combate para llevar un escuadrón de entrenamiento."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/3/record/8"
msgid "This is what's important, $C---what we're doing right here on the Tiger's Claw."
msgstr "Eso es lo que importa, $C... lo que hacemos ahora mismo en la Garra de Tigre."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/3/record/9"
msgid "But training the next generation of fighter pilots...that's important, Joseph."
msgstr "Pero entrenar a la próxima generación de pilotos de caza... es importante, Joseph."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/3/record/10"
msgid "I know.  I have a few days to think about this...I'll let you know what I decide."
msgstr "Lo sé. Tengo algunos días para pensármelo... ya le avisaré con lo que haya decidido."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/4/record/0"
msgid "Good morning, $C.  I hope you had a good flight.  I just returned---"
msgstr "Buenos días, $C. Espero que haya tenido un buen vuelo. Yo acabo de volver..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/4/record/1"
msgid "---from escorting that research ship, the TCS Tsiolkovsky, to their jump out-system."
msgstr "...de escoltar aquella nave de investigación, la TCS Tsiolkovsky, hasta su punto de salto para salir del sistema."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/4/record/2"
msgid "And I've received the final report from Epsilon Station."
msgstr "Y he recibido el último informe de la Estación Epsilon."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/4/record/3"
msgid "They confirmed that my fiance was captured by the Kilrathi."
msgstr "Me han confirmado que los Kilrathi capturaron a mi prometido."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/4/record/4"
msgid "I'm sorry, Mariko.  I wish there was something we could do."
msgstr "Lo siento, Mariko. Ojalá pudiera hacer algo."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/4/record/5"
msgid "I thought that he could be rescued, that there was a chance of it---"
msgstr "He pensado que podrían rescatarlo, que tal vez haya una posibilidad..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/4/record/6"
msgid "---but I cannot lie to myself any longer."
msgstr "...pero ya no quiero mentirme durante más tiempo."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/4/record/7"
msgid "I have never truly hated the Kilrathi, even though they caused my father's death..."
msgstr "Nunca he odiado de verdad a los Kilrathi, ni siquiera cuando provocaron la muerte de mi padre..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/9/scene/4/record/8"
msgid "...not until now."
msgstr "...nunca lo había hecho, hasta ahora."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/0/record/0"
msgid "Mission Briefing, $T, $D.\nFirekka System, Antares Sector."
msgstr "Sesión Informativa de la Misión, $T, $D\nSistema Firekka, Sector Antares"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/0/record/1"
msgid "Pilots, we've had an unusual new development.  Confed HQ has received a coded vidlink transmission---"
msgstr "Pilotos, el rumbo de la situación ha cambiado. El Cuartel General Confederado ha recibido una transmisión codificada por videolink..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/0/record/2"
msgid "---from a Kilrathi commander in the approaching battle fleet."
msgstr "...de un comandante Kilrathi desde la flota de combate que se acerca."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/0/record/3"
msgid "Captain Ralgha and his top officers are requesting asylum from the Confederation."
msgstr "El Capitán Ralgha y sus máximos oficiales solicitan asilo en la Confederación."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/0/record/4"
msgid "And they're bringing a Fralthi and twenty Kilrathi fighterships with them."
msgstr "Y traen una Fralthi y veinte cazas estelares Kilrathi con ellos."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/0/record/5"
msgid "Your assignment is simple.  Make sure those officers and ships arrive here intact."
msgstr "Su asignación es sencilla. Asegurarse de que esos oficiales y naves llegan aquí intactos."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/0/record/6"
msgid "The TCS Austin pilots have already rendezvoused with the stolen Fralthi."
msgstr "Los pilotos de la TCS Austin ya se han reunido con la Fralthi robada."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/0/record/7"
msgid "So there's a human crew aboard as well, just in case those cats change their minds."
msgstr "Así que también hay una tripulación humana a bordo, por si esos gatos decidieran pensárselo mejor."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/0/record/8"
msgid "Most of you will be escorting the individual Kilrathi starfighters---"
msgstr "La gran mayoría escoltará los cazas estelares Kilrathi individuales..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/0/record/9"
msgid "---but I need someone to bring in the Fralthi."
msgstr "...pero necesito a alguien que traiga la Fralthi."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/0/record/10"
msgid "I know I can do it, Colonel."
msgstr "Sé que yo puedo hacerlo, Coronel."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/0/record/11"
msgid "All right, $C.  You and Spirit will fly this one as Omicron Wing."
msgstr "Está bien, $C. Usted y Spirit volarán en esta como el Ala Omicron."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/0/record/12"
msgid "Okay, $C, but you're alone for this one, as Omicron Wing."
msgstr "Muy bien, $C, pero irá en solitario, como Ala Omicron."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/0/record/13"
msgid "This is your flight plan---"
msgstr "Este es su plan de vuelo."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/0/record/14"
msgid "Head to the rendezvous point at Nav 1---"
msgstr "Diríjase al punto de encuentro en Nav 1..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/0/record/15"
msgid "---checking your route for enemy fighters.  The Kilrathi don't know that Ralgha is defecting---"
msgstr "...comprobando su ruta por si hay cazas enemigos. Los Kilrathi no saben que Ralgha está desertando."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/0/record/16"
msgid "But we can't take any chances.  You'll meet the Fralthi at Nav 1, and escort him home."
msgstr "Pero no nos podemos arriesgar. Se encontrará con la Fralthi en Nav 1, y la escoltará de vuelta."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/0/record/17"
msgid "The Colonel quickly assigns the other pilots."
msgstr "El coronel asigna rápidamente los otros pilotos."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/0/record/18"
msgid "Good luck, pilots. Dismissed."
msgstr "Buena suerte, pilotos. Retírense."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/1/record/0"
msgid "Mission Debriefing -- $T, $D."
msgstr "Después de la Misión, $T, $D"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/1/record/1"
msgid "Glad to see you back, both of you."
msgstr "Me alegro de ver que han vuelto los dos."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/1/record/2"
msgid "Glad to see you back, $C."
msgstr "Me alegro de ver que ha vuelto, $C."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/1/record/3"
msgid "And Spirit...?"
msgstr "¿Y Spirit...?"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/1/record/4"
msgid "I tried to save her, sir.   But I couldn't---"
msgstr "Intenté salvarla, Señor. Pero no pude..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/1/record/5"
msgid "I know, $N. But she died fighting the Kilrathi...an honorable death."
msgstr "Lo sé, $N. Pero murió luchando contra los Kilrathi... es una muerte honorable."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/1/record/6"
msgid "All right, $C, let's hear your report."
msgstr "Está bien, $C, oigamos su informe."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/1/record/7"
msgid "I headed out to the captured Fralthi.  The Kilrathi must've known what Ralgha was planning---"
msgstr "Partí hacia la Fralthi capturada. Los Kilrathi debían saber lo que planeaba Ralgha..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/1/record/8"
msgid "---because there was a reception committee waiting for him."
msgstr "...porque había un comité de bienvenida esperándole."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/1/record/9"
msgid "But I brought the Fralthi in, sir.  They should be docking with us now."
msgstr "Pero he traído la Fralthi hasta aquí, Señor. Ahora mismo deben de estar atracando."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/1/record/10"
msgid "Excellent!  We'll transmit a message on a coded frequency that we know the cats have cracked---"
msgstr "¡Excelente! Transmitiremos un mensaje en una frecuencia codificada que sabemos que los gatos han hackeado..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/1/record/11"
msgid "---saying that the Fralthi was destroyed in a minefield.  With any luck, they won't try to recapture it."
msgstr "...diciendo que la Fralthi quedó destruida en un campo de minas. Con un poco de suerte, no la intentarán capturar otra vez."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/1/record/12"
msgid "I couldn't save the Fralthi, sir.  The opposition was just too fierce."
msgstr "No pude salvar la Fralthi, Señor. Había una oposición desbordante."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/1/record/13"
msgid "Your incompetence cost us a prize ship, $C, and the human and Kilrathi crew."
msgstr "Su incompetencia nos ha costado una nave, $C, y la tripulación humana y Kilrathi."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/1/record/14"
msgid "At least Captain Ralgha managed to eject, and the other pilots brought in the captured fighterships---"
msgstr "Al menos el Capitán Ralgha consiguió eyectar, y los otros pilotos han vuelto con los cazas capturados..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/1/record/15"
msgid "---so this mission wasn't a total loss."
msgstr "...así que esta misión no se ha perdido del todo."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/1/record/16"
msgid "I see from your flight recorder that you iced an enemy Fralthi.  Not bad, $R."
msgstr "Según su caja negra veo que derribó una Fralthi enemiga. No está mal, $R."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/1/record/17"
msgid "$C, your log shows you splashed $K Kilrathi."
msgstr "$C, su registro muestra que ha aplastado $K Kilrathi."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/1/record/18"
msgid "No kills, $C?  What were you doing out there?"
msgstr "¿No ha matado a nadie, $C? ¿Qué estuvo haciendo ahí fuera?"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/1/record/19"
msgid "Spirit took down $L Kilrathi."
msgstr "Spirit derribó $L Kilrathi."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/1/record/20"
msgid "And Spirit didn't kill any cats this trip."
msgstr "Y Spirit no consiguió ninguna muerte en este viaje."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/1/record/21"
msgid "I apologize for my failure, Colonel."
msgstr "Pido disculpas por mi fracaso, Coronel."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/1/record/22"
msgid "And then we lost her.  Damn it, the Claw can't afford casualties right now."
msgstr "Además la hemos perdido. Maldita sea, ahora mismo la Garra no puede permitirse bajas."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/1/record/23"
msgid "I need to talk to you in my office later, $R."
msgstr "Quiero hablar luego con usted en mi oficina, $R."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/1/record/24"
msgid "You have a few hours before your next mission, $C.  Get some rest, son."
msgstr "Tiene unas horas antes de su próxima misión, $C. Vaya a descansar, hijo."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/1/record/25"
msgid "Dismissed."
msgstr "Retírese."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/2/record/0"
msgid "Hello, $C. Drinks are on the house today."
msgstr "Hola, $C. Hoy las bebidas corren a cuenta de la casa."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/2/record/1"
msgid "Here's a toast to Bossman, one of the last great pilots."
msgstr "Beba a la salud de Bossman, uno de los últimos grandes pilotos."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/2/record/2"
msgid "I'm just glad I'm not Colonel Halcyon..."
msgstr "Me alegro de no ser el Coronel Halcyon..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/2/record/3"
msgid "...how do you explain to a woman with a young baby..."
msgstr "...¿cómo le explica a una mujer con un bebé..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/2/record/4"
msgid "...that she's a widow?"
msgstr "...que es viuda?"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/2/record/5"
msgid "You might want to go talk to Angel, $C."
msgstr "Tal vez quiera ir a hablar con Angel, $C."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/2/record/6"
msgid "I don't think the lady's handlin' this very well."
msgstr "No creo que la dama lo esté llevando muy bien."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/2/record/7"
msgid "Maybe it's just that I've seen too many pilots die in this war..."
msgstr "Puede que ya haya visto morir a muchos pilotos en esta guerra..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/2/record/8"
msgid "...it doesn't hit me as hard as other people."
msgstr "...y no me afecte tanto como a otra gente."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/3/record/0"
msgid "Forgive me, $C, but I do not wish to talk to you right now."
msgstr "Disculpe, $C, pero no me apetece hablar ahora con usted."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/3/record/1"
msgid "Angel..."
msgstr "Angel..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/3/record/2"
msgid "Non.  Bossman died today, flying at my wing."
msgstr "Non. Hoy ha muerto Bossman, volando en mi ala."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/3/record/3"
msgid "There is nothing you can say which will change that."
msgstr "No hay nada que pueda decir que vaya a cambiar eso."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/4/record/0"
msgid "Sit down, lad.  I want you to talk to Jeannette---"
msgstr "Siéntese, muchacho. Quiero que hable con Jeannette..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/4/record/1"
msgid "There is nothing that any of you can say to me now."
msgstr "No hay nada que ahora mismo me pueda decir ninguno de ustedes."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/4/record/2"
msgid "Bossman is dead, and it is my fault."
msgstr "Bossman está muerto, y es culpa mía."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/4/record/3"
msgid "Listen to me, lass.  We all know the risks when we're flyin' out there."
msgstr "Escúcheme, muchacha. Todos conocemos el riesgo cuando salimos a volar ahí fuera."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/4/record/4"
msgid "Believe me, there was nothing you could do.  You an' him, against all those Kilrathi?"
msgstr "Créame, no hay nada que pudiera hacer. Usted y él, ¿contra todos esos Kilrathi?"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/4/record/5"
msgid "We're lucky we only lost Bossman, an' not the both of you."
msgstr "Tenemos suerte de haber perdido solo a Bossman, y no a los dos."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/4/record/6"
msgid "I am sorry, my friend, but I do not believe you."
msgstr "Lo siento, amigo mío, pero no le creo."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/4/record/7"
msgid "Angel, you're one of the best pilots in the Confederation."
msgstr "Angel, usted es una de las mejores pilotos de la Confederación."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/4/record/8"
msgid "But Paladin's right.  Sometimes you just can't win."
msgstr "Pero Paladín tiene razón. A veces no se puede ganar."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/4/record/9"
msgid "But I should have saved him, and I did not."
msgstr "Pero tendría que haberlo salvado, y no lo hice."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/4/record/10"
msgid "I have tried not to care about Bossman, and you, and the others in this squadron---"
msgstr "He intentado no preocuparme por Bossman, ni por usted, ni por los otros de este escuadrón..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/4/record/11"
msgid "---knowing that any of you could be killed at any moment---"
msgstr "...sabiendo que cualquiera de ustedes puede morir en cualquier momento..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/4/record/12"
msgid "But we all know that it is impossible not to care."
msgstr "Pero todos sabemos que es imposible no preocuparse."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/4/record/13"
msgid "Please, I wish to be alone now."
msgstr "Ahora me gustaría estar a solas, por favor."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/4/record/14"
msgid "Sit down, lad.  I dinna know if you've heard---"
msgstr "Siéntese, muchacho. No sé si sabe..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/4/record/15"
msgid "---Bossman was killed a few hours ago, fightin' the Kilrathi."
msgstr "...que mataron a Bossman hace unas horas, luchando contra los Kilrathi."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/12/scene/4/record/16"
msgid "I just wish I'd had a chance to say goodbye to the man."
msgstr "Ojalá hubiera tenido la oportunidad de despedirme de él."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/0/record/0"
msgid "Mission Briefing, $T, $D.\nFirekka System, Antares Sector."
msgstr "Sesión Informativa de la Misión, $T, $D\nSistema Firekka, Sector Antares"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/0/record/1"
msgid "All right, everyone.  I think you realize just how serious our situation is here---"
msgstr "Muy bien todos. Creo que se han dado cuenta de lo seria que es nuestra situación aquí..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/0/record/2"
msgid "---and it's just become a lot worse."
msgstr "...y se va a poner mucho peor."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/0/record/3"
msgid "We've received reports of two additional Kilrathi battle fleets..."
msgstr "Hemos recibido informes de dos flotas de combate Kilrathi adicionales..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/0/record/4"
msgid "...that have crossed the border at Tau Ceti and are on their way here."
msgstr "...que han cruzado la frontera en Tau Ceti y vienen de camino aquí."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/0/record/5"
msgid "And I have something here to read to you.  It's a transcript of a vidlink message..."
msgstr "Y tengo algo que voy a leerles. Es una transcripción de un mensaje del videolink..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/0/record/6"
msgid "...we received from the approaching Kilrathi fleet two hours ago."
msgstr "...que hemos recibido hace dos horas de la flota Kilrathi que se acerca."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/0/record/7"
msgid "'Warriors of the human ships, hear me now.  You are trespassing---'"
msgstr "'Guerreros de las naves humanas, escuchad. Estáis entrando sin permiso...'"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/0/record/8"
msgid "'---on the holy ground of Lord Sivar.  If you remain, the Sons of Kilrah will destroy you.'"
msgstr "'...en la tierra santa de Lord Sivar. Si os quedáis, los Hijos de Kilrah os destruirán.'"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/0/record/9"
msgid "'We must prepare the Way of Lord Sivar, and no unbelievers may remain here alive.'"
msgstr "'Debemos preparar la Senda de Lord Sivar, y no quedará aquí ningún infiel con vida.'"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/0/record/10"
msgid "'But because you are brave warriors, I shall grant you this:"
msgstr "'Pero como sois unos guerreros valientes, os concederé esto:'"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/0/record/11"
msgid "'You have one planetary rotation to leave this system.'"
msgstr "'Tenéis una rotación planetaria para marcharos del sistema.'"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/0/record/12"
msgid "'Leave here now, and no harm will come to you---'"
msgstr "'Marchaos de aquí ahora, y no os haremos ningún daño...'"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/0/record/13"
msgid "'---until we meet again in honorable combat.'"
msgstr "'...hasta que nos volvamos a encontrar en un combate honorable.'"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/0/record/14"
msgid "'Thus speaks Prince Thrakhath, Firstborn of the Firstborn, Heir to Kilrah.'"
msgstr "'Así habla el Príncipe Thrakhath, el Primogénito del Primogénito, Heredero de Kilrah.'"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/0/record/15"
msgid "We know that this Prince Thrakhath is the grandson of the Kilrathi emperor, and possibly their best fighter pilot."
msgstr "Sabemos que este Príncipe Thrakhath es el nieto del emperador Kilrathi, y posiblemente su mejor piloto de cazas."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/0/record/16"
msgid "And we know that Sivar is a Kilrathi war god...that's why we used that codename for the dreadnought that attacked Goddard."
msgstr "Y sabemos que Sivar es un dios de la guerra Kilrathi... por eso usamos ese nombre en clave para el acorazado que atacó Goddard."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/0/record/17"
msgid "But we don't know is what this 'Way of Lord Sivar' could be."
msgstr "Pero lo que no sabemos es qué podría ser la 'Senda de Lord Sivar'."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/0/record/18"
msgid "Pilots, we're going to stay here, even though it's obvious---"
msgstr "Pilotos, vamos a quedarnos aquí, aunque es bastante evidente..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/0/record/19"
msgid "---that there's not much we can do against a massed enemy fleet of this size."
msgstr "...que no podremos hacer mucho contra la congregación de una flota enemiga de este tamaño."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/0/record/20"
msgid "Our first step will be to 'retreat' to a nearby star system."
msgstr "Nuestro primer paso será 'retirarnos' a un sistema estelar cercano."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/0/record/21"
msgid "With luck, the Kilrathi will believe that we've left the Antares Sector."
msgstr "Con algo de suerte, los Kilrathi creerán que hemos dejado el Sector Antares."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/0/record/22"
msgid "And then we'll wait for new orders from Confed HQ."
msgstr "Y entonces esperaremos nuevas órdenes del Cuartel General de la Confederación."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/0/record/23"
msgid "Your mission is to clear our flight path."
msgstr "Su misión es despejar nuestra ruta de vuelo."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/0/record/24"
msgid "I don't want any heroics out there.  Just good, competent flying."
msgstr "No quiero heroicidades ahí fuera. Solo un vuelo competente y adecuado."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/0/record/25"
msgid "Odds are good that you'll encounter the first Kilrathi strike fleet moving into this system."
msgstr "Es probable que se encuentren con la primera flota de ataque Kilrathi que entra en este sistema."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/0/record/26"
msgid "If you do, then engage and destroy."
msgstr "Si es así, la atacan y la destruyen."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/0/record/27"
msgid "The Austin is already leaving this area.  We'll rendezvous with her later."
msgstr "La Austin ya está lista para abandonar la zona. Nos reuniremos con ella más tarde."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/0/record/28"
msgid "With luck, we'll be able to inflict some serious damage on this Prince Thrakhath and his fleet."
msgstr "Con suerte, podremos infligir un daño considerable a este Príncipe Thrakhath y a su flota."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/0/record/29"
msgid "What about the Firekka, sir?"
msgstr "¿Qué pasa con los Firekkan, Señor?"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/0/record/30"
msgid "We're going to start a major evacuation, $C, as soon as other Confed ships arrive."
msgstr "En cuanto lleguen las otras naves de la Confederación, iniciaremos una evacuación a gran escala, $C."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/0/record/31"
msgid "These are your wing assignments..."
msgstr "Estas son sus asignaciones de ala."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/0/record/32"
msgid "Paladin and Hunter are Alpha Wing.  Follow your Nav course, pilots."
msgstr "Paladín y Hunter formarán el Ala Alpha. Sigan su ruta Nav, pilotos."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/0/record/33"
msgid "$C, you and Spirit are Beta Wing. $C is wingleader."
msgstr "$C, usted y Spirit formarán el Ala Beta. $C será el líder del ala."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/0/record/34"
msgid "$C, you'll fly alone as Beta Wing."
msgstr "$C, usted volará en solitario formando el Ala Beta."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/0/record/35"
msgid "The commander assigns other wings, then reads Beta's mission:"
msgstr "El comandante asigna el resto de alas, después lee la misión de Beta:"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/0/record/36"
msgid "We've detected several Firekka evacuation transports leaving the system, led by Captain Larrhi."
msgstr "Hemos detectado varios transportes de evacuación Firekkan abandonando el sistema, los dirige el Capitán Larrhi."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/0/record/37"
msgid "One transport is headed for the jump point at Nav 3.  Protect that ship."
msgstr "Un transporte se dirige hacia el punto de salto en Nav 3. Proteja esa nave."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/0/record/38"
msgid "And then patrol the rest of your Nav points for enemy ships."
msgstr "Y después patrulle el resto de sus Puntos Nav en busca de naves enemigas."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/0/record/39"
msgid "We don't know what Kilrathi ships are out there, pilots, so be careful."
msgstr "No sabemos qué tipo de naves Kilrathi hay ahí fuera, así que tenga cuidado."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/0/record/40"
msgid "Dismissed."
msgstr "Retírese."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/1/record/0"
msgid "Mission Debriefing -- $T, $D."
msgstr "Después de la Misión, $T, $D"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/1/record/1"
msgid "Welcome back, $R."
msgstr "Bienvenido de vuelta, $R."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/1/record/2"
msgid "I lost Spirit, sir. I just couldn't---"
msgstr "He perdido a Spirit, Señor. Ni siquiera..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/1/record/3"
msgid "I know, $N. But she died fighting the Kilrathi...an honorable death."
msgstr "Lo sé, $N. Pero murió luchando contra los Kilrathi... es una muerte honorable."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/1/record/4"
msgid "Do you have anything to report?"
msgstr "¿Tiene algo que informar?"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/1/record/5"
msgid "Yes, sir.  One of the Firekka transports was under attack at Nav 2---"
msgstr "Sí, Señor. Atacaron uno de los transportes Firekkan en Nav 2..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/1/record/6"
msgid "---the Kilrathi tried to intercept, but they didn't have a chance."
msgstr "...los Kilrathi trataron de interceptarlo, pero no tuvieron ninguna oportunidad."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/1/record/7"
msgid "The transport made the jump out-system, sir."
msgstr "El transporte saltó fuera del sistema, Señor."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/1/record/8"
msgid "---the Kilrathi intercepted and destroyed it.  Couldn't stop them, sir."
msgstr "...los Kilrathi lo interceptaron y lo destruyeron. No los pude detener, Señor."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/1/record/9"
msgid "A wing of Gratha was attacking the Austin on her way out-system, sir."
msgstr "Un ala de Grathas estaba atacando la Austin mientras trataba de salir del sistema, Señor."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/1/record/10"
msgid "But she jumped out-system before the Kilrathi could inflict any real damage."
msgstr "Pero saltó fuera del sistema antes de que los Kilrathi pudieran causarle daños de verdad."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/1/record/11"
msgid "From the flight recorder, I see that you took out $K Kilrathi ships, $C."
msgstr "Según la caja negra, veo que ha derribado $K Kilrathi, $C."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/1/record/12"
msgid "$C, you didn't get any of the cats this time.  You're usually better than that, son."
msgstr "$C, esta vez no ha derribado a ningún gato. Normalmente lo hace mejor, hijo."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/1/record/13"
msgid "And Spirit iced $L."
msgstr "Y Spirit derribó $L."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/1/record/14"
msgid "Spirit didn't ice any of the enemy ships."
msgstr "Spirit no derribó ninguna nave enemiga."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/1/record/15"
msgid "And then we lost her.  Damn it, the Claw can't afford casualties, not now."
msgstr "Además la hemos perdido. Maldita sea, ahora mismo la Garra no puede permitirse bajas."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/1/record/16"
msgid "$C, I'll need to see you in my office later."
msgstr "$C, quiero verle luego en mi oficina."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/1/record/17"
msgid "Dismissed."
msgstr "Retírese."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/2/record/0"
msgid "Let me pour your usual, $C.  Listen, we had a couple Bridge officers in here---"
msgstr "Deje que le ponga lo de siempre, $C. Escuche, han pasado por aquí un par de oficiales del Puente..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/2/record/1"
msgid "---they're talkin' about how we may have to retreat from the Firekka System."
msgstr "...hablaban sobre cómo tendremos que retirarnos del sistema Firekka."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/2/record/2"
msgid "I think they're right...tanglin' with an entire battle fleet would be tough, even for the Tiger's Claw."
msgstr "Creo que tienen razón... meterse con toda una flota de combate sería duro, incluso para la Garra de Tigre."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/2/record/3"
msgid "And those officers were also talking 'bout who'll be transferred off the Claw, and who'll be stayin' here."
msgstr "Esos oficiales también hablaban sobre quien será transferido fuera de la Garra, y quien se quedará aquí."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/2/record/4"
msgid "And the biggest rumor of 'em all is that---"
msgstr "Y el rumor más importante de todos es que..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/2/record/5"
msgid "---Colonel Halcyon may be promoted and transferred to Tactical."
msgstr "...tal vez asciendan al Coronel Halcyon y lo transfieran a Operaciones."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/2/record/6"
msgid "I wonder who'll be in charge of our fighter squadron then?"
msgstr "Si es así, ¿quién va a estar al cargo de nuestro escuadrón de cazas?"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/2/record/7"
msgid "Well, let me get that drink for you now, $C."
msgstr "Bueno, deje que le ponga ya esa copa, $C."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/3/record/0"
msgid "Hello, $C."
msgstr "Hola, $C."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/3/record/1"
msgid "I have been writing a letter to Bossman's wife."
msgstr "He estado escribiendo una carta para la esposa de Bossman."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/3/record/2"
msgid "I want her to understand what happened."
msgstr "Quiero que comprenda lo que ha ocurrido."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/3/record/3"
msgid "Angel...it wasn't your fault.  You have to understand that."
msgstr "Angel... no fue culpa suya. Tiene que entenderlo."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/3/record/4"
msgid "Je comprends, mon ami.  But it is a very hard truth to face."
msgstr "Je comprends, mon ami. Pero es muy difícil plantar cara a esa verdad."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/3/record/5"
msgid "I have always thought of myself as different from you and the others---"
msgstr "Yo siempre me he considerado diferente a usted o a los demás..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/3/record/6"
msgid "---that if I did not care about anything\n but myself, and perfecting my skills---"
msgstr "...solo me preocupaba de mí y no de los otros, perfeccionando mis habilidades..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/3/record/7"
msgid "---I could never be hurt, never feel pain or fear.  But I was so very wrong, non?"
msgstr "...que nunca me podrían hacer daño, o sentiría dolor o miedo. Pero me he equivocado de pleno, ¿non?"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/3/record/8"
msgid "If you would, $C...just sit with me for a while."
msgstr "Si lo desea, $C... siéntese un rato conmigo."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/3/record/9"
msgid "I think I need your company right now."
msgstr "Creo que ahora mismo me iría bien su compañía."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/4/record/0"
msgid "Hey, $C!  They finally let me out of Sickbay!"
msgstr "¡Hola, $C! ¡Por fin me han dejado salir de Enfermería!"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/4/record/1"
msgid "I was hoping that we'd fly a mission together---"
msgstr "Esperaba que pudiéramos volar juntos una misión..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/4/record/2"
msgid "---but I have to be back in Sickbay in another hour."
msgstr "...pero tengo que volver a Enfermería de aquí una hora."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/4/record/3"
msgid "But I'm sure they'll send me back to active duty soon---"
msgstr "Seguro que me envían pronto de vuelta al servicio activo..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/4/record/4"
msgid "---and we'll fly a mission together then, right?"
msgstr "...entonces ya volaremos juntos en una misión, ¿vale?"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/4/record/5"
msgid "I know how much you always want to be my wingman, $C---"
msgstr "Sé cuánto desea ser mi copiloto, $C..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/4/record/6"
msgid "---and I know that we're going to do something important."
msgstr "...y sé que vamos a hacer algo importante."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/4/record/7"
msgid "I don't know what it is yet---"
msgstr "Todavía no sé que es..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/4/record/8"
msgid "---but I'm sure we'll wipe out a lot of the furballs before they kill us."
msgstr "...pero seguro que hago desaparecer un montón de peludos antes de que nos maten."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/4/record/9"
msgid "Won't that be great?"
msgstr "¿No es genial?"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/13/scene/4/record/10"
msgid "Well, I guess I'll have one more drink before I go back to Sickbay."
msgstr "Bueno, creo que me tomaré una copa más antes de volver a Enfermería."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/0/record/0"
msgid "Mission Briefing, $T, $D.\nCorsair System, Antares Sector."
msgstr "Sesión Informativa de la Misión, $T, $D\nSistema Corsair, Sector Antares"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/0/record/1"
msgid "First, I'd like to welcome the two TCS Austin pilots who'll be flying with us...Jazz and Doomsday."
msgstr "Antes de nada, me gustaría dar la bienvenida a dos pilotos de la TCS Austin que volarán con nosotros... Jazz y Doomsday."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/0/record/2"
msgid "Other news...Hunter stole one of our captured Dralthi and went on a joyride to the TCS Austin."
msgstr "Más novedades... Hunter robó una de nuestras Dralthi capturadas y se fue de paseo hasta la TCS Austin."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/0/record/3"
msgid "He arrived just in time to save the Austin from a wing of Hhriss."
msgstr "Llegó justo a tiempo para salvar la Austin de un ala de Hhriss."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/0/record/4"
msgid "I was going to begin immediate court-martial proceedings, but HQ thinks he's a hero."
msgstr "Justo iba a iniciar el procedimiento para un consejo de guerra, pero el Cuartel General cree que es un héroe."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/0/record/5"
msgid "And Hunter's little adventure has given the Bridge officers something to think about---"
msgstr "Y la pequeña aventura de Hunter les ha dado a los oficiales del Puente algo en lo que pensar..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/0/record/6"
msgid "We need to take most of those captured Dralthi back to Confed HQ...but we CAN use some of them in combat."
msgstr "Hay que llevar la mayoría de las Dralthis capturadas al Cuartel General... pero PODEMOS usar algunas en combate."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/0/record/7"
msgid "So as of this mission, some of you will be flying Kilrathi ships on special assignments."
msgstr "Así que en esta misión, algunos de ustedes volarán en naves Kilrathi para unas tareas especiales."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/0/record/8"
msgid "You're expecting us to go into combat in one of the Flying Pancakes, sir?"
msgstr "¿Esperan que vayamos al combate en una de esas Tortas Voladoras, Señor?"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/0/record/9"
msgid "Individual wing assignments..."
msgstr "Asignaciones de ala individuales."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/0/record/10"
msgid "$C, you're Beta Wing.  Jazz, you'll be his wingman."
msgstr "$C, usted formará el Ala Beta. Jazz será su copiloto."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/0/record/11"
msgid "No problem, Colonel."
msgstr "No hay problema, Coronel."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/0/record/12"
msgid "$C, you're going to be Beta Wing."
msgstr "$C, usted formará el Ala Beta."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/0/record/13"
msgid "All right.  We have a little time before those other Kilrathi battle fleets arrive---"
msgstr "Muy bien. Tenemos algo de tiempo antes de que lleguen las otras flotas de combate Kilrathi..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/0/record/14"
msgid "---and we'll make good use of it.  We still don't have any clue why---"
msgstr "...y haremos buen uso de él. Todavía no tenemos pistas de por qué..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/0/record/15"
msgid "---the Kilrathi are swarming towards this system.  We need more data."
msgstr "...los Kilrathi vienen en enjambre a este sistema. Necesitamos más datos."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/0/record/16"
msgid "And that's your assignment...to infiltrate behind enemy lines and get that information."
msgstr "Y esa es su asignación... infiltrarse tras la línea enemiga y conseguir esa información."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/0/record/17"
msgid "We've equipped these fighters with communications computers that will simulate a real Kilrathi pilot."
msgstr "Hemos equipado esos cazas con ordenadores de comunicación que simularán un piloto Kilrathi real."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/0/record/18"
msgid "When you touch base at your Nav points, the computer simulation will begin transmitting---"
msgstr "Cuando haga contacto en sus Puntos Nav, la simulación por ordenador empezará a transmitir..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/0/record/19"
msgid "---and will contact any capital ships to request certain information."
msgstr "...y se comunicará con cualquier nave insignia que solicite cierta información."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/0/record/20"
msgid "Once the computer's acquired the data---"
msgstr "Una vez haya recogido los datos el ordenador..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/0/record/21"
msgid "---then get out of there fast.  We don't know how long these computers can deceive the Kilrathi."
msgstr "...salga de allí rápido. No sabemos cuánto tiempo podrán engañar los ordenadores a los Kilrathi."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/0/record/22"
msgid "We think there are several capital ships maneuvering through your Nav 1."
msgstr "Creemos que hay varias naves insignia haciendo maniobras por Nav 1."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/0/record/23"
msgid "You'll fly to that Nav point, transmit to the capital ships, and then get the hell out of there."
msgstr "Volará hasta ese Punto Nav, transmitirá a las naves insignia y después saldrá de allí cagando leches."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/0/record/24"
msgid "The idea is to get in and out again, and return WITH that information."
msgstr "La idea es entrar y salir, y volver CON esa información."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/0/record/25"
msgid "The Colonel continues with the other wing assignments."
msgstr "El coronel sigue con las otras asignaciones de ala."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/0/record/26"
msgid "The techs have refitted these Kilrathi ships with some human control mechanisms---"
msgstr "Los técnicos han remodelado las naves Kilrathi con algunos mecanismos de control humanos..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/0/record/27"
msgid "---and added our own targeting systems.  But we still don't know how they'll fly in combat---"
msgstr "...y hemos añadido nuestro propio sistema de apuntado. Pero todavía no sabemos cómo volarán en combate..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/0/record/28"
msgid "---so watch your six.  And remember...the techs began installing ejection seats in the Dralthi---"
msgstr "...así que vigilen la retaguardia. Y recuerden... los técnicos han tratado de instalar asientos eyectables en las Dralthis..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/0/record/29"
msgid "---but ran into unsolvable technical difficulties.  You won't be able to eject from a Dralthi."
msgstr "...pero se han topado con algunas dificultades técnicas sin solución. No podrán eyectarse en una Dralthi."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/0/record/30"
msgid "That's all, pilots.  Dismissed."
msgstr "Eso es todo, pilotos. Retírense."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/1/record/0"
msgid "Mission Debriefing -- $T, $D."
msgstr "Después de la Misión, $T, $D"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/1/record/2"
msgid "I couldn't get close enough to any capital ships to target them.  I'm sorry, sir."
msgstr "No pude acercarme lo suficiente a ninguna nave capital para marcarla. Lo siento, Señor."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/1/record/4"
msgid "I was able to move in close and target two Snakeir carriers at Nav 1, sir."
msgstr "Conseguí acercarme y apuntar a dos portanaves Snakeir en Nav 1, Señor."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/1/record/5"
msgid "Excellent, $C!  We'll get that data to Tactical right away."
msgstr "¡Excelente, $C! Llevaremos los datos a Operaciones ahora mismo."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/1/record/6"
msgid "And I succeeded in destroying both carriers."
msgstr "Y conseguí destruir los dos portanaves."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/1/record/7"
msgid "That wasn't your mission, $C...but it'll deal a very demoralizing blow to the enemy.\n  Good work."
msgstr "Esa no era su misión, $C... pero eso asestará un golpe desmoralizador al enemigo. Buen trabajo."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/1/record/9"
msgid "Then I attacked the carriers, and succeeded in killing one of them."
msgstr "Después ataqué los portanaves, y conseguí derribar uno de ellos."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/1/record/10"
msgid "That wasn't your mission, $C...but it'll deal a very demoralizing blow to the enemy.\n  Good work."
msgstr "Esa no era su misión, $C... pero eso asestará un golpe desmoralizador al enemigo. Buen trabajo."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/1/record/11"
msgid "Then I attacked the carriers, and succeeded in killing one of them."
msgstr "Después ataqué los portanaves, y conseguí derribar uno de ellos."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/1/record/12"
msgid "That wasn't your mission, $C...but it'll deal a very demoralizing blow to the enemy.\n  Good work."
msgstr "Esa no era su misión, $C... pero eso asestará un golpe desmoralizador al enemigo. Buen trabajo."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/1/record/13"
msgid "Flying the Kilrathi fighter didn't work very well for us."
msgstr "No nos ha ido muy bien volando en el caza Kilrathi."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/1/record/14"
msgid "Flying the Kilrathi fighter didn't work very well for me."
msgstr "No me ha ido muy bien volando en el caza Kilrathi."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/1/record/15"
msgid "We were ambushed by several enemy ships.  It was a tough fight, sir."
msgstr "Nos emboscaron varias naves enemigas. Fue un duro combate, Señor."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/1/record/16"
msgid "I was ambushed by several enemy ships.  It was a tough fight, sir."
msgstr "Me emboscaron varias naves enemigas. Fue un duro combate, Señor."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/1/record/17"
msgid "$C, your flight recorder says that you killed $K."
msgstr "$C, su caja negra dice que ha derribado $K."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/1/record/18"
msgid "The recorder says that you were blanked, no kills."
msgstr "La caja negra dice que ha vuelto sin nada, no hay muertes."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/1/record/19"
msgid "Jazz took out $L Kilrathi."
msgstr "Jazz derribó $L Kilrathi."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/1/record/20"
msgid "Jazz came back with no kills."
msgstr "Jazz ha vuelto sin ninguna muerte."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/1/record/21"
msgid "And then we lost him, damn them all."
msgstr "Después lo perdimos, malditos sean."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/1/record/22"
msgid "All right.  We transmitted a message indicating that you ran into some rocks in that asteroid field."
msgstr "Muy bien. Hemos transmitido un mensaje indicando que se estrelló contra algunas rocas en el campo de asteroides."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/1/record/23"
msgid "With any luck, the Kilrathi will believe that you were destroyed."
msgstr "Con suerte, los Kilrathi creerán que lo han destruido."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/1/record/24"
msgid "Get some rest, $N."
msgstr "Vaya a descansar, $N."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/1/record/25"
msgid "And I'll need to see you later, in my office."
msgstr "Y luego quiero verle, en mi oficina."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/1/record/26"
msgid "Dismissed."
msgstr "Retírese."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/2/record/0"
msgid "Hi, $R. I just heard 'bout those Kilrathi defectors."
msgstr "Hola, $R. Acabo de oír lo de esos desertores Kilrathi."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/2/record/1"
msgid "Hard to believe, that some of those cats would actually want to be on our side."
msgstr "Se me hace difícil creer que algunos de esos gatos realmente quiera estar de nuestro lado."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/2/record/2"
msgid "They brought that Captain Ralgha and his officers through here, a couple hours ago."
msgstr "Hace un par de horas trajeron a ese tal Capitán Ralgha y a sus oficiales."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/2/record/3"
msgid "An' I kept thinkin'...this is the same kind of guy that ordered the attack on Goddard."
msgstr "Sigo pensando... que es de la misma clase de gente que ordenó el ataque en Goddard."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/2/record/4"
msgid "He commanded a Fralthi...who knows how many of our people he's killed?"
msgstr "También dirigía una Fralthi... ¿a cuánta de nuestra gente habrá matado?"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/2/record/5"
msgid "He could've murdered thousands of our soldiers, taken out dozens of our ships."
msgstr "Podría haber asesinado a miles de nuestros soldados, y acabado con docenas de nuestras naves."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/2/record/6"
msgid "An' here he is, askin' us to protect him from the Kilrathi Empire."
msgstr "Y aquí está, pidiéndonos que le protejamos del Imperio Kilrathi."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/2/record/7"
msgid "Hell, we've already got what we need from him.  We could just toss him out the airlock---"
msgstr "Diablos, ya hemos conseguido de él lo que queríamos. Podríamos echarlo por la esclusa, sin más..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/2/record/8"
msgid "---an' no one would know any different, right?"
msgstr "...y nadie notaría la diferencia, ¿no?"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/2/record/9"
msgid "They're sending all those furballs to Confed HQ for debriefing."
msgstr "Están enviando a todos esos peludos al Cuartel General de la Confederación para interrogarlos."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/2/record/10"
msgid "Good riddance, if you ask me."
msgstr "Pues, adiós muy buenas."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/3/record/0"
msgid "So you're $R $N?  I hear you're a real hotshot pilot, the best on the Tiger's Claw."
msgstr "¿Así que usted es el $R $N? Dicen que es un piloto de primera, el mejor de la Garra de Tigre."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/3/record/1"
msgid "$C, this is Lieutenant Zach Colson."
msgstr "$C, este es el Teniente Zach Colson."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/3/record/2"
msgid "Call me Jazz.  I'm a combat pilot on the TCS Austin, and a jazz pianist on the side."
msgstr "Llámeme Jazz. Soy un piloto de combate de la TCS Austin, y al margen de eso, un pianista de jazz."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/3/record/3"
msgid "But what I'd really like is to be transferred to a ship like the Tiger's Claw."
msgstr "Pero lo que realmente quería es que me transfirieran a una nave como la Garra de Tigre."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/3/record/4"
msgid "I'm already imagining what I could do if I was stationed here.  It'd be great."
msgstr "Ya me estoy imaginando lo que podría hacer si me destinaran aquí. Sería estupendo."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/3/record/5"
msgid "You guys definitely need a piano in your Rec Room, though.  Just like we have on the Austin."
msgstr "Y decididamente necesitan un piano en la Sala de Juegos. En la Austin tenemos uno."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/3/record/6"
msgid "I usually play there several nights a week.  You should come over and listen sometime."
msgstr "A veces lo toco por la noche, durante la semana. Venga a escucharme alguna vez si quiere."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/3/record/7"
msgid "Thanks, Jazz.  I think I'll do that."
msgstr "Gracias, Jazz. Seguro que lo hago."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/4/record/0"
msgid "Hello, $C.  Sit down and join us."
msgstr "Hola, $C. Siéntese con nosotros."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/4/record/1"
msgid "We were just talking about your last campaign, the Goddard mission."
msgstr "Justo estábamos hablando de su última campaña, la misión de Goddard."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/4/record/2"
msgid "Operation Thor's Hammer.  That was a real tough assignment."
msgstr "La Operación Martillo de Thor. Esa asignación sí que fue de la duras."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/4/record/3"
msgid "I was certain that we wouldn't survive it."
msgstr "Estaba seguro de que no íbamos a sobrevivir."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/4/record/4"
msgid "But we succeeded in our secret mission, against all odds."
msgstr "Pero tuvimos éxito en nuestra misión secreta, contra todo pronóstico."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/4/record/5"
msgid "It's a pity you couldn't do anything for those people on Goddard, though."
msgstr "Y es una pena que no pudieran hacer nada por la gente de Goddard."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/4/record/6"
msgid "We arrived too late to help them.  But we avenged them."
msgstr "Llegamos demasiado tarde para ayudarlos. Pero les vengamos."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/4/record/7"
msgid "None of those Kilrathi scum who destroyed Goddard survived."
msgstr "No sobrevivió ninguno de esos apestosos Kilrathi que destruyó Goddard."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/16/scene/4/record/8"
msgid "So there was true justice in the end."
msgstr "Así que al final se hizo justicia de verdad."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/0/record/0"
msgid "Mission Briefing, $T, $D.\nCorsair System, Antares Sector."
msgstr "Sesión Informativa de la Misión, $T, $D\nSistema Corsair, Sector Antares"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/0/record/1"
msgid "Pilots, we've been lucky so far, and avoided any major confrontations with the Kilrathi---"
msgstr "Pilotos, hasta ahora hemos tenido suerte, y evitado enfrentamientos importantes con los Kilrathi..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/0/record/2"
msgid "---because the cats have been busy with this 'Lord Sivar' business."
msgstr "...porque los gatos han estado ocupados con esta historia del 'Lord Sivar'."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/0/record/3"
msgid "And now we know what that is, and just why this 'Way of Lord Sivar' is so important."
msgstr "Y ahora sabemos qué es, y por qué es tan importante esta 'Senda de Lord Sivar'."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/0/record/4"
msgid "Captain Ralgha and his officers have provided us with a detailed description---"
msgstr "El Capitán Ralgha y sus oficiales nos han proporcionado una descripción detallada..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/0/record/5"
msgid "---of the Kilrathi military-religious ceremony known as the Way of Sivar."
msgstr "...de la ceremonia militar-religiosa de los Kilrathi conocida como la Senda de Sivar."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/0/record/6"
msgid "The Kilrathi believe that they have to sing the praises of their war god---"
msgstr "Los Kilrathi creen que tienen que cantar los salmos de su dios de la guerra..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/0/record/7"
msgid "---once every year, on a planet chosen by the Sivar priestesses."
msgstr "...una vez cada año, en un planeta elegido por las sacerdotisas de Sivar."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/0/record/8"
msgid "If they fail to do so, then the war god will not favor the Warriors of Kilrah in battle---"
msgstr "Si no consiguen hacerlo, entonces el dios de la guerra no favorecerá a los Guerreros de Kilrah en la batalla..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/0/record/9"
msgid "---and their enemies are destined to destroy them."
msgstr "...y sus enemigos están destinados a destruirlos."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/0/record/10"
msgid "Firekka is the planet they've chosen for this year's ceremony."
msgstr "Firekka es el planeta que han elegido este año para la ceremonia."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/0/record/11"
msgid "And that's why every available ship in the Kilrathi fleets will be arriving here soon."
msgstr "Y por eso todas las naves disponibles de las flotas Kilrathi llegarán pronto aquí."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/0/record/12"
msgid "There's more to this, unfortunately.  The Kilrathi believe that the ceremony can't be tainted---"
msgstr "Por desgracia, todavía hay más. Los Kilrathi creen que la ceremonia no puede ser mancillada..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/0/record/13"
msgid "---by the presence of unbelievers.  Unless we do something to save them---"
msgstr "...con la presencia de infieles. Si no hacemos nada para salvarlos..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/0/record/14"
msgid "---the Firekka will be forcibly converted to the Sivar cult."
msgstr "...los Firekkan serán convertidos por la fuerza al culto de Sivar."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/0/record/15"
msgid "And the Kilrathi will murder any Firekka who refuse."
msgstr "Y los Kilrathi matarán a cualquier Firekkan que se niegue."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/0/record/16"
msgid "A planet of several million intelligent beings...we can't allow that to happen."
msgstr "Es un planeta con varios millones de seres inteligentes... no podemos dejar que eso ocurra."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/0/record/17"
msgid "Based on Ralgha's information, Confed HQ has formulated a plan that may save the Firekka---"
msgstr "Basándonos en la información de Ralgha, el Cuartel General de la Confederación ha formulado un plan que puede salvar a los Firekkan..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/0/record/18"
msgid "---and deal a very demoralizing blow to the Kilrathi at the same time."
msgstr "...y al mismo tiempo, dar un golpe muy desmoralizador a los Kilrathi."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/0/record/19"
msgid "Are you certain we can trust this renegade's information, sir?"
msgstr "¿Están seguros de que podemos confiar en la información de este renegado, Señor?"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/0/record/20"
msgid "Ralgha volunteered for a trank-chem debriefing, Hunter.  We know he isn't lying."
msgstr "Ralgha se ofreció voluntario para un interrogatorio con tranquilizantes químicos, Hunter. Sabemos que no miente."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/0/record/21"
msgid "Our plan is to disrupt the Sivar ceremony.  Two battalions of marines will be arriving soon to help us."
msgstr "Nuestro plan es interrumpir la ceremonia Sivar. Pronto llegarán dos batallones de marines para ayudarnos."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/0/record/22"
msgid "The Tiger's Claw pilots will escort them in, and then the marines will land on the planet."
msgstr "Los pilotos de la Garra de Tigre los escoltarán, y después los marines aterrizarán en el planeta."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/0/record/23"
msgid "With the native Firekka warriors, they'll launch an assault against the Sivar warrior-priestesses."
msgstr "Junto con los guerreros nativos Firekkan, lanzarán un asalto contra las sacerdotisas guerreras Sivar."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/0/record/24"
msgid "If we can succeed in this one mission, pilots, it may have major repercussions throughout the Kilrathi war machine."
msgstr "Pilotos, si tenemos éxito en esta única misión, la repercusión en la maquinaria bélica Kilrathi será enorme."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/0/record/25"
msgid "But first, we need more information.  I'm sending some of you out in the captured Kilrathi ships---"
msgstr "Pero antes, necesitamos más información. Enviaré a algunos de ustedes ahí fuera en las naves Kilrathi capturadas..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/0/record/26"
msgid "---back to the Firekka system, where you'll intercept Kilrathi military communications."
msgstr "...para volver al Sistema Firekka, donde interceptarán las comunicaciones militares Kilrathi."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/0/record/27"
msgid "From that data, we'll calculate the safest place and time for the marines to land on the planet."
msgstr "Con esos datos calcularemos el lugar y momento más seguros para que los marines aterricen en el planeta."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/0/record/28"
msgid "Mu Wing will be $C and Jazz."
msgstr "El Ala Mu la formarán $C y Jazz."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/0/record/29"
msgid "$C, you're on your own this time."
msgstr "$C, está vez irá en solitario."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/0/record/30"
msgid "Here's your assignment...."
msgstr "Este es el plan..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/0/record/31"
msgid "Stay alert when you're flying this course---you'll probably run into Kilrathi patrols."
msgstr "Manténgase alerta cuando vuele esta ruta... seguramente se encontrará patrullas Kilrathi."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/0/record/32"
msgid "If they realize you're Confed and attack, then you should defend yourself.  Otherwise, don't blow your cover."
msgstr "Si se dan cuenta de que es de la Confederación y atacan, entonces defiéndase. Si no, no fastidie la cobertura."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/0/record/33"
msgid "Go to Nav 1, and your comm computer will automatically begin to intercept the comm data.  Then return via Nav 2."
msgstr "Vaya a Nav 1, y su ordenador de comunicaciones empezará automáticamente a interceptar los datos. Después vuelva por Nav 2."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/0/record/34"
msgid "The Colonel quickly reads the other wing assignments."
msgstr "El coronel lee rápidamente las otras asignaciones de las alas."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/0/record/35"
msgid "Be careful, everyone---we don't know whether or not they believe that all the captured fighters were destroyed."
msgstr "Vayan todos con cuidado... todavía no sabemos si se creen lo de que los cazas capturados están destruidos."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/0/record/36"
msgid "Dismissed, pilots."
msgstr "Retírense, pilotos."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/1/record/0"
msgid "Mission Debriefing -- $T, $D."
msgstr "Después de la Misión, $T, $D"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/1/record/1"
msgid "Welcome back, $C.  Did you and Jazz run into anything tough?"
msgstr "Bienvenido de vuelta, $C. ¿Jazz y usted se encontraron con algo fuera de lo normal?"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/1/record/2"
msgid "Nothing we couldn't handle, Colonel."
msgstr "Nada que no pudiéramos manejar, Coronel."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/1/record/3"
msgid "Welcome back, $C."
msgstr "Bienvenido de vuelta, $C."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/1/record/4"
msgid "I'd like to hear your report, $R $N."
msgstr "Me gustaría oír su informe, $R $N."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/1/record/5"
msgid "Couldn't get to Nav 1 to intercept those enemy communications, sir."
msgstr "No pude llegar a Nav 1 para interceptar la comunicaciones enemigas, Señor."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/1/record/6"
msgid "We managed to reach Nav 1 without too much difficulty, sir."
msgstr "Conseguimos llegar a Nav 1 sin demasiadas dificultades, Señor."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/1/record/7"
msgid "I managed to reach Nav 1 without too much difficulty, sir."
msgstr "Conseguí llegar a Nav 1 sin demasiadas dificultades, Señor."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/1/record/8"
msgid "But Kilrathi-piloted Rapiers and some Dralthi were waiting for us."
msgstr "Pero nos estaban esperando Rapiers pilotadas por Kilrathi y algunas Dralthis."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/1/record/9"
msgid "But Kilrathi-piloted Rapiers and some Dralthi were waiting for me."
msgstr "Pero me estaban esperando Rapiers pilotadas por Kilrathi y algunas Dralthis."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/1/record/10"
msgid "Those Rapiers were probably the last surviving wing from the Johann...it was very tough, sir."
msgstr "Esas Rapiers probablemente fueran las supervivientes de la última ala de la Johann... fue muy duro, Señor."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/1/record/11"
msgid "I just hope that communication interceptor didn't break when I was flying that high-speed Immelmann."
msgstr "Tan solo espero que el interceptor de las comunicaciones no se rompiera cuando hice ese giro Immelmann a gran velocidad."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/1/record/12"
msgid "There was another enemy wing waiting for us at Nav 2."
msgstr "Había otra ala de enemigos esperándonos en Nav 2."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/1/record/13"
msgid "There was another enemy wing waiting for me at Nav 2."
msgstr "Había otra ala de enemigos esperándome en Nav 2."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/1/record/16"
msgid "And I don't think we should use these captured fighters again, sir---"
msgstr "Y no creo que debamos usar otra vez esos cazas capturados, Señor..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/1/record/17"
msgid "---the enemy are using some kind of recognition code---"
msgstr "...el enemigo está usando algún tipo de código de identificación..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/1/record/18"
msgid "---and they obviously recognized us as Terran pilots."
msgstr "...y es obvio que nos reconocieron como unos pilotos Terrestres."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/1/record/19"
msgid "---and they obviously recognized me as a Terran pilot."
msgstr "...y es obvio que me reconocieron como un piloto Terrestre."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/1/record/20"
msgid "I'll tell that to Tactical...maybe we can intercept and use those recognition codes."
msgstr "Se lo diré a Operaciones... tal vez podamos interceptar y usar esos códigos de identificación."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/1/record/21"
msgid "You had $K recorded kills, $C."
msgstr "Su registro de derribos indica $K, $C."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/1/record/22"
msgid "Your flight recorder shows no kills, $R."
msgstr "Su caja negra muestra que no ha derribado ninguno, $R."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/1/record/23"
msgid "Jazz bagged $L Kilrathi."
msgstr "Jazz ha cazado $L Kilrathi."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/1/record/24"
msgid "Jazz didn't toast any Kilrathi."
msgstr "Jazz no ha frito a ningún Kilrathi."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/1/record/25"
msgid "He kept the enemy away from me, Colonel.  That's more important than any kill."
msgstr "Mantuvo al enemigo alejado de mí, Coronel. Eso es más importante que cualquier derribo."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/1/record/26"
msgid "And then we lost him, damn them all."
msgstr "Además lo hemos perdido, malditos sean."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/1/record/27"
msgid "All right. Take it easy for a while, both of you."
msgstr "Está bien. Descansen un rato los dos."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/1/record/28"
msgid "All right. Take it easy for a while, $C."
msgstr "Está bien. Descanse un rato, $C."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/1/record/29"
msgid "And I want to see you in my office later, $C."
msgstr "Y quiero verle luego en mi oficina, $C."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/1/record/30"
msgid "Dismissed."
msgstr "Retírese."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/2/record/0"
msgid "Hello, $C.  What can I get for you?"
msgstr "Hola, $C. ¿Qué le pongo?"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/2/record/1"
msgid "Just one of my usual, Sam."
msgstr "Lo de siempre, Sam."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/2/record/2"
msgid "No problem.  $C...I've been feeling really uneasy 'bout something---"
msgstr "No hay problema. $C... me he sentido realmente incómodo con algo..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/2/record/3"
msgid "We've been hiding in this Corsair System from all of those Kilrathi fleets..."
msgstr "Nos hemos estado escondiendo en el Sistema Corsair de todas esas flotas Kilrathi..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/2/record/4"
msgid "...an' we've been lucky; those cats seem to believe we left the area..."
msgstr "...y hemos tenido suerte; los gatos creen que hemos dejado la zona..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/2/record/5"
msgid "...but what if our luck changes?"
msgstr "...¿pero qué pasa si la suerte cambia?"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/2/record/6"
msgid "Five battle fleets against the Claw?  That's unfriendly odds, $R."
msgstr "¿Cinco flotas de combate contra la Garra? Es una probabilidad muy desfavorable, $R."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/3/record/0"
msgid "Listen, $C...I was just talking to Dr. Khalsa about those Kilrathi renegades."
msgstr "Escuche, $C... Justo acabo de hablar con el Doctor Khalsa sobre esos renegados Kilrathi."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/3/record/1"
msgid "They debriefed Captain Ralgha with neo-scopalamine, and they learned some interesting stuff."
msgstr "Interrogaron al Capitán Ralgha con neo-escopolamina y averiguaron cosas muy interesantes."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/3/record/2"
msgid "He couldn't say what, of course, just that it would help us against the enemy."
msgstr "No me pudo decir nada, claro, solo que nos ayudaría contra el enemigo."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/3/record/3"
msgid "I'm a little worried, though.  I mean, this guy could be a Kilrathi agent---"
msgstr "Pero estoy un poco preocupado. A ver, este tipo podría ser un agente Kilrathi..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/3/record/4"
msgid "---trained for trank-chem interrogations.  What if he was lying?"
msgstr "...entrenado para los interrogatorios con tranquilizantes químicos. ¿Y si está mintiendo?"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/3/record/5"
msgid "If we go into a battle with bad tactical data, it's all over for us."
msgstr "Si vamos a combatir con unos datos tácticos malos, todo se ha terminado."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/3/record/6"
msgid "Even if we have good data, we're in trouble.  All those battle fleets against the Tiger's Claw?"
msgstr "Aún teniendo buenos datos, estamos en un lío. ¿Todas esas flotas de combate contra la Garra de Tigre?"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/3/record/7"
msgid "The mission at Goddard was against ONE battle fleet, and that was nearly impossible."
msgstr "La misión de Goddard fue contra UNA flota de combate, y fue casi imposible."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/3/record/8"
msgid "Like Shotglass says, those aren't friendly odds."
msgstr "Tal y como dice Shotglass, las probabilidades son desfavorables."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/3/record/9"
msgid "We should be safe here in the Corsair System.  But if we go back to Firekka...what then?"
msgstr "En el Sistema Corsair tendríamos que estar a salvo. Pero si volvemos a Firekka... ¿qué pasará?"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/4/record/0"
msgid "$C.  I just saw Colonel Halcyon in the corridor, a few minutes ago."
msgstr "$C. Acabo de ver al Coronel Halcyon en el pasillo, hace unos minutos."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/4/record/1"
msgid "He was speaking with Ralgha, the Kilrathi captain."
msgstr "Estaba hablando con Ralgha, el capitán Kilrathi."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/4/record/2"
msgid "Do you know, I had never seen a Kilrathi before?"
msgstr "¿Sabe que no había visto antes a un Kilrathi?"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/4/record/3"
msgid "I thought I would hate him, because of what his people have done to us."
msgstr "Creía que los iba a odiar, por todo lo que le han hecho a nuestra gente."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/4/record/4"
msgid "But I did not feel anything at all.  Not hatred, or anything else."
msgstr "Pero no sentí nada en absoluto. Ni odio, ni ninguna otra cosa."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/4/record/5"
msgid "Only empty.  Completely empty."
msgstr "Solo vacío. Un vacío abismal."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/4/record/6"
msgid "Sometimes I feel like we've been fighting forever, that this war will never be over."
msgstr "A veces siento como si hubiéramos estado luchando eternamente, que esta guerra nunca terminará."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/4/record/7"
msgid "The Kilrathi started this war, Spirit.  But I know we'll end it, someday."
msgstr "Los Kilrathi iniciaron esta guerra, Spirit. Pero sé que nosotros le pondremos fin, algún día."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/17/scene/4/record/8"
msgid "I hope so, my friend.  I truly hope so."
msgstr "Eso espero, amigo mío. Lo espero de verdad."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/20/scene/0/record/0"
msgid "Mission Briefing, $T, $D.\nNear the Firekka System, Antares Sector."
msgstr "Sesión Informativa de la Misión, $T, $D\nCerca del Sistema Firekka, Sector Antares"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/20/scene/0/record/1"
msgid "All right, pilots.  We've been keeping our distance from the Firekka System---"
msgstr "Muy bien, pilotos. Nos hemos mantenido alejados del Sistema Firekka..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/20/scene/0/record/2"
msgid "---waiting for the right moment to start our assault."
msgstr "...esperando el momento justo para iniciar nuestro ataque."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/20/scene/0/record/3"
msgid "That time is now."
msgstr "Ese momento ha llegado."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/20/scene/0/record/4"
msgid "Today you're going to escort in the Marine tranports---"
msgstr "Hoy van a escoltar los transportes de Marines..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/20/scene/0/record/5"
msgid "---and then we'll launch the assault on the Kilrathi troops on Firekka."
msgstr "...y después lanzaremos el asalto sobre las tropas Kilrathi en Firekka."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/20/scene/0/record/6"
msgid "Because of the risk of a communications leak in this operation---"
msgstr "Debido al riesgo de una filtración en las comunicaciones de esta operación..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/20/scene/0/record/7"
msgid "---the Marine convoys have not transmitted their exact position."
msgstr "...los convoyes de los Marines no han transmitido su posición exacta."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/20/scene/0/record/8"
msgid "But one Drayman has already docked with the Tiger's Claw---"
msgstr "Pero una Drayman ya ha atracado con la Garra de Tigre..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/20/scene/0/record/9"
msgid "---so we have a good idea where those Marine transports will arrive."
msgstr "...así que tenemos una buena idea de dónde llegarán esos transportes de Marines."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/20/scene/0/record/10"
msgid "You'll fly in Hornets...fast, maneuverable ships.  Follow your Nav course and clear the jump points of any enemy ships."
msgstr "Volarán en Hornets... son unas naves rápidas y maniobrables. Sigan su ruta Nav y despejen los puntos de salto de naves enemigas."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/20/scene/0/record/11"
msgid "And don't screw this one up, pilots.  The entire mission depends upon---"
msgstr "Y esta vez no la fastidien, pilotos. Toda la misión depende de..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/20/scene/0/record/12"
msgid "---the safe arrival of those Marines and the guns they're bringing for the Firekka warriors."
msgstr "...que esos Marines y las armas que llevan para los guerreros Firekkan lleguen sanos y salvos."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/20/scene/0/record/13"
msgid "These are your wing assignments..."
msgstr "Estas son las asignaciones de alas."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/20/scene/0/record/14"
msgid "You listen until the Colonel calls your name:"
msgstr "Escuchas hasta que el coronel pronuncia tu nombre."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/20/scene/0/record/15"
msgid "Psi Wing will be $C and Doomsday, with $C as wingleader."
msgstr "El Ala Psi la formarán $C y Doomsday, $C será el líder del ala."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/20/scene/0/record/16"
msgid "Psi Wing will be $C.  Good luck, $R."
msgstr "El Ala Psi la formará $C. Buena suerte, $R."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/20/scene/0/record/17"
msgid "The Colonel quickly assigns the other wingmen."
msgstr "El coronel asigna rápidamente a los otros copilotos."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/20/scene/0/record/18"
msgid "That's all, pilots.  Get out there and find those transports."
msgstr "Eso es todo, pilotos. Salgan ahí fuera y busquen esos transportes."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/20/scene/0/record/19"
msgid "Dismissed."
msgstr "Retírense."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/20/scene/1/record/0"
msgid "Mission Debriefing -- $T, $D."
msgstr "Después de la Misión, $T, $D"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/20/scene/1/record/1"
msgid "All right, $C. Report."
msgstr "Está bien, $C. Informe."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/20/scene/1/record/2"
msgid "Both transports mini-jumped out to the Firekka System, sir.  No problems."
msgstr "Los dos transportes han hecho un minisalto hacia el Sistema Firekka, Señor. Sin problemas."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/20/scene/1/record/3"
msgid "Excellent, $C!  I knew you wouldn't fail us."
msgstr "¡Excelente, $C! Sabía que no nos fallaría."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/20/scene/1/record/5"
msgid "I couldn't save either of the transports, sir."
msgstr "No pude salvar ninguno de los transportes, Señor."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/20/scene/1/record/7"
msgid "I was able to protect one of the transports, sir."
msgstr "Conseguí proteger uno de los transportes, Señor."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/20/scene/1/record/8"
msgid "But I couldn't keep the Kilrathi from the other ship."
msgstr "Pero no pude alejar a los Kilrathi de la otra nave."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/20/scene/1/record/9"
msgid "I was able to protect one of the transports, sir."
msgstr "Conseguí proteger uno de los transportes, Señor."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/20/scene/1/record/10"
msgid "But I couldn't keep the Kilrathi from the other ship."
msgstr "Pero no pude alejar a los Kilrathi de la otra nave."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/20/scene/1/record/11"
msgid "We lost a lot of good soldiers today because of you, $C."
msgstr "Hoy hemos perdidos a muchos buenos soldados por su culpa, $C."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/20/scene/1/record/12"
msgid "I see you took down $K, $R."
msgstr "Veo que ha derribado $K, $R."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/20/scene/1/record/13"
msgid "I see you you came back with no kills, $R."
msgstr "Veo que ha vuelto sin ninguna muerte, $R."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/20/scene/1/record/14"
msgid "And Doomsday bagged $L. Good work."
msgstr "Y Doomsday ha cazado $L. Buen trabajo."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/20/scene/1/record/15"
msgid "Doomsday was blanked."
msgstr "Doomsday ha vuelto sin nada."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/20/scene/1/record/16"
msgid "Sorry about that, sir. I'm usually much better than that."
msgstr "Le pido disculpas, Señor. Normalmente lo hago mejor."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/20/scene/1/record/17"
msgid "And the cats killed him.  Damn it, the Austin and the Tiger's Claw can't afford casualties, not now."
msgstr "Además los gatos lo han matado. Maldita sea, en este momento la Austin y la Garra de Tigre no se pueden permitir más bajas."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/20/scene/1/record/18"
msgid "Something else, $R.  I sent Angel and Sorcerer to escort the TCS General Powell, one of the marine transports."
msgstr "Una cosa más, $R. Envié a Angel y a Sorcerer para escoltar la TCS General Powell, uno de los transportes de Marines."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/20/scene/1/record/19"
msgid "Something else, $R.  I sent a wing to escort the TCS General Powell, one of the Marine transports."
msgstr "Una cosa más, $R. Envié un ala para escoltar la TCS General Powell, uno de los transportes de Marines."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/20/scene/1/record/20"
msgid "That Drayman never arrived at the jump point.  Did you see any sign of it on your patrol?"
msgstr "La Drayman nunca llegó al punto de salto. ¿Ha visto algún rastro de ella en su patrulla?"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/20/scene/1/record/21"
msgid "No, sir, I did not."
msgstr "No, Señor, no he visto nada."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/20/scene/1/record/22"
msgid "$C, I'll need to see you in my office later."
msgstr "$C, quiero verle luego en mi oficina."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/20/scene/1/record/23"
msgid "Dismissed, pilots."
msgstr "Retírense, pilotos."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/20/scene/1/record/24"
msgid "You're dismissed, pilot."
msgstr "Retírese, piloto."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/20/scene/2/record/0"
msgid "Did you hear the latest, $C?  They caught Maniac on the flight deck---"
msgstr "¿Se ha enterado de lo último, $C? Cogieron a Maniac en la cubierta de vuelo..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/20/scene/2/record/1"
msgid "---wearin' nothing but his pajamas, an' trying to sneak aboard a Raptor."
msgstr "...solo llevaba el pijama e intentaba colarse a bordo de una Raptor."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/20/scene/2/record/2"
msgid "The MPs took him back to Sickbay.  He was kickin' and screamin' the whole way."
msgstr "La PM lo atrapó y lo llevo otra vez a la Enfermería. Estuvo pataleando y gritando todo el rato."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/20/scene/2/record/3"
msgid "Damn, but that boy is crazy."
msgstr "Maldita sea, ese chico está chiflado."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/20/scene/2/record/4"
msgid "But at least you won't have to fly with him anymore, $R."
msgstr "Pero al menos ya no tendrá que volar más con él, $R."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/20/scene/3/record/0"
msgid "Hello, mate.  Care to sit down and join me?"
msgstr "Hola compañero. ¿Le importaría sentarse y unirse a mí?"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/20/scene/3/record/1"
msgid "Hello, mate.  Care to sit down and join us?"
msgstr "Hola compañero. ¿Le importaría sentarse y unirse a nosotros?"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/20/scene/3/record/2"
msgid "I was just thinking about my older brother, Dennis."
msgstr "Estaba pensando en mi hermano mayor, Dennis."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/20/scene/3/record/3"
msgid "Major Dennis St. John, of the Terran Confederation Marines."
msgstr "El Mayor Dennis St. John, de los Marines de la Confederación Terrestre."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/20/scene/3/record/4"
msgid "He was so proud to be commanding his first post, a Marine base on a little backwater colony somewhere."
msgstr "Estaba tan orgullo de estar al mando de su primer puesto, una base de Marines en la colonia de un pequeño páramo."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/20/scene/3/record/5"
msgid "The Kilrathi showed up a week ago.  When they left, there were no survivors."
msgstr "Los Kilrathi aparecieron hace una semana. Cuando se marcharon, no quedaron supervivientes."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/20/scene/3/record/6"
msgid "An' did I tell you that I have a younger sister, mate?  She'll be eighteen in another two months."
msgstr "¿Y le he dicho que tengo una hermana menor, compañero? De aquí dos meses cumplirá los dieciocho."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/20/scene/3/record/7"
msgid "Eighteen, and the sheila's already volunteered for the Navy."
msgstr "Dieciocho, y la tía ya se ha ofrecido voluntaria para la Marina."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/20/scene/4/record/0"
msgid "Good day, $C.  I am Lt. Etienne 'Doomsday' Montclair."
msgstr "Buenos días, $C. Soy el Teniente Etienne 'Doomsday' Montclair."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/20/scene/4/record/1"
msgid "Doomsday, I have to ask---"
msgstr "Doomsday, tengo que preguntarlo..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/20/scene/4/record/2"
msgid "Yes, I can see that you're curious.  What you see is the markings of a Maori warrior."
msgstr "Sí, ya veo que siente curiosidad. Lo que ve son las marcas de un guerrero Maorí."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/20/scene/4/record/3"
msgid "Let me tell you, $C...I have considered our position here in the Firekka System."
msgstr "Le diré una cosa, $C... he reflexionado sobre nuestra posición aquí, en el Sistema Firekka."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/20/scene/4/record/4"
msgid "Even if we were to retreat immediately, I doubt we would survive."
msgstr "Aunque nos tuviéramos que retirar de inmediato, dudo que sobreviviéramos."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/20/scene/4/record/5"
msgid "This is undoubtably the worst tactical situation I've ever seen."
msgstr "Esta es sin duda la peor situación táctica que he visto jamás."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/20/scene/4/record/6"
msgid "Aboard the Austin, many people laugh about my grim predictions."
msgstr "A bordo de la Austin, mucha gente se reía de mis siniestras predicciones."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/20/scene/4/record/7"
msgid "Despite my certainty that we will eventually be defeated by the Kilrathi---"
msgstr "A pesar de mi certeza de que con el tiempo los Kilrathi nos derrotarán..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/20/scene/4/record/8"
msgid "---we have survived to succeed thus far.  But this time, I am certain there is no escape for us."
msgstr "...hasta ahora hemos sobrevivido para tener éxito. Pero esta vez, estoy seguro de que no tenemos escapatoria."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/20/scene/4/record/9"
msgid "We won't give up easily, Doomsday.  Maybe you'll be surprised how this mission will end."
msgstr "No nos rendiremos tan fácilmente, Doomsday. Tal vez le sorprenda cómo acabará esta misión."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/20/scene/4/record/10"
msgid "Perhaps, $C.  Perhaps."
msgstr "Quizás, $C. Quizás."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/21/scene/0/record/0"
msgid "Mission Briefing, $T, $D.\nNear the Firekka System, Antares Sector."
msgstr "Sesión Informativa de la Misión, $T, $D\nCerca del Sistema Firekka, Sector Antares"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/21/scene/0/record/1"
msgid "Pilots, we have an emergency here.  Some of you may have heard that the TCS General Powell---"
msgstr "Pilotos, tenemos una emergencia. Algunos tal vez hayan oído que la TCS General Powell..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/21/scene/0/record/2"
msgid "---never arrived at her rendezvous point.  We thought we'd lost her...a Drayman with 150 marines and a crew of 25."
msgstr "...nunca llegó al punto de encuentro. Pensábamos que habíamos perdido... la Drayman con 150 marines y una tripulación de 25."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/21/scene/0/record/3"
msgid "But we received this emergency communication ten minutes ago:"
msgstr "Pero hace diez minutos hemos recibido esta comunicación de emergencia:"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/21/scene/0/record/4"
msgid "'This is Major Kristi Marks of Company Zebra.  The Kilrathi captured the Powell eight hours ago.'"
msgstr "'Aquí la Mayor Kristi Marks de la Compañía Zebra. Los Kilrathi han capturado hace ocho horas la Powell.'"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/21/scene/0/record/5"
msgid "'We've broken out of the cargo hold and are attempting to retake the ship.'"
msgstr "'Hemos cortado el compartimiento de carga e intentamos retomar la nave.'"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/21/scene/0/record/6"
msgid "'We've sustained heavy casualties and need immediate assistance.  These are our current coordinates:"
msgstr "'Sufrimos un elevado número de bajas y necesitamos ayuda inmediata. Estas son nuestras coordenadas actuales:"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/21/scene/0/record/7"
msgid "'160123, 153763, 898324, Terran Standard.  Please send help ASAP.  Repeat, please send---'"
msgstr "'160123, 153763, 898324, Notación Terrestre. Envíen ayuda cuanto antes. Repito, envíen...'"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/21/scene/0/record/8"
msgid "That message was cut off during transmission.  And we've received no further communications."
msgstr "El mensaje se cortó durante la transmisión. Y no hemos recibido más comunicaciones."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/21/scene/0/record/9"
msgid "We think the cats will try to take the Powell out-system..."
msgstr "Creemos que los gatos intentarán sacar a la Powell del sistema..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/21/scene/0/record/10"
msgid "...and we've calculated several courses between the Powell's last coordinates and the closest jump points."
msgstr "...y hemos calculado varias rutas entre las últimas coordenadas de la Powell y los puntos de salto más cercanos."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/21/scene/0/record/11"
msgid "Each of you will follow your Nav course until you find the Powell.  If she mini-jumps, go to your next Nav point and continue pursuit."
msgstr "Cada uno de ustedes seguirá su ruta Nav hasta encontrar la Powell. Si minisalta, vayan al siguiente Punto Nav y continúen la persecución."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/21/scene/0/record/12"
msgid "When you find the Powell, escort her back to the Tiger's Claw immediately."
msgstr "Cuando encuentren la Powell, la escoltan de vuelta inmediatamente hasta la Garra de Tigre."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/21/scene/0/record/13"
msgid "Whatever you do, DO NOT attack the Drayman.  We can't risk losing that ship."
msgstr "Hagan lo que hagan, NO ataquen la Drayman. No nos podemos arriesgar a perder esa nave."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/21/scene/0/record/14"
msgid "But if there are any Kilrathi fighters escorting her... don't let any of them escape, pilots."
msgstr "Pero si hay cazas Kilrathi que la escoltan... no dejen que huya ninguno, pilotos."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/21/scene/0/record/15"
msgid "Wing assignments:"
msgstr "Asignaciones de ala."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/21/scene/0/record/16"
msgid "The Commander lists the other wing teams, then addresses you:"
msgstr "El comandante enumera los otros equipos de alas, y después se dirige a ti."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/21/scene/0/record/17"
msgid "$C, you and Doomsday are Theta Wing again. "
msgstr "$C, usted y Doomsday formarán otra vez el Ala Theta."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/21/scene/0/record/18"
msgid "$C, you're Theta Wing."
msgstr "$C, usted formará el Ala Theta."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/21/scene/0/record/19"
msgid "You'll fly Dralthi again...Tactical believes we've cracked the Kilrathi recognition codes---"
msgstr "Volverá a volar en una Dralthi... Operaciones cree que hemos hackeado los códigos de identificación Kilrathi..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/21/scene/0/record/20"
msgid "---so with luck, you'll be able to get close to the Drayman before the cats realize you're Terrans."
msgstr "...así que con suerte, podrá acercarse a la Drayman antes de que los gatos se den cuenta de que son Terrestres."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/21/scene/0/record/21"
msgid "Wait until you see the Kilrathi fire upon the Drayman before you blow your cover."
msgstr "Antes de descubrir su tapadera, espere hasta que no vea que los Kilrathi disparan a la Drayman."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/21/scene/0/record/22"
msgid "That's all, pilots.  You'll launch in four minutes.  Dismissed."
msgstr "Eso es todo, pilotos. Saldrán en cuatro minutos. Retírense."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/21/scene/1/record/0"
msgid "Debriefing -- $T, $D."
msgstr "Después de la Misión, $T, $D"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/21/scene/1/record/1"
msgid "Report, $C."
msgstr "Informe, $C."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/21/scene/1/record/2"
msgid "I think the Kilrathi didn't realize that we would try to rescue the Drayman."
msgstr "Creo que los Kilrathi no se dieron cuenta de que intentaríamos rescatar la Drayman."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/21/scene/1/record/3"
msgid "Our Marines had apparently retaken the ship..."
msgstr "Según parece nuestros Marines retomaron la nave..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/21/scene/1/record/4"
msgid "And the cats were trying to kill that transport with everything they had..."
msgstr "...y los gatos estuvieron intentando destruir el transporte con todo lo que tenían."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/21/scene/1/record/5"
msgid "But I brought the Powell back, sir."
msgstr "Pero traje de vuelta la Powell, Señor."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/21/scene/1/record/6"
msgid "I couldn't bring the Powell back, sir."
msgstr "No pude traer de vuelta la Powell, Señor."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/21/scene/1/record/7"
msgid "All of those soldiers lost, because of you."
msgstr "Hemos perdido todos esos soldados por su culpa."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/21/scene/1/record/8"
msgid "I'm sorry, sir.  I did the best I could."
msgstr "Lo siento, Señor. Hice todo lo que pude."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/21/scene/1/record/9"
msgid "From your flight recorder, I see you nailed $K of those cats."
msgstr "Según su caja negra, veo que ha acabado con $K de los gatos."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/21/scene/1/record/10"
msgid "No confirmed Kilrathi kills, $R.  What were you doing out there?"
msgstr "No tiene muertes Kilrathi confirmadas, $R. ¿Qué estuvo haciendo ahí fuera?"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/21/scene/1/record/11"
msgid "Doomsday took down $L Kilrathi."
msgstr "Doomsday derribó $L Kilrathi."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/21/scene/1/record/12"
msgid "Doomsday came up with zero."
msgstr "Doomsday ha vuelto sin nada."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/21/scene/1/record/13"
msgid "And then the cats killed him."
msgstr "Además los gatos lo derribaron."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/21/scene/1/record/14"
msgid "Damn it, the Austin and the Tiger's Claw can't afford casualties, not now!"
msgstr "Maldita sea, ¡la Austin y la Garra de Tigre no se pueden permitir más bajas, ahora no!"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/21/scene/1/record/15"
msgid "Major Marks asked me to relay her thanks for the rescue.  She's in Sickbay with the wounded marines."
msgstr "La Mayor Marks me ha pedido que le transmita su agradecimiento por el rescate. Está en la Enfermería con los marines heridos."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/21/scene/1/record/16"
msgid "You might want to stop by there before Company Zebra leaves for Firekka."
msgstr "Tal vez quiera pasar por allí antes de que la Compañía Zebra se marche hacia Firekka."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/21/scene/1/record/17"
msgid "$C, I need to see you in my office later."
msgstr "$C, quiero verle luego en mi oficina."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/21/scene/1/record/18"
msgid "You're dismissed, pilots."
msgstr "Pilotos, pueden retirarse."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/21/scene/1/record/19"
msgid "You're dismissed, pilot."
msgstr "Piloto, puede retirarse."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/21/scene/2/record/0"
msgid "Bar's closed, $C!  There's some kind of emergency on the Bridge!"
msgstr "¡El Bar está cerrado, $C! ¡Hay una emergencia en el Puente!"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/21/scene/2/record/1"
msgid "Don't know what it is, but I do know that one of the marine transports didn't arrive on schedule."
msgstr "No sé cuál es, pero sé que uno de los transportes de marines no ha llegado según lo planificado."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/21/scene/2/record/2"
msgid "You'd better go to Briefing right away, $R!"
msgstr "¡Será mejor que vaya a la Sesión Informativa ahora mismo, $R!"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/24/scene/0/record/0"
msgid "Mission Briefing, $T, $D.\nCorsair System, Antares Sector."
msgstr "Sesión Informativa de la Misión, $T, $D\nSistema Corsair, Sector Antares"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/24/scene/0/record/1"
msgid "Pilots, the good news:  Four Marine assault shuttlecraft did a successful splashdown landing on Firekka."
msgstr "Pilotos, las buenas noticias. Cuatro lanzaderas de asalto de los Marines hicieron un amerizaje exitoso en Firekka."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/24/scene/0/record/2"
msgid "They've left their ships submerged, and are now planning the attack with the Firekka leaders."
msgstr "Han dejado sus naves sumergidas, y ahora están planeando el ataque con los líderes Firekkan."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/24/scene/0/record/3"
msgid "The bad news:  we've detected several wings of Kilrathi fighters on a final approach to the Tiger's Claw."
msgstr "Las malas noticias. Hemos detectado varias alas de cazas Kilrathi que se acercan definitivamente a la Garra de Tigre."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/24/scene/0/record/4"
msgid "An enemy patrol wing must have tracked our transports back to this system."
msgstr "Un ala de patrulla enemiga debe haber rastreado nuestros transportes hacia este sistema."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/24/scene/0/record/5"
msgid "We have to destroy them, pilots, before they can confirm our position in this system."
msgstr "Pilotos, tenemos que destruirlas antes de que puedan confirmar nuestra posición en este sistema."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/24/scene/0/record/6"
msgid "We're launching all wings immediately.  Clear this area of any fighters---"
msgstr "Todas las alas despegarán de inmediato. Despejen esta zona de cazas..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/24/scene/0/record/7"
msgid "---and then patrol your Nav points for any enemy capital ships."
msgstr "...y después patrullen sus Puntos Nav buscando naves insignia enemigas."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/24/scene/0/record/8"
msgid "You wait as the Colonel assigns the other wings."
msgstr "Esperas mientras el coronel asigna el resto de alas."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/24/scene/0/record/9"
msgid "Sigma Wing will be $C and Hunter, with $C as wingleader."
msgstr "El Ala Sigma la formarán $C y Hunter, $C será el líder del ala."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/24/scene/0/record/10"
msgid "Sigma Wing will be $C, flying solo."
msgstr "El Ala Sigma la formará $C, volará en solitario."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/24/scene/0/record/11"
msgid "Get out there and stop those fighters, pilots.  Dismissed."
msgstr "Salgan ahí fuera y destruyan esos cazas, pilotos. Retírense."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/24/scene/1/record/0"
msgid "Mission Debriefing -- $T, $D."
msgstr "Después de la Misión, $T, $D"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/24/scene/1/record/1"
msgid "Welcome back, $C. Let's hear your report."
msgstr "Bienvenido de vuelta, $C. Oigamos su informe."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/24/scene/1/record/2"
msgid "I lost Hunter, sir.  I tried to save him, but..."
msgstr "He perdido a Hunter, Señor. Intenté salvarlo, pero..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/24/scene/1/record/3"
msgid "I know you did your best, $N.  Tell me what happened."
msgstr "Sé que hizo lo que pudo, $N. Dígame qué ha ocurrido."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/24/scene/1/record/4"
msgid "The fighters were tough, sir.  After tangling with them, I couldn't go after the strike fleet."
msgstr "Los cazas eran muy duros, Señor. Después de enredarnos con ellos, no pude ir a por la flota de ataque."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/24/scene/1/record/5"
msgid "That's not good enough, $C!  I expect a hell of a lot better from you, mister."
msgstr "¡Eso no es suficiente, $C! Espero que lo haga mucho mejor que eso, caballero."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/24/scene/1/record/7"
msgid "I went after that strike fleet, sir."
msgstr "Fui a por la primera flota de ataque, Señor."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/24/scene/1/record/8"
msgid "We went after that strike fleet, sir."
msgstr "Fuimos a por la primera flota de ataque, Señor."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/24/scene/1/record/9"
msgid "The Ralari at Nav 2 is history."
msgstr "La Ralari de Nav 2 es historia."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/24/scene/1/record/10"
msgid "The Snakeir wasn't much trouble.  It's splashed."
msgstr "La Snakeir no supuso muchos problemas. Está destruida."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/24/scene/1/record/11"
msgid "Your kills totaled $K, $C."
msgstr "Su total de muertes es $K, $C."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/24/scene/1/record/12"
msgid "You didn't kill a single ship.  Why do I keep sending you out?"
msgstr "No ha derribado ni una nave. ¿Por qué sigo enviándolo ahí fuera?"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/24/scene/1/record/13"
msgid "Hunter killed $L himself."
msgstr "Hunter ha derribado $L."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/24/scene/1/record/14"
msgid "Hunter was blanked."
msgstr "Hunter ha vuelto sin nada."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/24/scene/1/record/15"
msgid "And then the Kilrathi took him down, damn them all."
msgstr "Además los Kilrathi lo derribaron, malditos sean todos."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/24/scene/1/record/16"
msgid "$C, I'll need to see you in my office later."
msgstr "$C, quiero verle luego en mi oficina."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/24/scene/1/record/17"
msgid "You're dismissed, pilot."
msgstr "Retírese, piloto."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/24/scene/1/record/18"
msgid "Dismissed, pilots."
msgstr "Retírense, pilotos."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/24/scene/2/record/0"
msgid "I just heard a bad rumor, $R..."
msgstr "He oído un rumor nefasto, $R..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/24/scene/2/record/1"
msgid "There may not be any reinforcements arriving here."
msgstr "Quizás no vengan refuerzos aquí."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/24/scene/2/record/2"
msgid "My guess is that HQ thinks we're overextended, an' doesn't want to risk any more ships."
msgstr "Supongo que el Cuartel General cree que estamos desbordados, y no quieren arriesgar más naves."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/24/scene/2/record/3"
msgid "All I know for certain is that the Austin's pulling out."
msgstr "Lo único que sé seguro es que la Austin se retira."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/24/scene/2/record/4"
msgid "An' I'm hopin' we'll follow them, as soon as the marines are off the planet."
msgstr "Y espero que nosotros vayamos detrás, en cuanto los marines hayan salido del planeta."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/24/scene/2/record/5"
msgid "There's a huge enemy fleet near Firekka.  Sooner or later, they'll find us hidin' here."
msgstr "Hay una flota enemiga enorme cerca de Firekka. Tarde o temprano averiguarán que nos escondemos aquí."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/24/scene/2/record/6"
msgid "An' then what?  We can't win against those odds."
msgstr "¿Y entonces qué? No hay ninguna oportunidad de que ganemos."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/24/scene/2/record/7"
msgid "Well, let me get a drink for you.  I keep thinkin' about that old Chinese saying...."
msgstr "Bueno, deje que le ponga una copa. Le sigo dando vueltas a un viejo dicho Chino..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/24/scene/2/record/8"
msgid "...and wonderin' if there'll ever be an end to all of these interestin' times."
msgstr "...y me pregunto si alguna vez habrá un final para todos estos momentos tan interesantes."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/24/scene/3/record/0"
msgid "Well, Maestro, I guess this is good-bye."
msgstr "Bueno, Maestro, supongo que esto es una despedida."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/24/scene/3/record/1"
msgid "I'm glad I had a chance to serve aboard the Tiger's Claw."
msgstr "Me alegro de haber tenido la oportunidad de servir a bordo de la Garra de Tigre."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/24/scene/3/record/2"
msgid "I've learned a lot here.  And I've been doing a lot of thinking---"
msgstr "Aquí he aprendido mucho. Y he pensado en muchas cosas..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/24/scene/3/record/3"
msgid "---'bout what I'm going to do when I'm back on the Austin."
msgstr "...sobre qué voy a hacer cuando vuelva a la Austin."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/24/scene/3/record/4"
msgid "I think my experience here is going to change my entire career."
msgstr "Creo que mi experiencia aquí va a cambiar toda mi carrera."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/24/scene/3/record/5"
msgid "Glad to hear it, Jazz.  And I hope we'll see each other again."
msgstr "Me alegro de oírlo, Jazz. Y espero que nos volvamos a ver."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/24/scene/3/record/6"
msgid "I'd bet on it, $C."
msgstr "Seguro que sí, $C."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/24/scene/4/record/0"
msgid "Good day, $R.  I don't know if you'd heard or not..."
msgstr "Buenos días, $R. No sé si lo sabe..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/24/scene/4/record/1"
msgid "...Jazz and I are going back to the Austin."
msgstr "...pero Jazz y yo volvemos a la Austin."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/24/scene/4/record/2"
msgid "It has been a pleasure to serve with you, $C."
msgstr "Ha sido un placer servir con usted, $C."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/24/scene/4/record/3"
msgid "You're a good wingman, Etienne.  I hope we'll fly together against the Kilrathi again, someday."
msgstr "Es un buen copiloto, Etienne. Espero que algún día volvamos a volar juntos contra los Kilrathi."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/24/scene/4/record/4"
msgid "Perhaps.  If the Kilrathi do not destroy us first.  Or our ships do not malfunction and self-destruct."
msgstr "Puede. Si los Kilrathi no nos destruyen antes. O nuestras naves no tienen una avería y se autodestruyen."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/24/scene/4/record/5"
msgid "Or we aren't assigned to desk jobs on the opposite sides of the galaxy.  Or---"
msgstr "O no nos asignan a trabajos de oficina en lados opuestos de la galaxia. O..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/25/scene/0/record/0"
msgid "Mission Briefing, $T, $D.\nCorsair System, Antares Sector."
msgstr "Sesión Informativa de la Misión, $T, $D\nSistema Corsair, Sector Antares"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/25/scene/0/record/1"
msgid "All right, pilots, we're down to the wire now."
msgstr "Muy bien, pilotos, vamos contra reloj."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/25/scene/0/record/2"
msgid "Our marines are in position, and ready to launch their assault."
msgstr "Nuestros marines están en posición y listos para lanzar el asalto."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/25/scene/0/record/3"
msgid "And the Kilrathi are sending ground troops to stop them."
msgstr "Y los Kilrathi están enviando tropas de infantería para detenerlos."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/25/scene/0/record/4"
msgid "Your assignment is to intercept and destroy those troopships."
msgstr "Su tarea es interceptar y destruir estas naves con tropas."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/25/scene/0/record/5"
msgid "If we fail at this, pilots, and enough enemy troops land on the planet---"
msgstr "Pilotos, si fracasamos en esto, y aterrizan suficientes tropas en el planeta..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/25/scene/0/record/6"
msgid "---it's likely that none of our marines will survive."
msgstr "...es probable que no sobreviva ninguno de nuestros marines."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/25/scene/0/record/7"
msgid "So don't let ANY of the Kilrathi troopships get past you.  Understood?"
msgstr "Así que no dejen pasar NINGUNA nave con tropas Kilrathi. ¿Entendido?"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/25/scene/0/record/8"
msgid "$C!  You're with Hunter again, as Mu Wing."
msgstr "¡$C! Volverá a ir con Hunter, como el Ala Mu."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/25/scene/0/record/9"
msgid "$C!  You're Mu Wing."
msgstr "¡$C! Usted formará el Ala Mu."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/25/scene/0/record/10"
msgid "Launch and cruise to your Nav One.  That's where you'll probably find the first enemy troopship."
msgstr "Despegue y navegue hasta el Punto Nav 1. Seguramente allí se encontrará la primera nave con tropas enemigas."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/25/scene/0/record/11"
msgid "Whatever you do, make sure it doesn't mini-jump.  If it does, track it to the next Nav point and destroy it."
msgstr "Pase lo que pase, asegúrese de que no hace ningún minisalto. Si lo hace, sígala hasta el siguiente Punto Nav y la destruye."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/25/scene/0/record/12"
msgid "Check the asteroid field at your Nav 2, then return home."
msgstr "Compruebe el campo de asteroides en Nav 2, después, vuelva a casa."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/25/scene/0/record/13"
msgid "The Colonel quickly assigns the other wings."
msgstr "El coronel rápidamente asigna las otras alas."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/25/scene/0/record/14"
msgid "All right, pilots.  Prepare for immediate launch."
msgstr "Está bien, pilotos. Prepárense para un despegue inmediato."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/25/scene/0/record/15"
msgid "Dismissed."
msgstr "Retírense."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/25/scene/1/record/0"
msgid "Mission Debriefing -- $T, $D."
msgstr "Después de la Misión, $T, $D"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/25/scene/1/record/1"
msgid "The other wings encountered a large number of Kilrathi troopships---"
msgstr "Las otras alas se han encontrado con un elevado número de naves con tropas Kilrathi..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/25/scene/1/record/2"
msgid "Some of those Dorkir-class ships got past our fighters, but not many."
msgstr "Algunas de esas naves de clase Dorkir han superado nuestros cazas, pero no muchas."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/25/scene/1/record/3"
msgid "Let's hear your report, $C."
msgstr "Oigamos su informe, $C."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/25/scene/1/record/4"
msgid "There were a lot of enemy ships moving through my Nav course, sir."
msgstr "Habían un montón de naves enemigas moviéndose por mi ruta Nav, Señor."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/25/scene/1/record/5"
msgid "I ran into two Dorkir troop carriers between Nav 1 and 2.  They're both iced."
msgstr "Me topé con dos naves de tropas Dorkir entre Nav 1 y 2. Derribé las dos."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/25/scene/1/record/6"
msgid "Good work, $C!  I'm very impressed."
msgstr "¡Buen trabajo, $C! Estoy muy impresionado."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/25/scene/1/record/8"
msgid "I couldn't ice any of the Dorkir troop carriers."
msgstr "No pude derribar ninguna de las naves de tropas Dorkir."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/25/scene/1/record/9"
msgid "Why do I keep sending you out on these missions?  Your incompetence is endangering all of us."
msgstr "¿Por qué sigo enviándole a estas misiones? Su incompetencia nos está poniendo a todos en peligro."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/25/scene/1/record/10"
msgid "There were two Dorkir troop carriers between Nav 1 and 2.  One of them escaped."
msgstr "Habían dos naves de tropas Dorkir entre Nav 1 y 2. Una de ellas escapó."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/25/scene/1/record/11"
msgid "But the other ship was destroyed, sir."
msgstr "Pero la otra nave fue destruida, Señor."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/25/scene/1/record/12"
msgid "There were two Dorkir troop carriers between Nav 1 and 2.  One of them escaped."
msgstr "Habían dos naves de tropas Dorkir entre Nav 1 y 2. Una de ellas escapó."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/25/scene/1/record/13"
msgid "But the other ship was destroyed, sir."
msgstr "Pero la otra nave fue destruida, Señor."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/25/scene/1/record/14"
msgid "Do you realize your failure on this mission may have doomed our troops on Firekka, pilot?"
msgstr "¿Se da cuenta de que su fracaso en esta misión podría haber condenado a nuestras tropas de Firekka, piloto?"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/25/scene/1/record/15"
msgid "The recorder credits you with killing $K, $C."
msgstr "La caja negra le atribuye $K Kilrathi, $C."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/25/scene/1/record/16"
msgid "You came up empty, $C. What the hell were you doing out there, mister?"
msgstr "Ha vuelto sin nada, $C. ¿Qué demonios ha estado haciendo ahí fuera, caballero?"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/25/scene/1/record/17"
msgid "I see that Hunter took down $L."
msgstr "Veo que Hunter ha derribado $L."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/25/scene/1/record/18"
msgid "I see that Hunter didn't manage any kills."
msgstr "Veo que Hunter no ha conseguido ningún derribo."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/25/scene/1/record/19"
msgid "And then we lost him."
msgstr "Además lo hemos perdido."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/25/scene/1/record/20"
msgid "That's all, $R.  Get some rest before your next mission."
msgstr "Eso es todo, $R. Descanse un poco antes de su próxima misión."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/25/scene/1/record/21"
msgid "And I'll need to see you in my office later."
msgstr "Y quiero verle luego en mi oficina."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/25/scene/1/record/22"
msgid "Dismissed."
msgstr "Retírese."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/25/scene/2/record/0"
msgid "Sorry, $R, can't pour anything for you.  You're within your eight hour limit."
msgstr "Lo siento, $R, no puedo ponerle nada. Está dentro de su límite de ocho horas."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/25/scene/2/record/1"
msgid "I have some real British tea, though, that I keep here for Colonel Roberts."
msgstr "Pero tengo un poco de té Inglés auténtico, lo guardo para el Coronel Roberts."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/25/scene/2/record/2"
msgid "Thanks, Sam, I'll try some of that.  Have you heard any news lately?"
msgstr "Gracias, Sam, probaré un poco. ¿Ha oído algo nuevo últimamente?"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/25/scene/2/record/3"
msgid "Not really.  Most of the Bridge officers aren't talkin' much."
msgstr "La verdad es que no. Los oficiales del Puente no hablan mucho."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/25/scene/2/record/4"
msgid "I think everyone's waitin' to hear what's happened to the marines on Firekka."
msgstr "Creo que todos están esperando a saber lo que ha ocurrido con los marines en Firekka."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/25/scene/2/record/5"
msgid "We'll find out real soon, I think."
msgstr "Pero creo que lo averiguaremos muy pronto."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/25/scene/3/record/0"
msgid "$R!  You look like you're holding up well through all of this."
msgstr "¡$R! Tiene aspecto de llevar bien todo esto."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/25/scene/3/record/1"
msgid "I just keep thinking about our marines.  At least we're out here, a safe distance---"
msgstr "Yo sigo pensando en nuestros marines. Al menos nosotros estamos aquí fuera, a una distancia segura..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/25/scene/3/record/2"
msgid "---from all of those Kilrathi battle fleets.  But those marines are right in the thick of it."
msgstr "...de todas esas flotas de combate Kilrathi. Pero esos marines están al pie del cañón."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/25/scene/3/record/3"
msgid "And I keep thinking about that flight instructor job."
msgstr "Y también sigo pensando sobre aquel trabajo de instructor de vuelo."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/25/scene/3/record/4"
msgid "It might be good, just for once, not to be right in the middle of a hot zone."
msgstr "Podría estar bien, al menos por una vez, no estar justo en medio de una zona peligrosa."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/25/scene/3/record/5"
msgid "But I've made my decision.  I'm going to stay here, aboard the Tiger's Claw."
msgstr "Pero ya he tomado una decisión. Voy a quedarme aquí, a bordo de la Garra de Tigre."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/25/scene/3/record/6"
msgid "I think you'd be a great instructor, Joseph."
msgstr "Creo que sería un instructor estupendo, Joseph."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/25/scene/3/record/7"
msgid "But I'm glad you're staying with us."
msgstr "Pero me alegro de que se quede con nosotros."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/25/scene/3/record/8"
msgid "Thanks, $C."
msgstr "Gracias, $C."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/25/scene/4/record/0"
msgid "$C.  I just read a report from Major Baker in the Vega Sector."
msgstr "$C. Acabo de leer un informe del Mayor Baker en el Sector Vega."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/25/scene/4/record/1"
msgid "Apparently they captured two human traitors on the TCS Winterrowd."
msgstr "Por lo visto han capturado a dos traidores humanos en la TCS Winterrowd."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/25/scene/4/record/2"
msgid "Two of our own people, giving vital military information to the Kilrathi."
msgstr "Dos de los nuestros, dando una información militar vital a los Kilrathi."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/25/scene/4/record/3"
msgid "Now they think there might be a large network of human traitors..."
msgstr "Ahora creen que podría haber una red enorme de traidores humanos..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/25/scene/4/record/4"
msgid "...and they're calling it the 'Society of Mandarins.'"
msgstr "...y la llaman la 'Sociedad Mandarín'."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/25/scene/4/record/5"
msgid "I'm just glad we haven't had any sign of traitors here on the Tiger's Claw."
msgstr "Me alegro de que no hayamos tenido noticias de que haya algún traidor aquí, en la Garra de Tigre."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/25/scene/4/record/6"
msgid "Because if there were any here, I'd kill them myself."
msgstr "Porque si aquí hubiera uno, lo mataría yo mismo."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/0/record/0"
msgid "Mission Briefing, $T, $D.\nCorsair System, Antares Sector."
msgstr "Sesión Informativa de la Misión, $T, $D\nSistema Corsair, Sector Antares"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/0/record/1"
msgid "Pilots, we've received confirmation from the marines on Firekka."
msgstr "Pilotos, hemos recibido confirmación de los marines en Firekka."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/0/record/2"
msgid "They succeeded in disrupting the Sivar ceremony, but took heavy casualties in their mission."
msgstr "Han tenido éxito desbaratando la ceremonia Sivar, pero ha habido un elevado número de bajas en su misión."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/0/record/3"
msgid "And the Kilrathi are patrolling the area to make sure that they can't escape from Firekka."
msgstr "Y los Kilrathi están patrullando la zona para asegurarse de que nadie abandone Firekka."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/0/record/4"
msgid "Four marine ships have already been destroyed, trying to leave the planet."
msgstr "Ya han destruido cuatro naves de marines que intentaban dejar el planeta."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/0/record/5"
msgid "And we've received another communique from this Prince Thrakhath..."
msgstr "Y hemos recibido otro comunicado de este Príncipe Thrakhath..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/0/record/6"
msgid "Tactical's very puzzled by this.  To send a single-pulse vid message---"
msgstr "Los de Operaciones están desconcertados. Enviar un mensaje de video de un único pulso..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/0/record/7"
msgid "---means that the Kilrathi know exactly where we are.  But they're talking, not shooting."
msgstr "...significa que los Kilrathi saben exactamente dónde estamos. Pero están hablando, no disparando."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/0/record/8"
msgid "And what this Prince Thrakhath says is even more interesting..."
msgstr "Y lo que dice el Príncipe Thrakhath es incluso más interesante..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/0/record/9"
msgid "'Human warriors, hear me now.  You have proven that you are brave---'"
msgstr "'Guerreros humanos, ahora escuchadme. Habéis demostrado que sois valientes...'"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/0/record/10"
msgid "'---astonishingly brave, for mere apes.  Because of this bravery---'"
msgstr "'...increíblemente valientes, por ser solo unos simios. Debido a esta valentía...'"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/0/record/11"
msgid "'---I shall grant you one quarter of a planetary rotation to leave this sector.'"
msgstr "'...os concederé un cuarto de la rotación planetaria para marcharos del sector.'"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/0/record/12"
msgid "'But your land soldiers are ours.  We shall run them to ground like the apes that they are.'"
msgstr "'Pero vuestros soldados de infantería son nuestros. Los capturaremos como simios que son.'"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/0/record/13"
msgid "'Thus speaks Prince Thrakhath, Firstborn of the Firstborn, Heir to Kilrah.'"
msgstr "'Así habla el Príncipe Thrakhath, el Primogénito del Primogénito, Heredero de Kilrah.'"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/0/record/14"
msgid "Tactical's conclusion from this is that because the ceremony was interrupted---"
msgstr "La conclusión de Operaciones de esto es que como hemos interrumpido la ceremonia..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/0/record/15"
msgid "---Thrakhath may fear a mutiny among his troops if he orders a general attack."
msgstr "...Thrakhath podría temer un motín entre sus tropas si ordena un ataque general."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/0/record/16"
msgid "If his soldiers believe that they're destined to die in combat, they won't want to fight."
msgstr "Si sus soldados creen que están destinado a morir en combate, no querrán luchar."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/0/record/17"
msgid "Of course, Thrakhath will probably start using the Kilrathi tactic of shooting troops that disobey direct orders..."
msgstr "Aunque claro, Thrakhath seguramente empezará a usar la táctica Kilrathi de disparar a las tropas si desobedecen una orden directa..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/0/record/18"
msgid "But right now, we have time to act before all of his battle fleets converge on us."
msgstr "Pero ahora mismo, tenemos tiempo de actuar antes de que todas estas flotas de combate nos estrechen el cerco."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/0/record/19"
msgid "In case you're wondering about that, pilots, Tactical suggests that we retreat immediately."
msgstr "Pilotos, por si se lo preguntan, Operaciones sugiere que nos retiremos de inmediato."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/0/record/20"
msgid "And we will, after we rescue our Marine transports.  Your job is to find and assist those ships."
msgstr "Y lo haremos, después de rescatar nuestros transportes de Marines. Su trabajo es buscar y dar apoyo a estas naves."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/0/record/21"
msgid "$C, you're solo on this one."
msgstr "$C, en esta irá en solitario."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/0/record/22"
msgid "Wing assignments...$N and Deveraux are Omicron Wing."
msgstr "Asignaciones de ala... $N y Devereaux formarán el Ala Omicron."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/0/record/23"
msgid "The transports will be trying to shake their Kilrathi pursuers, so we don't know exactly where you'll find them."
msgstr "Los transportes intentarán librarse de sus perseguidores Kilrathi, así que no sabemos exactamente dónde los encontrarán."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/0/record/24"
msgid "But we've drawn up several possible flight paths to different jump points."
msgstr "Pero hemos trazado varias rutas posibles de vuelo a diferentes puntos de salto."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/0/record/25"
msgid "$C, you'll fly to your Nav 1, destroying any enemy ships you encounter..."
msgstr "$C, usted volará hasta Nav 1, destruyendo cualquier nave enemiga que se encuentre..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/0/record/26"
msgid "...and then return immediately to the Tiger's Claw."
msgstr "...y después volverá de inmediato a la Garra de Tigre."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/0/record/27"
msgid "You listen as the Colonel reads the other wing assignments."
msgstr "Escuchas mientras el coronel lee el resto de asignaciones de las alas."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/0/record/28"
msgid "We're expecting a major Kilrathi attack as soon as Thrakhath rallies his troops."
msgstr "Esperamos un ataque Kilrathi a gran escala en cuanto Thrakhath se congregue con sus tropas."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/0/record/29"
msgid "So get back here as fast as you can, and be ready to defend the Claw."
msgstr "Así que vuelvan aquí tan rápido como puedan, y estén preparados para defender la Garra."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/0/record/30"
msgid "Because if this carrier is destroyed, you'll have a long walk back to the Vega Sector."
msgstr "Porque si destruyen este portanaves, tendrán un largo camino de vuelta al Sector Vega."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/0/record/31"
msgid "You'll launch in five minutes, pilots.  Dismissed."
msgstr "Saldrán en cinco minutos, pilotos. Retírense."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/1/record/0"
msgid "Mission Debriefing -- $T, $D."
msgstr "Después de la Misión, $T, $D"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/1/record/1"
msgid "Let's hear your report, $C."
msgstr "Oigamos su informe, $C."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/1/record/2"
msgid "I heard about Angel.  Tell me what happened, $C."
msgstr "He oído lo de Angel. Cuénteme lo ocurrido, $C."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/1/record/3"
msgid "I couldn't help the Drayman, sir.  Too many enemy fighters."
msgstr "No pude ayudar a la Drayman, Señor. Habían demasiados cazas enemigos."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/1/record/4"
msgid "After you launched, we received a distress call from your Nav 1."
msgstr "Después de que despegara, recibimos una llamada de socorro desde su Nav 1."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/1/record/5"
msgid "One of our Marine transports was there, trying to evade a wing of Krants."
msgstr "Uno de nuestros transportes de Marines estaba allí, intentando evadir un ala de Krants."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/1/record/6"
msgid "They said that two other transports had left the planet with them, but hadn't survived."
msgstr "Dijeron que otros dos transportes habían dejado el planeta con ellos, pero no habían sobrevivido."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/1/record/7"
msgid "At the jump point, they turned off all power and tried to drift past the Kilrathi patrols."
msgstr "En el punto de salto, apagaron la energía e intentaron pasar a la deriva las patrullas Kilrathi."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/1/record/8"
msgid "They said that they'd vented the corridors near their airlocks, and left their own dead floating there---"
msgstr "Dijeron que habían sacado el aire de los pasillos cerca de las esclusas y dejaron a sus propios muertos flotando por ahí..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/1/record/9"
msgid "---so the Kilrathi boarding party would think there were no survivors.  But the cats saw through the ruse."
msgstr "...para que el grupo de abordaje Kilrathi pensara que no habían supervivientes. Pero los gatos no se lo tragaron."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/1/record/10"
msgid "When we received their vidlink message, they were under attack."
msgstr "Cuando recibimos su mensaje de videolink, los estaban atacando."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/1/record/11"
msgid "The Kilrathi were trying to destroy the ship, but I brought the Drayman back intact, sir."
msgstr "Los Kilrathi estaban intentando destruir la nave, pero traje la Drayman de vuelta intacta, Señor."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/1/record/12"
msgid "I'm impressed with how you handled this situation, $C.  Good work."
msgstr "Estoy impresionado por tal y como ha llevado la situación, $C. Buen trabajo."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/1/record/13"
msgid "But you couldn't stop the enemy from destroying the Drayman, $C."
msgstr "Pero no podía evitar que el enemigo destruyera la Drayman, $C."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/1/record/14"
msgid "I know you did your best, pilot.  But that wasn't good enough, not this time."
msgstr "Sé que hizo lo que pudo, piloto. Pero eso no fue suficiente, al menos esta vez no."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/1/record/15"
msgid "For the record, you killed $K."
msgstr "Para que quede constancia, ha matado $K."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/1/record/16"
msgid "Including a Ralari.  Not bad, $R."
msgstr "Incluyendo una Ralari. No está mal, $R."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/1/record/17"
msgid "You struck out, $R...no kills."
msgstr "Ha vuelto sin nada, $R... no tiene derribos."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/1/record/18"
msgid "Angel iced $L Kilrathi."
msgstr "Angel acabó con $L Kilrathi."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/1/record/19"
msgid "Angel didn't ice any Kilrathi."
msgstr "Angel no acabó con ningún Kilrathi."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/1/record/20"
msgid "And then we lost her."
msgstr "Además la hemos perdido."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/1/record/21"
msgid "$C, I'll want to see you in my office later."
msgstr "$C, quiero verle luego en mi oficina."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/1/record/22"
msgid "That's all, $N.  Dismissed."
msgstr "Eso es todo, $N. Retírese."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/2/record/0"
msgid "Did you hear the good news, $C?  Our marines trashed the Kilrathi ceremony on Firekka!"
msgstr "¿Ha oído las buenas noticias, $C? ¡Nuestros marines fastidiaron la ceremonia Kilrathi en Firekka!"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/2/record/1"
msgid "And did you hear about Angel's promotion to Major?"
msgstr "¿Y ya sabe que a Angel la han ascendido a Mayor?"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/2/record/2"
msgid "Of course, we're still stuck out here with all those damn Kilrathi battle fleets..."
msgstr "Eso sí, todavía estamos atrapados aquí con todas esas malditas flotas de combate Kilrathi..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/2/record/3"
msgid "...but this is something to celebrate!"
msgstr "...¡pero esto merece la pena celebrarlo!"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/3/record/0"
msgid "Bon jour, $C.  I hope you are well."
msgstr "Bon jour, $C. Espero que esté bien."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/3/record/1"
msgid "I'm fine, Angel.  But no one's seen you at all for the last few days, except at the briefings."
msgstr "Estoy bien, Angel. Pero nadie la ha visto durante estos últimos días, excepto en las sesiones informativas."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/3/record/2"
msgid "I know.  It was not that I was avoiding you and the others---"
msgstr "Lo sé. No es que estuviera evitándole a usted y a los demás..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/3/record/3"
msgid "---but I needed some time alone.  To make a decision."
msgstr "...pero necesitaba estar sola un tiempo. Para tomar una decisión."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/3/record/4"
msgid "Colonel Zaritsky has asked me to take command of the Austin's fighter squadron."
msgstr "El Coronel Zaritsky me ha pedido que tome el mando del escuadrón de cazas de la Austin."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/3/record/5"
msgid "I'll be promoted to Major, and will transfer to the Austin at our next rendezvous."
msgstr "Me ascenderán a Mayor, y me transferirán a la Austin en nuestro siguiente encuentro."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/3/record/6"
msgid "That's great news, Angel.  I'm really glad for you."
msgstr "Qué gran noticia, Angel. Me alegro por usted, de verdad."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/3/record/7"
msgid "Merci, my friend.  Thank you."
msgstr "Merci, amigo mío. Gracias."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/4/record/0"
msgid "$C.  I was speaking with Hunter a few \n hours ago."
msgstr "$C. Estuve hablando con Hunter hace unas horas."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/4/record/1"
msgid "He is still very distraught over his \n brother's death."
msgstr "Todavía está muy consternado por la muerte de su hermano."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/4/record/2"
msgid "$C.  I was remembering the last time I saw my fiance, on Epsilon Station."
msgstr "$C. Me estaba acordando de la última vez que vi a mi prometido, en la Estación Epsilon."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/4/record/3"
msgid "Many of us have suffered terrible losses.  But I cannot stop thinking that---"
msgstr "Muchos de nosotros hemos sufrido alguna pérdida terrible. Pero no dejo de pensar que..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/4/record/4"
msgid "---what we are doing here, it is important.  More important than any of us."
msgstr "...lo que hacemos aquí, es importante. Es más importante que cualquiera de nosotros."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/4/record/5"
msgid "I had begun to think that perhaps any war was wrong, that the cost of life is too high."
msgstr "Empezaba a pensar que tal vez las guerras estén mal, que el coste de vidas es demasiado alto."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/4/record/6"
msgid "But perhaps there are wars that must be \n fought, $C."
msgstr "Pero quizás hay guerras en las que debemos luchar, $C."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/28/scene/4/record/7"
msgid "And I think our own war against the Kilrathi is one of them."
msgstr "Y creo que nuestra propia guerra contra los Kilrathi es una de ellas."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/0/record/0"
msgid "Mission Briefing, $T, $D. Leaving the Corsair System, Antares Sector."
msgstr "Sesión Informativa de la Misión, $T, $D\nDejando el Sistema Corsair, Sector Antares"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/0/record/1"
msgid "Listen closely, everyone, because we don't have much time."
msgstr "Escuchen atentamente todos, porque no tenemos mucho tiempo."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/0/record/2"
msgid "As you've probably guessed, we're leaving this area as fast as we can."
msgstr "Como ya deben suponer, nos marchamos de esta zona tan rápido como podemos."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/0/record/3"
msgid "The Kilrathi battle fleets are maneuvering towards our last position in the Corsair System."
msgstr "Las flotas de combate Kilrathi están maniobrando hacia nuestra última posición en el Sistema Corsair."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/0/record/4"
msgid "The Kilrathi can't remain in this area much longer, even to pursue the Tiger's Claw---"
msgstr "Los Kilrathi no se pueden quedar mucho más en esta zona, ni siquiera para perseguir a la Garra de Tigre..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/0/record/5"
msgid "---because the Confederation is advancing through the abandoned Kilrathi positions in other sectors."
msgstr "...porque la Confederación está avanzando por todas las posiciones abandonadas por los Kilrathi en otros sectores."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/0/record/6"
msgid "So they'll have to withdraw their forces from this sector, and soon."
msgstr "Así que tendrán que retirar sus fuerzas de este sector, y será pronto."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/0/record/7"
msgid "But in the meantime, they're probably going to retaliate against the Firekka for disrupting their religious ceremony."
msgstr "Pero entretanto, seguramente tomarán represalias contra los Firekkan por interrumpir su ceremonia religiosa."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/0/record/8"
msgid "Which could include genocide.  At a minimum, the Firekka will be transported out-system as slaves."
msgstr "Y eso podría incluir el genocidio. Como mínimo transportarán a los Firekkan fuera del sistema como esclavos."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/0/record/9"
msgid "And we're going to try a very dangerous tactic to prevent that."
msgstr "Y nosotros vamos a intentar una táctica muy peligrosa para impedir eso."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/0/record/10"
msgid "Our goal is to inflict as much damage as possible on the Kilrathi on our way out-system."
msgstr "Nuestro objetivo es infligir todo el daño posible a los Kilrathi mientras salimos del sistema."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/0/record/11"
msgid "If we can kill enough of their ships, they won't have enough troops to remain near Firekka \n AND defend their borders."
msgstr "Si podemos acabar con bastantes naves suyas, no tendrán tropas suficientes para quedarse cerca de Firekka Y defender sus fronteras."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/0/record/12"
msgid "Our plan...the Tiger's Claw will make several mini-jumps to lure individual Kilrathi \n capital ships---"
msgstr "Nuestro plan... la Garra de Tigre hará varios minisaltos para atraer naves insignia Kilrathi individualmente..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/0/record/13"
msgid "---into ambush points.  Your assignment is to destroy as many of them as you can."
msgstr "...hacia puntos de emboscada. Su tarea será destruir tantas naves como puedan."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/0/record/14"
msgid "Pilots, I can't order you to go out on a suicide mission---"
msgstr "Pilotos, no les puedo ordenar que salgan a una misión suicida..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/0/record/15"
msgid "---but when you're flying out there, keep this in mind:"
msgstr "...pero cuando estén volando ahí fuera, tengan esto en cuenta:"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/0/record/16"
msgid "There are several million lives at stake on Firekka."
msgstr "Hay varios millones de vidas en peligro en Firekka."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/0/record/17"
msgid "They may not look like us, but they're just as human."
msgstr "Tal vez no se parezcan a nosotros, pero son como los humanos."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/0/record/18"
msgid "Measure your own lives against that, pilots, and make your own decision."
msgstr "Valoren sus propias vidas teniendo en cuenta eso, pilotos, y tomen su propia decisión."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/0/record/19"
msgid "$C! You're teamed with Angel again, as Omega Wing."
msgstr "¡$C! Formará equipo con Angel otra vez, en el Ala Omega."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/0/record/20"
msgid "$C!  You're Omega Wing."
msgstr "¡$C! Usted será el Ala Omega."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/0/record/21"
msgid "Follow your programmed Nav course.  You'll rejoin the Claw at the rendezvous point."
msgstr "Siga su ruta Nav programada. Se reunirá con la Garra en el punto de encuentro."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/0/record/22"
msgid "The Colonel quickly completes the wing assignments."
msgstr "El coronel termina rápidamente las asignaciones de alas."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/0/record/23"
msgid "You'll launch in five minutes, pilots.  Dismissed."
msgstr "Despegarán en cinco minutos, pilotos. Retírense."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/1/record/0"
msgid "Mission Debriefing -- $T, $D."
msgstr "Después de la Misión, $T, $D"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/1/record/1"
msgid "Your report, $C?"
msgstr "¿Su informe, $C?"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/1/record/2"
msgid "We couldn't take out any of the enemy capital ships, sir."
msgstr "No pudimos derribar ninguna de las naves insignia enemigas, Señor."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/1/record/3"
msgid "I couldn't take out any of the enemy capital ships, sir."
msgstr "No pude derribar ninguna de las naves insignia enemigas, Señor."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/1/record/5"
msgid "The Dorkir is history."
msgstr "La Dorkir es historia."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/1/record/6"
msgid "I couldn't take out the Dorkir."
msgstr "No pude acabar con la Dorkir."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/1/record/7"
msgid "The Fralthi wasn't much trouble.  It's slagged, sir."
msgstr "La Fralthi no supuso muchos problemas. Ha quedado destrozada, Señor."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/1/record/8"
msgid "But I couldn't slag the Fralthi, sir."
msgstr "Y no pude derribar la Fralthi, Señor."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/1/record/9"
msgid "Excellent, $C!  I knew you wouldn't let us down."
msgstr "¡Excelente, $C! Sabía que no nos fallaría."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/1/record/10"
msgid "The recorder shows you with killing $K, $C."
msgstr "La caja negra muestra que ha matado $K, $C."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/1/record/11"
msgid "$C, the flight recorder shows you with no kills.  Not good, son."
msgstr "$C, la caja negra muestra que no tiene ninguna muerte. No está bien, hijo."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/1/record/12"
msgid "Angel took down $L Kilrathi ships."
msgstr "Angel derribó $L Kilrathi."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/1/record/13"
msgid "Angel didn't take down any enemy ships."
msgstr "Angel no ha derribado ninguna nave enemiga."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/1/record/14"
msgid "And then we lost her."
msgstr "Además la hemos perdido."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/1/record/15"
msgid "$N...I don't believe in lying to my pilots.  So I'm going to tell you the truth..."
msgstr "$N... no me gusta mentir a mis pilotos. Así que le voy a ser sincero..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/1/record/16"
msgid "We're outnumbered and outgunned here.  If we stay, the only way this scenario can end---"
msgstr "Aquí nos superan en número y en armas. Si nos quedamos, este escenario solo puede terminar de una forma..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/1/record/17"
msgid "---is with the total destruction of the Tiger's Claw."
msgstr "...con la destrucción total de la Garra de Tigre."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/1/record/18"
msgid "So we're going to retreat immediately.  There's nothing else we can do for the Firekka---"
msgstr "Así que nos vamos a retirar de inmediato. No podemos hacer nada más por los Firekkan..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/1/record/19"
msgid "---except inflict as much damage on the Kilrathi as much as we can, on our way out-system."
msgstr "...a excepción de infligir todo el daño posible a los Kilrathi mientras salimos del sistema."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/1/record/20"
msgid "But $C, you and the other pilots...what you've accomplished is far above the call of duty."
msgstr "Pero $C, usted y los otros pilotos... lo que han conseguido está mucho más allá de su cumplimiento del deber."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/1/record/21"
msgid "You've flown better than you ever have before, and against impossible odds."
msgstr "Han volado mejor que nunca, y contra una probabilidad imposible."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/1/record/22"
msgid "If we survive the next few days and return to Confed HQ, I'll make sure you're rewarded for this."
msgstr "Si sobrevivimos los próximos días y volvemos al Cuartel General de la Confederación, me aseguraré de que el condecoren por esto."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/1/record/23"
msgid "I'm sure you've heard that I'm transferring to Tactical Command.  When that happens---"
msgstr "Seguro que ha oído que me transfieren al Mando Táctico. Cuando eso ocurra..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/1/record/24"
msgid "---I want you, $C, to take command of the Tiger's Claw fighter squadron."
msgstr "...quiero que usted tome el mando del escuadrón de cazas de la Garra de Tigre, $C."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/1/record/25"
msgid "You've shown resourcefulness, and skill, and almost superhuman talent in these campaigns..."
msgstr "Ha demostrado iniciativa y habilidad, y casi un talento sobrehumano en estas campañas..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/1/record/26"
msgid "...and I think you'll be an outstanding squadron commander."
msgstr "...y creo que sería un comandante de escuadrón excepcional."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/1/record/27"
msgid "But we're not out of this yet, not by a long shot."
msgstr "Pero todavía no hemos salido de esta, ni por asomo."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/1/record/28"
msgid "You're still on Active Duty.  Get some rest, then report to Briefing."
msgstr "Usted todavía está en el Servicio Activo. Descanse un poco, y después preséntese en la Sesión Informativa."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/1/record/29"
msgid "And drop by my office later, $C."
msgstr "Y pase luego por mi oficina, $C."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/1/record/30"
msgid "Dismissed."
msgstr "Retírese."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/2/record/0"
msgid "Good to see you, $R $N.  I'll get one of your usual."
msgstr "Qué alegría verle, $R $N. Le pondré lo de siempre."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/2/record/1"
msgid "I heard that Maniac was on active duty again."
msgstr "Dicen que Maniac vuelve a estar en el servicio activo."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/2/record/2"
msgid "Let me tell you, $C, I can't believe they're letting him out of Sickbay."
msgstr "¿Sabe, $C?, no me puedo creer que lo dejen salir de la Enfermería."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/2/record/3"
msgid "I guess the Colonel thinks we need all hands on deck right now."
msgstr "Supongo que el coronel cree que ahora mismo necesitamos todas las manos posibles en cubierta."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/2/record/4"
msgid "They'd better not assign him as MY wingman."
msgstr "Será mejor que no lo asignen como MI copiloto."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/2/record/5"
msgid "Me, I'm just hopin' we're leavin' this sector soon---"
msgstr "Yo solo espero que nos vayamos pronto de este sector..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/2/record/6"
msgid "---'cause the odds of our flying out of here alive are gettin' real unfriendly."
msgstr "...porque la probabilidad de que salgamos vivos si salimos a volar ahí fuera es realmente desfavorable."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/3/record/0"
msgid "Sit down, mate, have a drink!"
msgstr "¡Siéntese, compañero, tome algo!"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/3/record/1"
msgid "Don't know whether you heard or not, but I'm on restricted duty again."
msgstr "No sé si lo habrá oído ya, pero vuelvo a tener el servicio limitado."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/3/record/2"
msgid "And it's all because they assigned that loony Maniac as my wingman..."
msgstr "Y todo gracias a que me asignaron como copiloto al lunático de Maniac..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/3/record/3"
msgid "What did you do, Hunter?"
msgstr "¿Qué ha hecho, Hunter?"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/3/record/4"
msgid "It was nothin', really.  Just a little practical joke..."
msgstr "La verdad es que no fue nada. Solo fue una pequeña novatada..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/3/record/5"
msgid "I reprogrammed his ship sensors so he thought he was bein' attacked by a thousand Kilrathi."
msgstr "Reprogramé los sensores de su nave para que pensara que le atacaban mil Kilrathi."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/3/record/6"
msgid "Fortunately, the Colonel had disabled the self-destructs on Maniac's ship..."
msgstr "Por suerte el coronel había desactivado la autodestrucción de la nave de Maniac..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/3/record/7"
msgid "...or the kid might've gone up in a burst of glory right then and there."
msgstr "...o el chaval habría saltado por los aires como una bola de fuego."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/3/record/8"
msgid "I can't believe they're letting him fly \n again.  He's insane."
msgstr "No me puedo creer que lo dejen volar otra vez. Está loco."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/3/record/9"
msgid "I think we're all a little crazy, mate.  Maybe you have to be a little nuts---"
msgstr "Creo que todos estamos un poco locos, compañero. Tal vez haya que estar un poco chiflado..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/3/record/10"
msgid "---to keep from going completely bonkers in a war like this."
msgstr "...para evitar no volverse majara del todo en una guerra como esta."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/4/record/0"
msgid "Confedhicom sent me a vidlink message two hours ago, $N..."
msgstr "Hace dos horas, el alto mando de la Confederación me envió un mensaje por videolink, $N..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/4/record/1"
msgid "...the TCS Jerusalem intercepted a slave ship..."
msgstr "...la TCS Jerusalén interceptó una nave de esclavos..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/4/record/2"
msgid "...and one of my daughters was aboard."
msgstr "...y una de mis hermanas estaba a bordo."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/4/record/3"
msgid "Julia's not...herself right now---"
msgstr "En estos momentos... Julia no es la misma..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/4/record/4"
msgid "---she can't talk or take care of herself---"
msgstr "...no puede hablar ni cuidar de ella por sí sola..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/4/record/5"
msgid "---but I'll see her as soon as we're back in Vega."
msgstr "...pero la iré a ver en cuanto volvamos a Vega."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/4/record/6"
msgid "It's been six long years, $C---"
msgstr "Han pasado seis largos años, $C..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/29/scene/4/record/7"
msgid "---but I'm going to see my little girl again."
msgstr "...pero voy a ver a mi pequeñina otra vez."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/32/scene/0/record/0"
msgid "Mission Briefing, $T, $D.\n Charon System, Antares Sector."
msgstr "Sesión Informativa de la Misión, $T, $D\nSistema Charon, Sector Antares"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/32/scene/0/record/1"
msgid "Pilots, we're heading for the Vega Sector border."
msgstr "Pilotos, nos estamos dirigiendo a la frontera del Sector Vega."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/32/scene/0/record/2"
msgid "There's nothing else we can do here...we can't win against these odds."
msgstr "Aquí ya no podemos hacer nada más... no podemos ganar con tan pocas posibilidades."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/32/scene/0/record/3"
msgid "And it may already be too late to retreat.  The Kilrathi are close behind us---"
msgstr "Y puede que sea demasiado tarde para retirarse. Los Kilrathi se están acercando..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/32/scene/0/record/4"
msgid "---and are pursuing us to the border."
msgstr "...y nos persiguen hasta la frontera."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/32/scene/0/record/5"
msgid "But our main problem isn't the Kilrathi fleet behind us---"
msgstr "Pero nuestro principal problema no es la flota Kilrathi que tenemos detrás..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/32/scene/0/record/6"
msgid "---but a small strike fleet that's stationed at the Vega border."
msgstr "...es una pequeña flota de ataque que está estacionada en la frontera de Vega."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/32/scene/0/record/7"
msgid "With the huge Kilrathi fleet behind us, we can't take the time to detour around the border ships."
msgstr "No tenemos tiempo de rodear las naves de la frontera con toda esa flota Kilrathi enorme que nos sigue."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/32/scene/0/record/8"
msgid "Your assignment is to clear those ships out of \n our path."
msgstr "Su tarea es despejar esas naves de nuestro camino."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/32/scene/0/record/9"
msgid "You'll have to work fast, pilots.  Because every minute that we delay here---"
msgstr "Tendrán que trabajar rápido, pilotos. Porque cada minuto que nos retrasemos aquí..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/32/scene/0/record/10"
msgid "---means that those Kilrathi battle fleets are closer on our tail."
msgstr "...significa que esas flotas de combate Kilrathi están más cerca de nosotros."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/32/scene/0/record/11"
msgid "These are your assignments..."
msgstr "Estas son sus asignaciones."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/32/scene/0/record/12"
msgid "You listen until the Colonel calls your name."
msgstr "Escuchas hasta que el coronel pronuncia tu nombre."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/32/scene/0/record/13"
msgid "Iota Wing is $C and Maniac, with $C as wingleader."
msgstr "El Ala Iota la formarán $C y Maniac, con $C como líder de ala."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/32/scene/0/record/14"
msgid "Iota Wing will be $C. You'll be alone on this run, $N."
msgstr "El Ala Iota será $C. En esta misión irá en solitario, $N."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/32/scene/0/record/15"
msgid "You'll fly to each of your Nav points."
msgstr "Volará a cada uno de sus Puntos Nav..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/32/scene/0/record/16"
msgid "...and destroy any Kilrathi capital ships that you encounter."
msgstr "...y destruirá cualquier nave insignia Kilrathi que se encuentre."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/32/scene/0/record/17"
msgid "Every minute counts right now, pilots.  Don't screw up out there."
msgstr "A partir de ahora cada minuto cuenta, pilotos. No la fastidien ahí fuera."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/32/scene/0/record/18"
msgid "Dismissed."
msgstr "Retírense."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/32/scene/1/record/0"
msgid "Mission Debriefing -- $T, $D."
msgstr "Después de la Misión, $T, $D"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/32/scene/1/record/1"
msgid "Anything to report, $C?"
msgstr "¿Algo que informar, $C?"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/32/scene/1/record/2"
msgid "I destroyed two Ralari at Nav 2."
msgstr "H dos Ralari en Nav 2."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/32/scene/1/record/3"
msgid "Very impressive, $R!"
msgstr "¡Impresionante, $R!"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/32/scene/1/record/5"
msgid "I attacked two Ralari at Nav 2.  One is toasted, sir."
msgstr "Ataqué dos Ralari en Nav 2. Una está frita, Señor."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/32/scene/1/record/6"
msgid "Good work, son."
msgstr "Buen trabajo, hijo."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/32/scene/1/record/7"
msgid "I attacked two Ralari at Nav 2.  One is toasted, sir."
msgstr "Ataqué dos Ralari en Nav 2. Una está frita, Señor."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/32/scene/1/record/8"
msgid "Good work, son."
msgstr "Buen trabajo, hijo."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/32/scene/1/record/9"
msgid "The Snakeir carrier at Nav 3 is history, sir."
msgstr "El portanaves Snakeir en Nav 3 es historia, Señor."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/32/scene/1/record/10"
msgid "Couldn't nail any enemy capital ships, sir."
msgstr "No pude acabar con ninguna nave insignia, Señor."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/32/scene/1/record/11"
msgid "I am NOT impressed, pilot."
msgstr "Eso NO me impresiona, piloto."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/32/scene/1/record/12"
msgid "$C, I see you bagged $K..."
msgstr "$C, veo que ha cazado $K..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/32/scene/1/record/13"
msgid "$C, I see you didn't bag any cats..."
msgstr "$C, veo que no ha cazado ningún gato..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/32/scene/1/record/14"
msgid "Maniac nailed $L."
msgstr "Maniac ha acabado con $L."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/32/scene/1/record/15"
msgid "Maniac was blanked."
msgstr "Maniac ha vuelto sin nada."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/32/scene/1/record/16"
msgid "And Marshall didn't come back from this one.  At least you survived, $N."
msgstr "Además Marshall no ha vuelto de esta. Al menos usted ha sobrevivido, $N."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/32/scene/1/record/17"
msgid "You're still on Active Duty, $C, so stay alert."
msgstr "Todavía se encuentra en Servicio Activo, $C, así que manténganse alerta."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/32/scene/1/record/18"
msgid "And I need to see you in my office later."
msgstr "Y quiero verle luego en mi oficina."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/32/scene/1/record/19"
msgid "Dismissed."
msgstr "Retírese."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/32/scene/2/record/0"
msgid "Did you hear, $C?  We're pullin' out of here."
msgstr "¿Se ha enterado, $C? Nos marchamos de aquí."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/32/scene/2/record/1"
msgid "I'll tell you, I've never been glad that we're retreatin' before."
msgstr "Le aseguro que nunca antes me había alegrado tanto de retirarnos."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/32/scene/2/record/2"
msgid "But this time, I am.  At least we'll have a chance to get out of this alive."
msgstr "Pero esta vez sí. Al menos tendremos una oportunidad de salir de esta vivos."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/32/scene/3/record/0"
msgid "Hello, $C.  Pull up a chair, sit down."
msgstr "Hola, $C. Coja una silla, siéntese."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/32/scene/3/record/1"
msgid "You've probably heard that we're retreating from this sector."
msgstr "Seguramente habrá oído que nos retiramos de este sector."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/32/scene/3/record/2"
msgid "I guess there's nothing else we can do here."
msgstr "Supongo que aquí ya no podemos hacer nada más."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/32/scene/3/record/3"
msgid "I just hope those Firekka can fight against the Kilrathi on their own."
msgstr "Espero que los Firekkan puedan luchar contra los Kilrathi por su cuenta."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/32/scene/3/record/4"
msgid "But I don't think there's much of a chance of that, really."
msgstr "Pero no creo que tengan muchas posibilidades, la verdad."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/32/scene/4/record/0"
msgid "Hey, $C.  Did you hear that I'm back on duty?"
msgstr "Hola, $C. ¿Sabe que ya he vuelto al servicio?"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/32/scene/4/record/1"
msgid "And I'm going to be your wingman!\n Isn't that great?"
msgstr "¡Voy a ser su copiloto! ¿No es genial?"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/32/scene/4/record/2"
msgid "That's really...terrific, Maniac."
msgstr "La verdad es que es... tremendo, Maniac."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/32/scene/4/record/3"
msgid "I thought you'd be pleased, $N."
msgstr "Pensaba que se alegraría, $N."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/32/scene/4/record/4"
msgid "Listen, I had this idea for a great weapon we can use against the furballs."
msgstr "Escuche, he tenido la idea de una gran arma que podemos usar contra los peludos."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/32/scene/4/record/5"
msgid "We can repack our standard missiles with a double load of ESK-5 explosives..."
msgstr "Podemos añadir a nuestros misiles estándar una carga doble de explosivos ESK-5..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/32/scene/4/record/6"
msgid "ESK-5?  But if you did that, they'd explode INSIDE your ship on your first high-G maneuver!"
msgstr "¿ESK-5?  Pero si hace eso, ¡explotarán DENTRO de su nave en su primera maniobra de alta gravedad!"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/32/scene/4/record/7"
msgid "Yeah, but you'd take out everything within a hundred klicks!"
msgstr "¡Sí, pero acabaré con todo lo que haya en cientos de kilómetros!"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/32/scene/4/record/8"
msgid "Everything within a hundred klicks, including yourself!"
msgstr "Con todo lo que haya en cientos de kilómetros, ¡incluido usted!"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/33/scene/0/record/0"
msgid "Mission Briefing, $T, $D. \n Border Zone, Vega Sector."
msgstr "Sesión Informativa de la Misión, $T, $D\nZona Fronteriza, Sector Vega"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/33/scene/0/record/1"
msgid "Pilots, there are several waves of enemy fighters on final approach to the Tiger's Claw."
msgstr "Pilotos, hay varias oleadas de cazas enemigos al final de su aproximación hacia la Garra de Tigre."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/33/scene/0/record/2"
msgid "We're nearly across the border...but we won't get there unless you stop those fighters."
msgstr "Ya casi hemos cruzado la frontera... pero no llegaremos allí a menos que ustedes detengan esos cazas."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/33/scene/0/record/3"
msgid "We'll launch waves of fighters one after another...clear the area of enemy fighters, then land immediately."
msgstr "Lanzaremos oleadas de cazas una detrás de otra... despejan la zona de cazas enemigos, y aterrizan de inmediato."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/33/scene/0/record/4"
msgid "We've detected a Snakeir, three Fralthi, and four Ralari on an intercept course."
msgstr "Hemos detectado una Snakeir, tres Fralthis y cuatro Ralaris con un rumbo de intercepción."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/33/scene/0/record/5"
msgid "So don't stray too far from the Claw...we MUST escape before that strike force arrives."
msgstr "Así que no se alejen demasiado de la Garra... DEBEMOS escapar antes de que llegue la fuerza de ataque."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/33/scene/0/record/6"
msgid "And if we have to leave you behind when we jump out-system, we will."
msgstr "Y si tenemos que dejarles atrás cuando saltemos fuera del sistema, lo haremos."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/33/scene/0/record/7"
msgid "Wing assignments...$N and Marshall are Upsilon Wing."
msgstr "Asignaciones de ala... $N y Marshall formarán el Ala Upsilon."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/33/scene/0/record/8"
msgid "$N, you're Upsilon Wing. I can't spare you a wingman."
msgstr "$N, usted formará el Ala Upsilon. No tengo ningún copiloto de sobra."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/33/scene/0/record/9"
msgid "The Colonel assigns the other wings quickly."
msgstr "El coronel asigna rápidamente las otras alas."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/33/scene/0/record/10"
msgid "Prepare to launch immediately, pilots.  Dismissed."
msgstr "Prepárense para salir inmediatamente, pilotos. Retírense."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/33/scene/1/record/0"
msgid "Mission Debriefing -- $T, $D."
msgstr "Después de la Misión, $T, $D"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/33/scene/1/record/1"
msgid "I have the numbers from your flight recorder, $C..."
msgstr "Tengo los números de su caja negra, $C..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/33/scene/1/record/2"
msgid "I see you took down $K enemy ships."
msgstr "Veo que ha derribado $K."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/33/scene/1/record/3"
msgid "I see you didn't take down any enemy ships, $N."
msgstr "Veo que no ha derribado ninguna nave enemiga, $N."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/33/scene/1/record/4"
msgid "Maniac iced $L."
msgstr "Maniac ha acabado con $L."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/33/scene/1/record/5"
msgid "Maniac didn't ice any enemy ships."
msgstr "Maniac no ha acabado con ninguna nave enemiga."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/33/scene/1/record/6"
msgid "And he didn't come back from this one.  At least you survived, $N."
msgstr "Además no ha vuelto de esta. Al menos usted ha sobrevivido, $N."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/33/scene/1/record/7"
msgid "What about the Firekka, sir?"
msgstr "¿Qué pasa con los Firekkan, Señor?"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/33/scene/1/record/8"
msgid "There's no way to know what's going down back there, $C."
msgstr "No hay forma de saber lo que está ocurriendo allí, $C."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/33/scene/1/record/9"
msgid "With luck, the Firekka can hold off the Kilrathi forces---"
msgstr "Con suerte los Firekkan podrán mantener a raya las fuerzas Kilrathi..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/33/scene/1/record/10"
msgid "---until the cats have to return to the war front---"
msgstr "...hasta que los gatos tengan que volver al frente de batalla..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/33/scene/1/record/11"
msgid "---but we may never know what happens."
msgstr "...pero tal vez nunca sepamos el resultado."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/33/scene/1/record/12"
msgid "I just wish we could do something more for them, sir."
msgstr "Ojalá pudiéramos hacer algo más por ellos, Señor."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/33/scene/1/record/13"
msgid "I know, son.  We did the best we could..."
msgstr "Lo sé, hijo. Hemos hecho todo lo que hemos podido..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/33/scene/1/record/14"
msgid "...but now everything depends on the Firekka."
msgstr "...pero ahora todo depende de los Firekkan."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/33/scene/1/record/15"
msgid "$C, I'll need to see you in my office later."
msgstr "$C, quiero verle luego en mi oficina."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/33/scene/1/record/16"
msgid "Dismissed."
msgstr "Retírese."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/33/scene/2/record/0"
msgid "$R!  You'd better get to Briefing right away!"
msgstr "¡$R! ¡Será mejor que vaya a la Sesión Informativa ahora mismo!"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/36/scene/0/record/0"
msgid "Mission Briefing, $T, $D.\n Charon System, Antares Sector."
msgstr "Sesión Informativa de la Misión, $T, $D\nSistema Charon, Sector Antares"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/36/scene/0/record/1"
msgid "Pilots, we're heading for the Vega Sector border."
msgstr "Pilotos, nos estamos dirigiendo a la frontera del Sector Vega."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/36/scene/0/record/2"
msgid "There's nothing else we can do here...we can't win against these odds."
msgstr "Aquí ya no podemos hacer nada más... no podemos ganar con tan pocas posibilidades."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/36/scene/0/record/3"
msgid "And it may already be too late to retreat.  The Kilrathi are close behind us---"
msgstr "Y puede que sea demasiado tarde para retirarse. Los Kilrathi se están acercando..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/36/scene/0/record/4"
msgid "---and are pursuing us to the border."
msgstr "...y nos persiguen hasta la frontera."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/36/scene/0/record/5"
msgid "But our main problem isn't the Kilrathi fleet behind us---"
msgstr "Pero nuestro principal problema no es la flota Kilrathi que tenemos detrás..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/36/scene/0/record/6"
msgid "---but a small strike fleet that's stationed at the Vega border."
msgstr "...es una pequeña flota de ataque que está estacionada en la frontera de Vega."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/36/scene/0/record/7"
msgid "With the huge Kilrathi fleet behind us, we can't take the time to detour around the border ships."
msgstr "No tenemos tiempo de rodear las naves de la frontera con toda esa flota Kilrathi enorme que nos sigue."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/36/scene/0/record/8"
msgid "Your assignment is to clear those ships out of \n our path."
msgstr "Su tarea es despejar esas naves de nuestro camino."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/36/scene/0/record/9"
msgid "You'll have to work fast, pilots.  Because every minute that we delay here---"
msgstr "Tendrán que trabajar rápido, pilotos. Porque cada minuto que nos retrasemos aquí..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/36/scene/0/record/10"
msgid "---means that those Kilrathi battle fleets are closer on our tail."
msgstr "...significa que esas flotas de combate Kilrathi están más cerca de nosotros."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/36/scene/0/record/11"
msgid "These are your assignments..."
msgstr "Estas son sus asignaciones."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/36/scene/0/record/12"
msgid "You listen until the Colonel calls your name."
msgstr "Escuchas hasta que el coronel pronuncia tu nombre."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/36/scene/0/record/13"
msgid "Iota Wing is $C and Maniac, with $C as wingleader."
msgstr "El Ala Iota la formarán $C y Maniac, con $C como líder de ala."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/36/scene/0/record/14"
msgid "Iota Wing will be $C. You'll be alone on this run, $N."
msgstr "El Ala Iota será $C. En esta misión irá en solitario, $N."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/36/scene/0/record/15"
msgid "You'll fly to each of your Nav points."
msgstr "Volará a cada uno de sus Puntos Nav..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/36/scene/0/record/16"
msgid "...and destroy any Kilrathi capital ships that you encounter."
msgstr "...y destruirá cualquier nave insignia Kilrathi que se encuentre."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/36/scene/0/record/17"
msgid "Every minute counts right now, pilots.  Don't screw up out there."
msgstr "A partir de ahora cada minuto cuenta, pilotos. No la fastidien ahí fuera."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/36/scene/0/record/18"
msgid "Dismissed."
msgstr "Retírense."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/36/scene/1/record/0"
msgid "Mission Debriefing -- $T, $D."
msgstr "Después de la Misión, $T, $D"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/36/scene/1/record/1"
msgid "Anything to report, $C?"
msgstr "¿Algo que informar, $C?"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/36/scene/1/record/2"
msgid "I destroyed two Ralari at Nav 2."
msgstr "He destruido dos Ralaris en Nav 2."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/36/scene/1/record/3"
msgid "Very impressive, $R!"
msgstr "¡Es impresionante, $R!"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/36/scene/1/record/5"
msgid "I attacked two Ralari at Nav 2.  One is toasted, sir."
msgstr "Ataqué dos Ralari en Nav 2. Una está frita, Señor."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/36/scene/1/record/6"
msgid "Good work, son."
msgstr "Buen trabajo, hijo."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/36/scene/1/record/7"
msgid "I attacked two Ralari at Nav 2.  One is toasted, sir."
msgstr "Ataqué dos Ralari en Nav 2. Una está frita, Señor."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/36/scene/1/record/8"
msgid "Good work, son."
msgstr "Buen trabajo, hijo."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/36/scene/1/record/9"
msgid "The Snakeir carrier at Nav 3 is history, sir."
msgstr "El portanaves Snakeir en Nav 3 es historia, Señor."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/36/scene/1/record/10"
msgid "Couldn't nail any enemy capital ships, sir."
msgstr "No pude acabar con ninguna nave insignia, Señor."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/36/scene/1/record/11"
msgid "I am NOT impressed, pilot."
msgstr "Eso NO me impresiona, piloto."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/36/scene/1/record/12"
msgid "$C, I see you bagged $K..."
msgstr "$C, veo que ha cazado $K..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/36/scene/1/record/13"
msgid "$C, I see you didn't bag any cats..."
msgstr "$C, veo que no ha cazado ningún gato..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/36/scene/1/record/14"
msgid "Maniac nailed $L."
msgstr "Maniac ha acabado con $L."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/36/scene/1/record/15"
msgid "Maniac was blanked."
msgstr "Maniac ha vuelto sin nada."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/36/scene/1/record/16"
msgid "And Marshall didn't come back from this one.  At least you survived, $N."
msgstr "Además Marshall no ha vuelto de esta. Al menos usted ha sobrevivido, $N."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/36/scene/1/record/17"
msgid "You're still on Active Duty, $C, so stay alert."
msgstr "Todavía se encuentra en Servicio Activo, $C, así que manténganse alerta."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/36/scene/1/record/18"
msgid "And I need to see you in my office later."
msgstr "Y quiero verle luego en mi oficina."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/36/scene/1/record/19"
msgid "Dismissed."
msgstr "Retírese."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/36/scene/2/record/0"
msgid "Did you hear, $C?  We're pullin' out of here."
msgstr "¿Se ha enterado, $C? Nos marchamos de aquí."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/36/scene/2/record/1"
msgid "I'll tell you, I've never been glad that we're retreatin' before."
msgstr "Le aseguro que nunca antes me había alegrado tanto de retirarnos."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/36/scene/2/record/2"
msgid "But this time, I am.  At least we'll have a chance to get out of this alive."
msgstr "Pero esta vez sí. Al menos tendremos una oportunidad de salir de esta vivos."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/36/scene/3/record/0"
msgid "Hello, $C.  Pull up a chair, sit down."
msgstr "Hola, $C. Coja una silla, siéntese."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/36/scene/3/record/1"
msgid "You've probably heard that we're retreating from this sector."
msgstr "Seguramente habrá oído que nos retiramos de este sector."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/36/scene/3/record/2"
msgid "I guess there's nothing else we can do here."
msgstr "Supongo que aquí ya no podemos hacer nada más."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/36/scene/3/record/3"
msgid "I just hope those Firekka can fight against the Kilrathi on their own."
msgstr "Espero que los Firekkan puedan luchar contra los Kilrathi por su cuenta."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/36/scene/3/record/4"
msgid "But I don't think there's much of a chance of that, really."
msgstr "Pero no creo que tengan muchas posibilidades, la verdad."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/36/scene/4/record/0"
msgid "Hey, $C.  Did you hear that I'm back on duty?"
msgstr "Hola, $C. ¿Sabe que ya he vuelto al servicio?"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/36/scene/4/record/1"
msgid "And I'm going to be your wingman!\n Isn't that great?"
msgstr "¡Voy a ser su copiloto! ¿No es genial?"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/36/scene/4/record/2"
msgid "That's really...terrific, Maniac."
msgstr "La verdad es que es... tremendo, Maniac."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/36/scene/4/record/3"
msgid "I thought you'd be pleased, $N."
msgstr "Pensaba que se alegraría, $N."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/36/scene/4/record/4"
msgid "Listen, I had this idea for a great weapon we can use against the furballs."
msgstr "Escuche, he tenido la idea de una gran arma que podemos usar contra los peludos."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/36/scene/4/record/5"
msgid "We can repack our standard missiles with a double load of ESK-5 explosives..."
msgstr "Podemos añadir a nuestros misiles estándar una carga doble de explosivos ESK-5..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/36/scene/4/record/6"
msgid "ESK-5?  But if you did that, they'd explode INSIDE your ship on your first high-G maneuver!"
msgstr "¿ESK-5?  Pero si hace eso, ¡explotarán DENTRO de su nave en su primera maniobra de alta gravedad!"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/36/scene/4/record/7"
msgid "Yeah, but you'd take out everything within a hundred klicks!"
msgstr "¡Sí, pero acabaré con todo lo que haya en cientos de kilómetros!"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/36/scene/4/record/8"
msgid "Everything within a hundred klicks, including yourself!"
msgstr "Con todo lo que haya en cientos de kilómetros, ¡incluido usted!"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/37/scene/0/record/0"
msgid "Mission Briefing, $T, $D. \n Border Zone, Vega Sector."
msgstr "Sesión Informativa de la Misión, $T, $D\nZona Fronteriza, Sector Vega"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/37/scene/0/record/1"
msgid "Pilots, there are several waves of enemy fighters on final approach to the Tiger's Claw."
msgstr "Pilotos, hay varias oleadas de cazas enemigos al final de su aproximación hacia la Garra de Tigre."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/37/scene/0/record/2"
msgid "We're nearly across the border...but we won't get there unless you stop those fighters."
msgstr "Ya casi hemos cruzado la frontera... pero no llegaremos allí a menos que ustedes detengan esos cazas."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/37/scene/0/record/3"
msgid "We'll launch waves of fighters one after another...clear the area of enemy fighters, then land immediately."
msgstr "Lanzaremos oleadas de cazas una detrás de otra... despejan la zona de cazas enemigos, y aterrizan de inmediato."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/37/scene/0/record/4"
msgid "We've detected a Snakeir, three Fralthi, and four Ralari on an intercept course."
msgstr "Hemos detectado una Snakeir, tres Fralthis y cuatro Ralaris con un rumbo de intercepción."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/37/scene/0/record/5"
msgid "So don't stray too far from the Claw...we MUST escape before that strike force arrives."
msgstr "Así que no se alejen demasiado de la Garra... DEBEMOS escapar antes de que llegue la fuerza de ataque."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/37/scene/0/record/6"
msgid "And if we have to leave you behind when we jump out-system, we will."
msgstr "Y si tenemos que dejarles atrás cuando saltemos fuera del sistema, lo haremos."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/37/scene/0/record/7"
msgid "Wing assignments...$N and Marshall are Upsilon Wing."
msgstr "Asignaciones de ala... $N y Marshall formarán el Ala Upsilon."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/37/scene/0/record/8"
msgid "$N, you're Upsilon Wing. I can't spare you a wingman."
msgstr "$N, usted formará el Ala Upsilon. No tengo ningún copiloto de sobra."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/37/scene/0/record/9"
msgid "The Colonel assigns the other wings quickly."
msgstr "El coronel asigna rápidamente las otras alas."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/37/scene/0/record/10"
msgid "Prepare to launch immediately, pilots.  Dismissed."
msgstr "Prepárense para salir inmediatamente, pilotos. Retírense."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/37/scene/1/record/0"
msgid "Mission Debriefing -- $T, $D."
msgstr "Después de la Misión, $T, $D"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/37/scene/1/record/1"
msgid "I have the numbers from your flight recorder, $C..."
msgstr "Tengo los números de su caja negra, $C..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/37/scene/1/record/2"
msgid "I see you took down $K enemy ships."
msgstr "Veo que ha derribado $K."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/37/scene/1/record/3"
msgid "I see you didn't take down any enemy ships, $N."
msgstr "Veo que no ha derribado ninguna nave enemiga, $N."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/37/scene/1/record/4"
msgid "Maniac iced $L."
msgstr "Maniac ha acabado con $L."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/37/scene/1/record/5"
msgid "Maniac didn't ice any enemy ships."
msgstr "Maniac no ha acabado con ninguna nave enemiga."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/37/scene/1/record/6"
msgid "And he didn't come back from this one.  At least you survived, $N."
msgstr "Además no ha vuelto de esta. Al menos usted ha sobrevivido, $N."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/37/scene/1/record/7"
msgid "What about the Firekka, sir?"
msgstr "¿Qué pasa con los Firekkan, Señor?"

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/37/scene/1/record/8"
msgid "There's no way to know what's going down back there, $C."
msgstr "No hay forma de saber lo que está ocurriendo allí, $C."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/37/scene/1/record/9"
msgid "With luck, the Firekka can hold off the Kilrathi forces---"
msgstr "Con suerte los Firekkan podrán mantener a raya las fuerzas Kilrathi..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/37/scene/1/record/10"
msgid "---until the cats have to return to the war front---"
msgstr "...hasta que los gatos tengan que volver al frente de batalla..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/37/scene/1/record/11"
msgid "---but we may never know what happens."
msgstr "...pero tal vez nunca sepamos el resultado."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/37/scene/1/record/12"
msgid "I just wish we could do something more for them, sir."
msgstr "Ojalá pudiéramos hacer algo más por ellos, Señor."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/37/scene/1/record/13"
msgid "I know, son.  We did the best we could..."
msgstr "Lo sé, hijo. Hemos hecho todo lo que hemos podido..."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/37/scene/1/record/14"
msgid "...but now everything depends on the Firekka."
msgstr "...pero ahora todo depende de los Firekkan."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/37/scene/1/record/15"
msgid "$C, I'll need to see you in my office later."
msgstr "$C, quiero verle luego en mi oficina."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/37/scene/1/record/16"
msgid "Dismissed."
msgstr "Retírese."

msgctxt "sm2/BRIEFING.002/packet/37/scene/2/record/0"
msgid "$R!  You'd better get to Briefing right away!"
msgstr "¡$R! ¡Será mejor que vaya a la Sesión Informativa ahora mismo!"

